<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- Ibaas</book>
  <para style="h">AMatiyu</para>
  <para style="toc3">AMat</para>
  <para style="toc2">AMatiyu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ifɛ̀ Itek naton aYeso fɛ́ AMatiyu Jɛk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ifɛ̀ Itek naton aYeso fɛ́</para>
  <para style="mt1">AMatiyu</para>
  <para style="mt2">Jɛk</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="s">Ishara ifɛ̀ itek fɛ́ aMatiyu jɛk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">ALuka 3:23-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />Ayerek fɛ́ a se ni kufumung kang yet ayerek badakop aYeso Kristi, Arim agwɔm aDauda, ayɔng fɛ́ a ne ni izɔrɔk aIbrahim:<verse eid="MAT 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />AIbrahim yet ada aIshaku,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:2">aIshaku yet ada aYakub,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:2">aYakub yet ada aYahuda nɛ barunyining wu,<verse eid="MAT 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />aYahuda yet ada aFerez nɛ aZera, nggɔ ba yet aTamar,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:3">aFerez yet ada aHeziron,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:3">aHeziron yet ada Aram,<verse eid="MAT 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />Aram yet ada Aminadap,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:4">Aminadap yet ada aNashon,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:4">aNashon yet ada aSalmon,<verse eid="MAT 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />aSalmon yet ada aBowaz, wɛt nggɔ wu yet aRahab,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:5">aBowas yet ada aƆbet, wɛt nggɔ wu yet aRut,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:5">aƆbet yet ada aJesi,<verse eid="MAT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />wɛt aJesi yet ada agbat agwɔm aDauda,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:6">aDauda yet ada aSolomon, fi nggɔ wu tsang yet abining aUriya.<verse eid="MAT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />ASolomon yet ada aRehobowam,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:7">aRehobowam yet ada Abija,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:7">Abija yet ada Asaf,<verse eid="MAT 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />Asaf yet ada aJehoshafat,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:8">aJehoshafat yet ada aJehoram,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:8">aJehoram yet ada aUziya,<verse eid="MAT 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />aUziya yet ada aJotam,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:9">aJotam yet ada Ahas,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:9">Ahas yet ada aHezekiya,<verse eid="MAT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />aHezekiya yet ada aManase,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:10">aManase yet ada Amon,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:10">Amon yet ada aJosiya,<verse eid="MAT 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />aJosiya yet ada aJekoniya nɛ barunyining wu. Ni izen e yɔng fɛ́ ba kin sok nnon aIsrela sak ni isam na aBabila.<verse eid="MAT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />Ama fɛ́ ba tsɛ ni aIsrela isam na aBabila,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:12">aJekoniya yet ada aSheltiyel,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:12">aSheltiyel yet ada aZerubabel,<verse eid="MAT 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />aZerubabel yet ada Abihut,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:13">Abihut yet ada aEliyakim,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:13">aEliyakim yet ada Azor,<verse eid="MAT 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Azor yet ada aZadɔk,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:14">aZadɔk yet ada Akim,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:14">Akim yet ada aEliyud,<verse eid="MAT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />aEliyud yet ada aEleyazar,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:15">aEleyazar yet ada aMatan,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:15">aMatan yet ada aYakub,<verse eid="MAT 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />aYakub yet ada aYusufu amatek aMarya,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:16">aMarya me yɔng fɛ́ a tes aYeso</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:16">fɛ́ ba ku yes Anet-Isheshek.<verse eid="MAT 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />Kudot izɔrɔk fi ine nkum izen aIbrahim sak ni izen agwɔm aDauda se kusɔk abe anaas. Nkum izen agwɔm aDauda sak ni izen fɛ́ ba kin sok nnon aIsrela sak ni isam na aBabila se kusɔk abe anaas. Wat ikyɛng fi isok izen fɛ́ ba kin sok nnon aIsrela sak ni izen aYeso Kristi se kusɔk abe anaas ba.<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutes aYeso Kristi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">ALuka 2:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />Kutes aYeso Kristi kin se ane: Ni izen e yɔng ni nggɔ wu aMarya tsin bɛ̀ ishim iweneng nɛ aYusufu. Na ba resek dang ka ba moon ni weneng, a bɛ́ a sok kafa Abik aJɛrɛ. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />AYusufu fɛ́ a da sot amatek, bi nggɔn ntek, wɛt da a shim a te aMarya nsum ashon banet awo, nek a sok ni iyɛ wu fok ba da ka na kam yuu.<verse eid="MAT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />Ama fi iwu se ni kuyiring anɔng, atomaza aTisa ku wuruk na nabos, a fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;AYusufu arim aDauda, i bi fok nnyim i sok aMarya tɛ abining ngɔn awo, nek ikyɛng fi i se nafa wu, i ne na Kabik aJɛrɛ. <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" />A da tes nggon, ngɔn da ka ka te iyerek aYeso nek iwu wu a bi sheshek banet wu na anɛn bá.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Ngma nkyɔrɔk nang te anɔng, nɔng ba bin di shining ikyɛng fɛ́ Adakunom mang fɛ̀ na nu atan wu yɛ, <verse eid="MAT 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />&lt;&lt;Fok yin! Kanamang fɛ́ ka rēn amatek awo bi sok kafa, ka bi tes nggon, ba bi ka ka yes aImmanuwel.&gt;&gt; AImmanuwel yet, &lt;&lt;Adakunom se gung ni iyit.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Ni izen fɛ́ aYusufu shemeng ni nda, a nye ngma ikyɛng fɛ́ atomaza fɛ̀ ni wu, a sok aMarya te abining wu. <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" />Wat iwu rēn aMarya te abining awo, tit ama kutes nggon e. A ka ka bɔ iyerek aYeso.<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="s">Kubɛ́ bafi kutsik irēn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />Ama kutes aYeso na aBatalami ni mben aJudiya, na aHiridus tsin yet agbat agwɔm ni izen e yɔng. Banet kutsik irēn nse ádat, tsɛ na aRushelima, <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />ba se ni irisim, &lt;&lt;Ayɔng fɛ́ ba tes fɛ́ ayet agwɔm baYahuda me se kɛ? Iyit di yit àdat wu abatin, in bi in ku ya yit ntong.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Fɛ́ agwɔm aHiridus fok anɔng, a nɔ kudaam, gung nɛ banet aRushelima. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />Ama fɛ́ a mi tusung ngma bagbat áware, nɛ bágwɔm irēn ntsi aMusa, a ka ba rip karɔ fɛ́ ba fɛ̀ ba di ki tes Anet-Isheshek e. <verse eid="MAT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />Ba fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ni wɔp aBatalami ni mben aJudiya, nek ikyɛng de fɛ́ atan e kin jɛk,<verse eid="MAT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />&lt;Awɛt ngɔn aBatalami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">ni mben aJudiya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">ngɔn wu i rat awosong</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">ayɛt bágwɔm mben aYahuda awo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">nek ayɛt ngɔn wu fɛ́ agwɔm akak bi di ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">ayɔng fɛ́ a bi yet anek banet aIsrela.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />AHiridus yes banet kutsik irēn nse ádat e ni nɛt, a shim a rēn akpaf izen fi iba di di àdat e. <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />A ka ba tom sak na aBatalami me, a fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Tseng yin, tsi tsɛt yin nggon e yelel. Nɔng ki i sɛ yin ika, ni bi ni di tak yin, nɔng in da tsin in ka ka ya ntong.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9" />Ama fɛ́ ba ma fok ifɛ̀ agwɔm e, ba yit irèn, àdat e yɔng fɛ́ ba di iwu abatin, a ya kashon ni itseng ashon ba, a tsɛ a nyeseng narɔ fɛ́ ba di tes nggon e. <verse eid="MAT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10" />Ni izen fɛ́ ba tɛ ba di àdat e, ba nye iyɛ ikan hwyɛ awo. <verse eid="MAT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />Fɛ́ ba nɔ ari me, ba di nggon e ni nggɔ ka aMarya, ba te gururuk aben, ba ka ka ya ntong. Ama anɔng, ba tarak amala bá, ba nɔɔk kunang nkyɔrɔk itsɔm hwyɛ wo, ata asɛng, aluban nɛ amur<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">aluban nɛ amur</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Mkpe fɛ́ ba di fesem kurong fi in se hwyɔlɔl nɛ name ikon fɛ́ na se hwyɔlɔl.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Ba tɛ ba bun sak ni wɔp bá; ba kuus irèn ikak zɛɛt, nek Adakunom mi tsang ka ba kɔrɔk kuto na nabos, yɛ da na ba tɛ ba got narɔ aHiridus awo.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ba hwyet ni nggon e <optbreak /> sak na aMasat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Ama fɛ́ batsen e mi tseng, aTisa tom atomaza akak nɛ a tak aYusufu na nabos yɛ, &lt;&lt;Dorok, sok nggon e ni nggɔ ka hwyet yin sak na aMasat. Di wey yin azɔng ma in ki tak yin, nek aHiridus da kpa itsɛt ika nɔng a da fɛt.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Nek anɔng, aYusufu sok kabang nggon e ni nggɔ ka, ba yit irèn natuk sak na aMasat. <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" />Ba sot azɔng sak izen iku aHiridus. Na anɔng fɛ́ ba di shining ikyɛng fɛ́ aTisa kin fɛ̀ nanu atan: &lt;&lt;Na aMasat wu in yes ari hom.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">AHiridus fɛɛs nnon nabaane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Ni izen fɛ́ aHiridus rēn fok banet kurēn nse ádat mi ku sak kyɛw, a kpa fes makiyi, a nɔɔk ifɛ̀ fok na ba fɛɛs ngma nnon namatek e fɛ́ na se nkum ayɛ afaa sak aben, fɛ́ na se ni wɔp aBatalami ni nwɔp in bakat, a sok kpaf izen fɛ́ banet kurēn nse ádat fɛ̀ ni iwu. <verse eid="MAT 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Na anɔng, ikyɛng fɛ́ atan aIrimiya kin fɛ̀ di shining,<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />&lt;&lt;Ba fok nkun banet na Arama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">nanak nɛ kafa kawe makiyi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">Na aRahila tsin tos nek nnon wu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">A rawu dang shan akabɔk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">nek na mi kus.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 31:15">ARimiya 31:15</ref></char>. </note><verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYusufu tɛ a bun sak na aNazarat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />Ama iku aHiridus, atomaza aTisa tonong ice wu sak na aYusufu na nabos na aMasat, <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />a fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Dorok, sok kabang nggon e ni nggɔ ka, ti bun sak ni mben aIsrela, nek bayɔng fɛ́ ba se ni itsɛt kutset nggon e, ba mi kus.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Nek anɔng, a dorok a sok nggon e ni nggɔ ka, ba tseng sak ni mben aIsrela. <verse eid="MAT 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Awɛt fɛ́ a fok yɛ Arkilayus wu a tsin ya igwɔm akatek wu aHiridus ni mben aJudiya, a fok nnyim ibun azɔng, nek ikyɛng fɛ́ ba mi ku tak na nabos, nek anɔng, ba kana kɔrɔk ba tsɛ ba sonong abak aGalili, <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" />ba tsɛ ba sot na kabang wɔp fɛ́ ba yes ika aNazaret. Na anɔng ba di shining ikyɛng fɛ́ ba kin jɛk yɛ, &lt;&lt;Ba bi ku yes anet aNazaret.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="s">AYohana anet aBatisma nye irèn e</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">AMarkus 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">ALuka 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">AYohana 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />Ni nnom e yɔng, aYohana anet aBatisma ne, a shara banet ifɛ̀ ayɛt atse aJudiya <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" />na nye na banet, &lt;&lt;Wosong yin anɛn yin, nek igwɔm azanɛn mi bɛ́ bakat.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" />Iwu yong fɛ́ atan aIshaya kun di cɛɛt naton wu yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">&lt;&lt;Kutɔ anet fi ku nye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 3:3">gbash iyes na tse yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">&lt;Nye yin irèn fɛ aTisa di ki got,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 3:3">nabak yin naban irén tabat mok iwu.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />Ares fɛ́ aYohana tes ina, ba nye ina na akwoy itsaap-igung, kudun irosom awit wu kun yet kukpa. Nayak wu kun yet itsé ni itong nating. <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Banet nes na aRushelima nɛ bafɛ́ abak aJudiya ngma kusum nɛ bafi nwɔp fi in se nasamang ikyɛk aJodan. <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />Ba taas anɛn bá, ni wu ka ba ras abatisma ni kukyɛk aJodan.<verse eid="MAT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />Ni izen fɛ́ aYohana di BaFarasi nɛ BaSadusi tseng sak ibɛ narɔ fi iwu tsin di ras abatisma, a fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Iyin áhyén! Angan ki tabak yin ni iteng yin ishɔt fi iwuruk ɛ? <verse eid="MAT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />Nye yin ikyɛng fi i da tonong fok i mi won yin anɛn yin sak ishan atsak. <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" />I bi ka woso tsosok yin agwɔm ni inye yin yɛ, adakop yit yet aIbrahim awo! Won in ki tak yin, Adakunom bi ízɔk fɛ́ a da donong ata nà, na a sot nnon aIbrahim. <verse eid="MAT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" />Yɔkɔnɔng ana ba mi sak kutɛm na áney atin-akon, ngma kakon fɛ́ ka raka dang korok kutes, ba da tɛmɛng ika, na ba ma barak ika ni rong.<verse eid="MAT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />&lt;&lt;Imi ki ras yin abatisma nɛ ashi nek iwosong anɛn yin sak ishan atsak. Awɛt ayɔng fɛ́ a da bɛ́ ama hom, di wat ni kukyem, imi rat ni in sok kukpatak wu. Iwu bi ki ra yin abatisma nɛ Kabik aJɛrɛ ni kurong. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />Kube iwum kazu wu se ni bɔk wu, a da wum kazu wu, na ma tusung ica nayak sak ni imyɛ, na ma shosh ahwye me ni rong fi ku ya vit igang.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">ABatisma aYeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">AMarkus 1:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">ALuka 3:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Ni izen e yɔng, aYeso ne na aGalili sak na aJodan nɔng aYohana bin ku ra abatisma. <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />Awɛt aYohana tsɛt kɛ a rawu, a fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Imi wu in tsɛt ngɔn ni i di ra imi abatisma, akyɛ sak ngɔn da bɛ́ ni imi yɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Wat aYeso fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Won ni sot anɔng yɔkɔnɔng; I se yɛɛt ni in nye yit anɔng ba bin di shining ikyɛng fɛ́ Adakunom shim.&gt;&gt; AYohana anɛ shim a ku ra ne.<verse eid="MAT 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />Nkum fɛ́ ba gang ira aYeso abatisma, a wuruk ayɛt ashi, ni izen izining kazanɛn wat ka tarak, a di Kabik Adakunom tsin tisik naton wu tɛ abɔp ka di nak ni wu. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" />Wat kutɔ ne azanɛn, yɛ, &lt;&lt;Ari hom yong, fi in kushim makiyi, in bɛ itɛrɛk iyɛ ni wu.&gt;&gt;<figure style="fig" alt="Jesus' baptism" file="WA03810b.tif" size="col" loc="MAT 3:17" copy="Wade Images" ref="3:13-17">Ba tsin ra aYeso aBatisma</figure><verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="s">Imara aYeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">AMarkus 1:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">ALuka 4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />Ama anɔng, Kabik aJɛrɛ tsa aYeso sak ayɛt ayit nɔng aShetan bin ku mara. <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />Ama itemak kanu nnom nsɔk nnaas nɛ natuk nsɔk nnaas, izong kudaam. <verse eid="MAT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Anet imara me bɛ́ a ku sɛ, a fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Ki ngɔn yet Arim Adakunom, fɛ̀ na ata nang na sot akpam.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" />AYeso ku bun ni ifɛ̀ yɛ, &lt;&lt;I se ni ijɛk ni ifumung Adakunom yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:4">&lt;Na nayak na kyɛk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:4">fɛ́ anet di sɛs kutset awo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:4">tit ni ifɛ̀ fi ines</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:4">narɔ Adakunom de.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />AShetan e tɛ a ku sok sak ni kuwɔp ku jɛrɛ, aRushelima, a ku sak a nyeseng ni iriyɔng kutu iya Adakunom ntong. <verse eid="MAT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" />A fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ki ngɔn yet Arim Adakunom, barak ice ngɔn sak aben. Nek i se ni ijɛk,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">&lt;Adakunom bi nɔɔk batomaza wu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">kanu icɛɛt naton ngɔn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">wat iba bi da bereng tɛrɛrɛ ni mbɔk bá,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">da ba bi won ni turuk kutak ni kuta awo.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />AYeso tɛ a fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;I se ni ijɛk, &lt;I bi mara aTisa Adakunom ngɔn awo.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />AShetan e tɛ a ku sok a ngarak ni iwu naton ihwyanang ikak fi i yet isɔp makiyi. A ku tonong nzam-nzam igwɔm azatse ni nta na, <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />a fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ngma nkyɔrɔk na da sot nfɔɔn, ki ngɔn te gururuk i di ya ntong.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Dorok azeng aShetan! I se ni ijɛk yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:10">&lt;Ya aTisa Adakunom ngɔn ntong,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:10">iwu aziwu kyɛk fi i da ku ra isam.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Ama anɔng, aShetan tseng a ku won, batomaza bɛ́, ba ku sɛ mo.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso kpa ishara ifɛ̀</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">AMarkus 1:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">ALuka 4:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />Ni izen fɛ́ aYeso fok yɛ ba mi te aYohana ari inyang, a tɛ bun sak na aGalili. <verse eid="MAT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" />A won aNazaret, a tsɛ sot na aKafarnahum, kuwɔp anu kudúng fi ku se bakat nɛ aZebulum nɛ aNaftali, <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />mok ba di shining ikyɛng fɛ́ atan aIshaya kin fɛ̀,<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />&lt;&lt;Mben aZebulum nɛ mben aNaftali,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">iyin fi i se yin ni irèn sak ni kudúng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:15">ni kunyi aJodan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">ngɔn aGalili afi Ícɛn-iduk!<verse eid="MAT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />Banet fɛ́ ba resek ayɛt nhwyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">ba mi di mgbey nratek;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">naton bayɔng fɛ́ ba resek ni mben</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">fi iku mi ka ba te gip,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">karɔ mi ki te yin weshek.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />Nkum izen e yɔng, aYeso tumung ishara banet ifɛ̀ yɛ, &lt;&lt;Wosong yin anɛn yin, nek igwɔm azanɛn mi bɛ̀ bakat.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso yes bafi imɛɛs imɛsɛng e</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">AMarkus 1:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">ALuka 5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Izen fɛ́ aYeso se ni kutseet ni fam izek aGalili, a di banet bafaa, aSiman fɛ́ ba ku yes aBitrus, nɛ arunyining Andarawus. Ba se ni bara agunung ayɛt izek, nek iba yet bafi iyisik ìzos. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Bɛ́ yin, di kuus yin mo, in da ki sak yin, ni i sot yin bafi iyisik banet.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />Zɛng-ngɛ-ziri, ba wat ba wosong agunung bá, ba kpa ku kuus mo.<verse eid="MAT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />A ya kashon ni kutseet, a sɛ banet bafaa bà, aYakubu arim aZebedi nɛ arunyining aYohana. Ba se ayɛt kukyɛ ashi nɛ ada ba aZebedi, ba se ni inye agunung bá. AYeso ka ba yes, <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />Zɛng-ngɛ-ziri, ba wosong kukyɛ ashi bá, nɛ ada bá, ba ku kuus mo.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso tes banet kyang</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">ALuka 6:17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />AYeso teng a tsees kaakyɛ na aGalili, na tees banet na narɔ inyis baYahuda, na a shara ifɛ̀ itek ifi igwɔm, na tes kyang kaakyi nri nrɔk, ni ndaam fɛ́ banet bɔrɔng e. <verse eid="MAT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />Na anɔng wu, kucɛɛt wu teng ku tseng kaakyɛ ni mben aSiriya. Nek anɔng, banet del na bafi nzam-nzam nrɔk, bayɔng fɛ́ ba bɔrɔng makiyi, bafi nrɔk ítseng, bafi ikus itsitsiring, nɛ bayɔng fɛ́ aduru nrɔm bá mi kus, iwu ka ba tes kyang. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Kudyɛng banet fɛ́ ba ne na aGalili, nɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba ne na aDikapolis<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="fk">aDikapolis</char>: <char style="ft" closed="false">Ni ilem aGirik yet naban nwɔp kusɔk.</char></note>, nɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba ne na aRushelima, nɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba ne ni mben aJudiya, nɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba ne ni nyi kuya kufi kukyɛk aJodan, teng ba ku kuus mo.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="s">AYeso ras banet itees <optbreak /> naton ihwyanang</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">ALuka 6:20-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />Ni izen fɛ́ a di kudyɛng banet e, a ngarak naton ihwyanang, a sonong. Bafi imɛɛs wu tse narɔ wu, <verse eid="MAT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />a kpa ka ba tees yɛ,<verse eid="MAT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />&lt;&lt;Awɛng se gung na bayɔng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:3">fɛ́ ba yet bakan na abik,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:3">nek ba mi sot bafi igwɔm azanɛn.<verse eid="MAT 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />Awɛng se gung na bayɔng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:4">fɛ́ ba bɛ̀ kafa kawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:4">nek Adakunom bi ka ba men ayɛ.<verse eid="MAT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />Awɛng se gung na bafi nhwyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:5">nek Adakunom bi ka ba nɔɔk kazatse.<verse eid="MAT 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />Awɛng se gung na bayɔng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:6">fɛ́ ba foos izong, ni iyɛ ingash ira atsak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:6">nek Adakunom bi ka ba nesek ihwyas.<verse eid="MAT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />Awɛng se gung na bayɔng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:7">fɛ́ ba foos angmishish,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:7">nek Adakunom bi ka ba tonong angmishish bà.<verse eid="MAT 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />Awɛng se gung na bayɔng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:8">fɛ́ ayɛ ba se cɛ́l,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:8">nek ba bi di Adakunom.<verse eid="MAT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />Awɛng se gung na bayɔng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:9">fɛ́ ba monoso kusonong kukyang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:9">nek ba bi ka ba yes nnon Adakunom.<verse eid="MAT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />Awɛng se gung na bayɔng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:10">fɛ́ ba ka ba nesek iyɔm nek kusot atsak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:10">nek ba mi sot bafi igwɔm azanɛn.<verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />&lt;&lt;Awɛng se gung ni iyin ni izen fɛ́ banet ki tosong yin, na ba ki nesek yin iyɔm, na ba di bɔs nbɔs ni yin, na ba ki nyes yin nzam-nzam anyas, nek i yet yin bafi ikuus hom. <verse eid="MAT 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" />Nye yin iyɛ ikan makiyi, nek izang yin yet iratek azanɛn, nek kpaf anɔng wu, fɛ́ ba kin nesek batan ashon iyɔm.<verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itees naton kusot ti <optbreak /> ntɔk ni mgbey</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:50">AMarkus 9:50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">ALuka 14:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />&lt;&lt;Iyin wu i yet yin ntɔk azatse. Awɛt ki ntɔk e wey kuta ná, nɛ anɛ fɛ́ ba da tɛ ba di te kuta ni na yɛ? In da sot vit ikyɛng fɛ́ ba da tɛ ba di nye ni ina, tit na ba nosong ina, nɛ banet shɛsh ina.<verse eid="MAT 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />&lt;&lt;Iyin ba i yet yin mgbey azatse. Kuwɔp fi ku se ni igung, ba kyem ba nɛt iko awo. <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" />Vit anet fɛ́ a ta kurong na agaramun, na ma fam iko na katsereng. Ikyɛng fɛ́ ba nye yet, ba saas iko narɔ kagarang, ni ku nesek kaangan mgbey ari me. <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" />I se kpaf anɔng, won mgbey yin ni in ron nate banet, nɔng ba bin di ntomong yin ntek, nɔng ba bin di tere Ada yin fɛ́ a se azanɛn.<verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso bɛ́ nek ishining Ntsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />&lt;&lt;Iyin di yin ti imi bɛ́ nek in bi in buruk ntsi aMusa ni ikyɛng fɛ́ batan kin jɛk ɛ? Awɛy! Imi bɛ́ nek in bi in shinishi ina. <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" />Won in ki tak yin atsak, ma ba buruk kazanɛn nɛ kazatse, vit itin ijɛk, ke kizizɔ́ fɛ́ ka da wey ni Ntsi, ma ba shining kaakyi ikyɛng ninyɛn. <verse eid="MAT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />Nek anɔng, ngma anet fɛ́ a beseng ntsi fi nwat mbaane, a di tees banet fok na ba nye anɔng, ba bi ku sak na a sot afɛ́ ama ayet igwɔm azanɛn. Awɛt ayɔng fɛ́ a ras, na tees ikyɛng fi ntsi Adakunom fɛ̀, ba bi ku yes aratek ni igwɔm azanɛn. <verse eid="MAT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />Nek in tsin ki tak yin yɛ, ki kusot atsak yin wat kufɛ́ BaFarasi nɛ bafi itees ntsi aMusa awo, vit iyin ni inɔ ayɛt igwɔm azanɛn.<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso ra itees naton <optbreak /> ifɛɛs banet, ni iyɛ ife</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:57-59">ALuka 12:57-59</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />&lt;&lt;Iyin mang fok yin fok ba kin tak banet ashon, &lt;Da i bi fɛt akak awo, nɛk ngma anet yɔng fɛ́ a fɛt akak, ba da ku ra ishɔt.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" />Awɛt imi tsin ki tak yin yɛ, ngma anet yɔng fɛ́ a bɛ̀ kafa kawe na arunyining, ba da ku ra ishɔt. Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ tosong arunyining, ba da tse ni iwu nazumung bashɔn. Awɛt ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a yes akak, &lt;Kushɔp&gt; a da se na awey inɔ ari irong.<verse eid="MAT 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" />&lt;&lt;Nek anɔng, ki i tsin nɔɔk kunang ngɔn ni kuta ashosh, azɔng kuyiring da bɛ́ fok arunyining bɛ̀ kafa kawe ni ngɔn, <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" />won kunang ngɔn azɔng ashon kuta ashosh e, tun tseng, tsi kana nye yin nɛ arunyining ninyen, i da ni ibun, ni nabak kunang ngɔn.<verse eid="MAT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />&lt;&lt;Ke akak bɛ̀ kucɛɛt ni ngɔn, fɛ́ a shim a te kukun ngɔn nitu ishɔt. Kpa tɔ ni iwu gyam, ni ren resek yin dang ta yin nitu ishɔt e, ke da anɔng awo, a da ka nabak ni bɔk anet ishɔt, ne anet ishɔt da nabak ni bɔk nggon ishɛn, nɛ ba tse ba da te kpaf ari inyang. <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />Won in da tak atsak, vit ngɔn ni iwuruk, tit ma itarang kaakyɛ abɔk fɛ́ ba da kuus.<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">I bi ra kujang awo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />&lt;&lt;Iyin kin mang fok yin fɛ́ ba kin fɛ̀, &lt;Da i bi ra kujang awo.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Awɛt imi tsin fɛ̀ ni iyin fok, ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a yɛrɛk abining na foos ikɔk wu, a mi ra kujang ni iwu ni iyɛ wu. <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" />Ki iyisi ngɔn ifi kuyak, da bɛ́s ni ikpas, kobok ide, i da barak ide atsá. Iwat gyat ni ibit abak irɔm ngɔn akak aza yɔng fɛ́ ba da barak kurɔm ngɔn ngma kusum ari irong. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" />Ki kubɔk iyak ngɔn da bɛ́s ni ikpas ni inɛn, tɛn iko, barak iko atsá. Iwat gyat ni ibit abak irɔm ngɔn akak, aza yɔng fi kurɔm ngɔn kusum da tsi ku nɔ ari irong.<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso tees naton ikam kuweneng</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:9">AMatiyu 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">AMarkus 10:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">ALuka 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />&lt;&lt;Ba kin fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a kam kuweneng nɛ abining wu, i se gbingbing na a ku nɔk kufumung ikam iweneng.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" />Awɛt imi tsin fɛ̀ ni iyin fok, ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a kam nɛ abining wu, ke da nek inɛn kujang awo, a tsin te abining e ni kujang, ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a bɔ abining e, a tsin ra kujang.<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itees naton kushi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />&lt;&lt;Iyin kin mang ti i fok yin fɛ́ ba kin fɛ̀ nɛ banet ashon, &lt;Da i bi tɛn yin kushi awo, bereng yin kushi fi i mi nye yin sak nɛ aTisa.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" />Awɛt imi tsin fɛ̀ ni yin, da i bi nye yin kushi ko gyet awo. I bi nye yin kushi nɛ kazang awo, nek ka yet kuta isonong igwɔm Adakunom yɔng. <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" />Ke ni nye yin kushi nɛ kazatse awo, nek ka yet karɔ isaas atak Adakunom. Ke ni i nye yin kushi ni aRushelima awo, nek ka yet kuwɔp Agbat Agwɔm. <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />Da i bi nye yin kushi ni ice yin awo, nek iyin da kyem i te yin kukwey ice kuzining ni ku tɛrɛk ke ni ku webek awo. <verse eid="MAT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />Won &lt;Ey&gt; yin na a sot &lt;Ey&gt;, na &lt;Awɛy&gt; yin na a sot &lt;Awɛy&gt;, ikyɛng fi i got anɔng, i ne na amaan e.<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kɛ akak tun iyisi afidang <optbreak /> ba da ku tun ifuu bà</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:29-30">ALuka 6:29-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />&lt;&lt;Iyin kin mang fok yin fɛ́ ba kin fɛ̀, &lt;Anet fɛ́ a tun afidang iyisi, ba da ku tun ifuu bá, ke inyi fɛ́ a tun afidang e ayi, na ba ku tun inyi bà.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Awɛt imi tsin fɛ̀ ni yin, ke akak ki bɛ́ yin nɛ anyas, i bi ti i ku bun yin mo ni ifà wo. Ke anet akak da rus kufok iyak, ku tirik kufi imen bà. <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Ke anet akak tse kukun ngɔn nitu ishɔt, nɔng a da bin shan kukpin ngɔn, ku nɔɔk ngma ni ikyɛng ifamasa irɔm ngɔn. <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />Ke anet akak da te mo gbingbing fok ni i nye yin kutseet akilo azining, tseng ni iwu sak akilo afaa. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />Nɔk kaangan ikyɛng fɛ́ a bɛ́ itsɛt ni ngɔn, i bi rone ni kuta na ayɔng fɛ́ a bi itsɛt kukɔp ni ngɔn awo.<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso tees naton itonong <optbreak /> Ishim sak bafi ifa ni ngɔn</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:27-28">ALuka 6:27-28</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">32-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />&lt;&lt;I ki mang fok yin fɛ́ ba kin fɛ̀, &lt;Shim afidang isot ngɔn, ni rangɔn afi ifa ngɔn.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" />Awɛt imi tsin fɛ̀ ni yin: Shim yin bafi ifa yin, ras yin bayɔng fɛ́ ba ki nesek yin iyɔm awon, <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />nɔng i da sot yin nnon Ada yin fɛ́ a se azanɛn. Iwu fɛ́ a saas kunom ni ku tat naton bafɛ́ anyas nɛ batek, na tɛ na toos ni iza sak naton bafi kusot atsak nɛ bafi nhwyi. <verse eid="MAT 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Ki i shim yin wɔn bayɔng fɛ́ ba ki shim yin kyɛk, akyɛ izang fi i da sɛ yin ɛ? Bafi ishashang itsɔm mben, nyes anɔng bà awɛ? <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Ki i nye ashow bafidang yin kyɛk, akyɛ de fi i tsin nye yin fi i got i fɛ́ bakak ɛ? Banet fɛ́ ba yet bafi nhwyi pet ba ras anɔng awɛ? <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" />Nek anɔng, tseng yin kpaf, kyɔn tɛ Ada yin di se kpaf.<verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="s">AYeso ras itees <optbreak /> naton Inesek Kunang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />&lt;&lt;Nye yin yɛɛt kɔn kutomong kutek yin, bi sot kufi iyɛrɛ ayisi, nek ki i nye yin anɔng, vit iyin ni i sɛ izang narɔ Ada yin fɛ́ a se naton azanɛn.<verse eid="MAT 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />&lt;&lt;Nek anɔng, izen fi i tsin nesek yin bayɔng fɛ́ ba yet bakan kunang, i bi fɛsɛm yin ádurung naton e awo, anɔng wu fɛ́ bafɛ́ nanu nafifaa di ras na narɔ inyis nɛ naton irén, nɔng banet da ka ba tere mo. Won in ki tak yin atsak, ba mi tsang shan nkum izang bá yɔng. <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />I se gyat, ngma izen fi i shim i nye kunang, i bi won kubɔk imen ngɔn ni ku rēn ikyɛng fi kubɔk iyak ngɔn shim ku nye awo, <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />nɔng kunang ngɔn bin se ni nɛt. Na anɔng wu fɛ́ Ada ngɔn fɛ́ a yɛrɛ ngma ikyɛng fɛ́ ba ras ni nɛt, da ka nɔk izang ngɔn.<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso ra itees <optbreak /> naton awon</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">ALuka 11:2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />&lt;&lt;Izen fi i da ra yin awon, i bi ra yin awon tɛ bafɛ́ nanu nafifaa awo, nek iba shim iras awon tsik ni nyeseng nɛ na narɔ inyis baYahuda nɛ naton irén, nɔng banet bin ka ba yɛrɛ. Won in ki tak yin atsak, ba mi tsang shan nkum izang bá yɔng. <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Awɛt i sɛ gyat, ngma izen fi i shim i ra yin awon, nɔ yin ayɛt itu yin, fam yin katitu, ra yin awon sak na Ada yin yɔng fɛ́ a se ni nɛt. Awɛt Ada yin yɔng fɛ́ a yɛrɛ ikyɛng fɛ́ ba ras ni nɛt, da ki nɔk yin izang yin. <verse eid="MAT 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" />Izen fi i se yin na awon e, i bi woso itoos yin kucɛɛt tɛ banet fɛ́ ba se vit Adakunom awo, nek kuyiring bá yet fok ayet iwoso itoos e wu i da sak ba ka ba fok mo. <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" />I bi nye yin ti iba awo, nek Ada yin rēn ikyɛng fi i shim yin gyam dang ni i ku rip yin.<verse eid="MAT 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />&lt;&lt;Ane wu fi i da ras yin awon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">&lt;Ada yit fɛ́ a se azanɛn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:9">won iyerek ngɔn ni isot jɛrɛ,<verse eid="MAT 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />won igwɔm ngɔn ni ibɛ́,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:10">won na ba ras ikyɛng fi ngɔn shim azatse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:10">kyɔn tɛ ba di ras naton aza.<verse eid="MAT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />Ki nɔk yit kuyak ininom.<verse eid="MAT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />Ki fuut yit anɛn yit,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:12">kyɔn ti iyit di fuut yit bayɔng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:12">fɛ ba ki ras yit anɛn.<verse eid="MAT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />Ngɔn bi ki won yit,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:13">ni in nɔ yit,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:13">ni imara awo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:13">awɛt ki tun yit ni bɔk aShetan.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />&lt;&lt;Nek ki iyin fuut yin banet fɛ́ ba ki ra yin inɛn, anɛn ba, Ada yin fɛ́ a se azanɛn, da ki fuut yin anɛn yin bà. <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" />Awɛt ki da iyin fuut yin banet anɛn ba awo, Ada yin da ki fuut yin anɛn afiin awo.<verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso ras itees <optbreak /> naton itemak kanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />&lt;&lt;Izen fi i se yin ni itemak kanu, i bi sot yin mu tɛ bafɛ́ nanu nafifaa di nye awo, Nek ba tsip ayisi bá nɔng banet da bin rēn fok ba tsin ra itemak kanu. Won in ki tak yin atsak, ba mi tsang shan nkum izang bá yɔng. <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" />Awɛt ki i se yin ni itemak kanu, kusu yin ayisi, ni kon yin name ni ice, <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" />kɔn itemak kanu yin bi sot ikyɛng iyɛrɛ banet, nek Ada yin fɛ́ se ni nɛt kyɛk. Iwu Ada yin fɛ́ a tsin yɛrɛ ni nɛt da ki nɔɔk yin izang yin.<verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itusung kurúm azanɛn</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">ALuka 12:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />&lt;&lt;I bi tusung yin ace yin kurúm azeng azatse awo, narɔ fi ize ni ibush beseng iko, ke na bakpatang tsɛ ba fo na ba yi ayi. <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" />Kaduk ni itusung yin ace yin kurúm azanɛn, karɔ fɛ́ vit ize ni ibush fi i da tsi ibeseng, ke fɛ bakpatang da tsɛ ba fo na ba di yi awo. <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />Nek karɔ fi kurúm anet di se, azɔng wu fi kuyiring wu di nak bà.<verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />&lt;&lt;Ayisi na a yet agaramun irɔm. Ke ayisi ngɔn yet atek, kurɔm ngɔn burang da sɛ mgbey. <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />Awɛt ke ayisi ngɔn yet atset awo, kurɔm ngɔn kusum da se ngmalak, nek anɔng, ki mgbey fi in se ayɛt ngɔn in mi sot ahwyi, na tsak e ahwyi me da risik ngmalak.<verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />&lt;&lt;Vit anet fɛ́ a da kyem a ra batek ari bafaa isam. Tit na rawu azining, na a shim azining e, ke na te nhwyɛ wu na azining, na byɛs azining ayi. I da kyem ira yin Adakunom isam ni tsin di ra yin itsɔm isam ni izen izining awo.<verse eid="MAT 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yirik yin kudaam yin na aTisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />&lt;&lt;Nek anɔng, i mi tsin fɛ̀ ni iyin, i bi sak yin kudaam yin naton, ikyɛng iya, ke ifi sɔ, ke ikyɛng fi i da te yin ni irɔm awo. Kutset yin wat nayak awɛ? Kurɔm yin wat ares ite awɛ? <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" />Yɛrɛ yin nanon aton aza, da na tuus kuyak ke na na tusung nayak ni ikɔ awo, da na bi imyɛ awo, ngma na anɔng, Ada yin fɛ́ a se naton aza ya, ni ina. Iyin wat yin nanon ni ízɔk awɛ? <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />Angan ayɛt yin nek kudot kudaam wu, a da kyem a di barang kizen hyihyit naton kutset wu yɛ?<verse eid="MAT 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />&lt;&lt;Akyɛ sak fi iyin mak daam yin ace yin naton ares ɛ? Di yin fɛ́ ashoy ayit rasak. Da a ra kutomong ki ibat awo. <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" />Ngma na anɔng, agwɔm aSolomon ayɛt ízɔk wu, man kyem a te ares tɛ azining na awo. <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Iyin fi i bɛ̀ yin inɔɔk atsak hyihyit, ke Adakunom kyem a zem agam ayit yɔng fɛ́ a se ni kutset atut natson na ba te ni irong, a da ki te yin ares fɛ́ a wat ayɔng awɛ? <verse eid="MAT 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" />Nek anɔng, i bi daam yin ace yin yɛ, &lt;Akyɛ fi in da ya yit ɛ, akyɛ fi in da sɔ yit ɛ, akyɛ fi in da te yit ɛ?&gt; awo. <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" />Nek banet fɛ́ ba se ni nhwyi, kuri nkyɔrɔk fɛ́ ba tsɛsɛk yɔng, ama anɔng, Ada yin fɛ́ a se naton aza rēn fok iyin shim in ina ba. <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" />Tun tsɛsɛk yin igwɔm Adakunom ni itek de ni inyen. Ama anɔng, ngma nkyɔrɔk e nang da sot nfiin bà. <verse eid="MAT 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />Nek anɔng, i bi daam yin na katson awo, nek katson bi bɛ́ ni kudaam ka. Kaakyi kunom bi kudaam ko.<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="s">Itsɛɛk bakak ishɔt</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:37-38">ALuka 6:37-38</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:41-42">41-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />&lt;&lt;I bi tsɛk yin bakak ishɔt awo, kɔn Adakunom bi ki tsɛɛt yin ishɔt ba. <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" />Nek kuri ishɔt fi i tsɛk yin bakak e, anɔng wu fɛ́ Adakunom bi ki tsɛɛt yin ne, kuri ikyɛng imaas fi i di maas yin bakak ne, ni kuri ye fɛ́ Adakunom bi ki maas yin mo ne.<verse eid="MAT 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />&lt;&lt;Akyɛ sak fi ngɔn yɛrɛ kabi nkukɔ yɔng fɛ́ ka se ni iyisi arunyining, ni i won dang daam ni kukum yɔng fi ku se ni iyisi ngɔn ɛ? <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />Na anɛ fi ngɔn da fɛ̀ na arunyining yɛ, &lt;Won in da tun kabi nkukɔ yɔng fɛ́ ka se ni iyisi ngɔn,&gt; ni kukum momo ni iyisi ifɔɔn ɛ? <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />Ngɔn anet nanu nafaa, tun kukum yɔng fi ku se ni iyisi ngɔn ninyɛn, nɔng i da kyem i di yɛrɛ dɛdɛt, nɔng i di ki tun kabi nkukɔ fɛ́ ka se ni iyisi arunyining e.<verse eid="MAT 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />&lt;&lt;Da i bi nɔɔk yin ákabu ikyɛng fi i se jɛrɛ awo, da i bi barak yin áza ata itsɔm yin awo. Ki i nye yin anɔng, a da shɛsh ina na atak na, na ama tirik na a ki sarak yin acɛk-acɛk e.<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Risim yin, tsɛsɛk yin, <optbreak /> yes yin</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">ALuka 11:9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />&lt;&lt;Risim yin, ba da ki nɔɔk yin; tsɛsɛk yin, i da sɛs yin; yes yin, ba da ki fok yin na ba ki tarak yin katitu me. <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" />Nek ngma anet fɛ́ a risim, a shashang; ayɔng fɛ́ a tsɛsɛk, a sɛs, ayɔng fɛ́ a yes, ba ku foos na ba ku tarak ne.<verse eid="MAT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />&lt;&lt;Angan ayɛt yin, fi ki nggon wu ku rip akpam, fɛ́ a da ka ka nɔɔk kuta ari? <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Ke ki nggon e ku rip ìzos, na ma ka ka nɔɔk ihwyen ɛ? <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" />Ki iyin fi i bɛ̀ yin anyas, ngma na anɔng, i rēn nyes yin nnang ntek sak ni nnon yin, awɛt Ada yin fɛ́ a se na azanɛn da mak nesek nnang ntek sak na bayɔng fɛ́ ba ku rip! <verse eid="MAT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />Nek anɔng, ayɛt akaakyɛ, nye yin bakak ikyɛng fi iyin shim yin ba ki ra yin e, nek igang ntsi aMusa ni ijɛk batan yɔng.<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Katitu ka Hyoot <optbreak /> nɛ ka Gbey</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />&lt;&lt;Nɔ yin abak katitu ka hyoot e, nek katitu fɛ́ ka se gbey, ka se byɛrɛ ni itsaas banet sak ni irèn iwɛs bá, banet dot di nɔɔs ni ka. <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />Awɛt katitu fɛ́ ka se hyoot, fɛ́ ka tsaas banet sak i sɛ kutset, banet gyet fɛ́ ba ses inɔs ka.<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kakon ni ica ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />&lt;&lt;Nye yin nhwyɛ nɛ batan mbɔɔs. Ba bɛs ni yin ti itsamang, awɛt ikyɛng fi iba yet, yet, afulul agbayɔrɔ. <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" />I da ka ba rēn yin nek kuri ntomong fɛ́ ba ras. Ba da kyem ba tsɛ ba kpe anap ni itsitsan ɛ? Ke na ba bɔs ica atafo ni itin itsitsan ɛ? <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />Idɔng anɔng, kaakyɛ kakon katek tes ica itek, nɛ kaduk tes ica iduk e. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />Kakon katek da kyem ka tes ica iduk e awo, ke na kakon kaduk e tes ica itek awo. <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" />Kaakyɛ kakon fɛ́ ka raka dang tes ica itek, ba da tɛmɛng kaman, ba da barak ika ayɛt irong. <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" />Nek anɔng, i da rēn yin batan mbɔɔs nek kuri ica fɛ́ ba tes.<verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />&lt;&lt;Da kaangan fɛ́ a nye ni imi, &lt;ATisa, aTisa,&gt; fɛ́ a bi nɔ ni igwɔm azanɛn awo, tit ma ayɔng fɛ́ a nyes ikyɛng fɛ́ Ada hom azanɛn shim. <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />Banet dot bi fɛ̀ ni imi atuk e yɔng yɛ, &lt;ATisa, aTisa, iyit kin taas yit ibes ni iyerek ngɔn, in di turung yit itseng ni iyerek ngɔn, in tung di ras yit ndiri ntomong abes awɛ?&gt; <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" />Awɛt imi bi fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;Imi mang ki rēn yin awo. Sek yin azeng, bafi ntomong anyas!&gt;<verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Atsitsɛng afi inok <optbreak /> ni ishɔp afi inok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />&lt;&lt;Nek anɔng ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a fok ifɛ̀ deng, a di ra kutomong, a se tɛ atsitsɛng anet fɛ́ a nok kari wu naton agbondong. <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Fi iza rɔbɔk, ákyɛk shinishi, awun kpa fɛsɛm, na a tsosok afam-itu me, ngma nɛ anɔng kutu nyeseng gak, nek ba ta itsik kutu me naton agbondong. <verse eid="MAT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />Awɛt ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a fok ifɛ̀ deng, a ma rawu dang di ra kutomong ni ide, a se nagbɔng ti ishɔp anet fɛ́ a nok kari naton izɛk. <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />Fi iza rɔbɔk, ákyɛk shinishi, awun kpa fɛsɛm, na a tsosok afam-itu me, kasa me nye aduk ikpa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />Ama fɛ́ aYeso mi gang kucɛɛt e, kudyɛng banet fɛ́ ba se azɔng ka ba te yɔɔt ni kuri itees wu, <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />nek a tees tɛ anet fɛ́ a bi ice, da tɛ bafi itees ntsi aMusa awo.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="s">AYeso te akparong kyang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Ni izen fɛ́ aYeso tik ni ihwyanang e, kudyɛng banet ku kuus mo. <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Akparong akak tsɛ, a te gururuk ashon aYeso, a fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;ATisa, ki ngɔn shim, i da kyem i di te jɛrɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />AYeso nabak kubɔk wu, a di ra anet e. A fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ey, imi shim, te kyang!&gt;&gt; Ni izen izining, ikparong wat iku won. <verse eid="MAT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" />AYeso ma fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Fok, i bi tak akak ikikak awo. Di berem tsi tonong àware ice ngɔn, nabak kunang fɛ́ aMusa fɛ̀, nɔng i da tonong fok a mi da te kyang.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inɔɔk atsak agbat atsom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />Ni izen fɛ́ aYeso nɔ na aKafarnahum, agbat atsom akak tsɛ a ku sɛ, a tsot akabɔk ni iwu. <verse eid="MAT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />A fɛ́ ni iwu yɛ, &lt;&lt;ATisa, asam hom se gbɛrɛk ari, a bɔrɔng makiyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;In da tsin in ku te kyang.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />Agbat atsom e fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;ATisa, imi kyem fi ngɔn da tse ari hom awo. Ngɔn fɛrɛng kyɛk, asam hom da te kyang. <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />Nek imi ice min, in se aben igwɔm, in bɛ̀ batsom aben ni imi. In fɛ̀ na a yo, &lt;Tseng,&gt; na tseng. Ni in fɛ̀ na a ya, &lt;Bɛ́,&gt; na bɛ́. In fɛ̀ na asam hom, &lt;Nye ide,&gt; na nye anɔng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Ni izen fɛ́ aYeso fok anɔng, a ku te yɔɔt, a fɛ̀ na bayɔng fɛ́ ba se ni iku kuus mo, &lt;&lt;Won in ki tak yin atsak, in mi kyem in sɛ akak ni aIsrela kusum fɛ́ a bɛ̀ kuri inɔɔk atsak anɔng awo. <verse eid="MAT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" />Imi fɛ̀ ni iyin banet dot bi nes abatin, nɛ abace, na ba sosok na ba ya amok gung nɛ aIbrahim, nɛ aIshaku, nɛ aYakub<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nɛ aIbrahim, nɛ aIshaku, nɛ aYakub</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: AIbrahim kun yet adakop afɛ́ ngma banet aIsrela, iwu yet itis mben aIsrela. AIshaku kun yet ari wu. AYakub fɛ́ ba ku te iyerek aIsrela, iwu kun yet arim aIshaku. Iba ba ba kin yet badakop ashon baYahuda.</char></note> ni igwɔm azanɛn. <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" />Awɛt ba bi woro nnon ari igwɔm amatse, ni rin, azɔng wu ba bi ya ának na ba ros anyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Awɛt aYeso fɛ̀ na agbat atsom e, &lt;&lt;Tseng! Kpaf ni inɔɔk atsak ngɔn, ba mi da nye ne.&gt;&gt; Ba te asam wu kyang kpaf ni izen e yɔng.<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso tes banet dot kyang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Ni izen fɛ́ aYeso nɔ ari aBitrus, a sɛ anekop aBitrus na meneng ni ifes. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />A ku ra ni kubɔk, ifes e wat i ku wosong, abining e dorok, a kpa ku nye ikyɛng iya.<verse eid="MAT 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />Fɛ́ kawuwuri nye, ba ku bɛ́s nɛ banet dot fi kurɔk itseng ka ba daam, a ka ba turung itseng e ni ifɛ̀, na tes bafi nrɔk kyang. <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" />Ba nye anɔng, ba bin di shining ikyɛng fɛ́ atan aIshaya kin fɛ̀ yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 8:17">&lt;&lt;A kin sok kugbɛrɛk yit,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 8:17">a fanang nrɔk yit.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikyɛng fi i da te nwaa ide <optbreak /> nek ikuus aYeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Ni izen fɛ́ aYeso di kudyɛng banet fɛ́ ba ku te nate, a fɛ̀ na ba tat sak ni nyi ku ya kufi izek e. <verse eid="MAT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />Wɛt anet itees ntsi aMusa akak bɛ́ ni wu, a fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Anet itees, imi da ka kuus mo sak kaakyɛ karɔ fi ngɔn di ki tse.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;ÁGbayɔrɔ bɛ̀ ábóng na, nanon bɛ̀ arɛ na, awɛt Arim Anet bɛ̀ karɔ ikɔs awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />Azining ayɛt bafi imɛɛs wu fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;ATisa, won in tsin nɛt ada hom ninyɛn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />Awɛt aYeso fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn di kuus mo, won nkom ni in nɛsɛk nkom bá.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso men ni itsombos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />AYeso ma nɔ ni kukyɛ ashi, bafi imɛɛs wu ku kuus mo. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />Ni izen izining, itsombos ikak tsi i ne makiyi ni izek e, nkum ashi fɛ́ a nɔɔs ayɛt kukyɛ ashi makiyi. Awɛt aYeso se ni nda. <verse eid="MAT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />Bafi imɛɛs e tsɛ ba ku shemeng, ba fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;ATisa, ki sheshek yit! Ashi da ki ya yit!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Iyin fi bɛ̀ yin inɔɔk atsak igyebet, akyɛ sak fi iyin bɛ̀ yin nnyim anɔng ɛ?&gt;&gt; A dorok, a gyɔng itsombos ni idoro ashi me, karɔ wat ka te yuu.<verse eid="MAT 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />Ikyɛng e te banet yɔɔt, ba fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Akyɛ kuri anet yong ɛ? Fɛ́ awun ni kuren ashi ku foos ifɛ̀ yɛ?&gt;&gt; <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus calms the storm" file="WA03848b.tif" size="col" loc="MAT 8:27" copy="Wade Images" ref="8:23-27">AYeso men ni itsombos</figure><verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso te banet irɔk itseng <optbreak /> bafaa kyang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />Ni izen fɛ́ a tsɛ a ta ni nyi ku ya kufi mben bafɛ́ aGadarin<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:28 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mben bafɛ́ aGadarin</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Afumung akak fɛ́ ba kin jɛk ni kubɔk na shon e bɛ̀ </char><char style="fqa">mben bafɛ́ aGerasa</char> ke &lt;&lt;mben bafɛ́ aGergesena&gt;&gt; ayɛt na.</note>, bafi kurɔk itsɛ́ng bafaa ne na arɛk bá, sak inyim nɛ aYeso. Nek kuren fɛ́ ba ras, vit anet fɛ́ a kyem a got irèn e yɔng. <verse eid="MAT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />Ba ta ntɔ yɛ, &lt;&lt;Arim Adakunom, akyɛ fi ngɔn tsɛt ni iyit ɛ? Ngɔn shim i bi i ki zoot yit ni izen yit resek dang nye yɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />Kukpara áza kuratek kin se ni iya kuyak sak ashon ba gyet. <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />Itsɛ́ng e tsot akabɔk na aYeso yɛ, &lt;&lt;Ki i da ki tun yit, ki won yit nin nɔ yit ayɛt áza na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Wat iwu fɛ̀ ni ide, &lt;&lt;Tsɛng yin!&gt;&gt; Nek anɔng, i wuruk, i tsi i nɔ ayɛt áza me, kukpara áza me ngma kusum, wat ku di berem ni kuren sak ni ice ibanang, a kpas ayɛt ashi, a kus. <verse eid="MAT 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />Banek áza me, ta itsi, sak ayɛt iwɔp, ba tsɛ ba taas banet ngma ikyɛng fi ite, ni ikyɛng fi ite na bafi kurɔk itseng e. <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />Banet iwɔp ngma kusum wuruk, ba tsɛ ba sɛ aYeso. Ni izen fɛ́ ba tsɛ ba ku sɛ, ba tsot akabɔk fok yɛ na ka ba won mben bá.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="s">AYeso te amɛrɛk anet kyang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />Wat aYeso nɔ ayɛt kukyɛ ashi, a tat sak ni nyi kuya ni iwɔp wu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">a tat sak ni nyi kuya ni iwɔp wu</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Kuwɔp wu yet aKafarnahum.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Azɔng wu, fɛ́ banet bakak ku bɛ́ na anet akak fi kurɔm se mɛrɛk, ni men na meneng. Fɛ́ aYeso di inɔɔk atsak ba, a fɛ̀ na anet irɔk e, &lt;&lt;Nggon in, ngɔn bi daam awo, ba mi da fuut anɛn ngɔn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />Awɛt ni izen fɛ́ bakak ayɛt bafi itees ntsi aMusa fok anɔng, ba kpa tɔ wɔɔn ba yɛ, &lt;&lt;Anet yong beseng iyerek Adakunom!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />AYeso rēn kuyiring bá, nek anɔng, a fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Akyɛ sak fi i bɛ̀ yin kuyiring kuduk e anɔng ɛ? <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />Ingan de fi iwat se byɛrɛ yɛ? Na ba fɛ̀, &lt;Ba mi da fuut anɛn ngɔn a,&gt; ke na ba fɛ̀, &lt;Dorok tsik, da tseng,&gt; ɛ? <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" />Awɛt nɔng i da rēn yin fok Arim Anet bi ice azeng azatse na a fuut anɛn.&gt;&gt; A da nɛ tirik, a fɛ̀ nɛ anet fi kurɔm se mɛrɛk e, &lt;&lt;Dorok tsik, sok kameneng ngɔn, tseng sak ari.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Wat anet e, dorok, a yit irén. <verse eid="MAT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Ni izen fi kudyɛng banet e di ikyɛng fi ite, ayɔɔt ka ba yit, ba tere Adakunom, nek kukyem ti kuyɔng fɛ́ a nɔɔk banet.<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso yes aMatiyu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Fɛ́ aYeso se ni iwon karɔ me yɔng, a di anet akak fɛ́ ba ku yes aMatiyu, ni isonong ni kubut ishashang itsɔm mben wu. AYeso fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Di kuus mo.&gt;&gt; AMatiyu wat a dorok ziri, a ku kuus mo.<verse eid="MAT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />Ni izen fɛ́ aYeso sonong narɔ iyak ari me, banet ishashang itsɔm mben dot, nɛ bafɛ́ aduk nggɔn, tsɛ ba yas gung ni iwu nɛ bafi imɛɛs. <verse eid="MAT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" />Fɛ́ BaFarasi di anɔng, ba rip bafi imɛɛs wu yɛ, &lt;&lt;Akyɛ sak Anet Itees yin, yas nɛ banet ishashang itsɔm mben nɛ bafi aduk nggɔn ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Ni ifok anɔng, aYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Da bayɔng fɛ́ ba bɛ̀ kukyang bá fɛ́ ba tsɛt abok awo, tit bayɔng fɛ́ ba se ni irɔk. <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" />Tsi yiring ifɛ̀ de: &lt;Imi shim ni tonoso yin angmishish da inabak-akuce awo.&gt; Nek imi bɛ́ nek iyes batabat e awo, tit mok bafi inɛn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ba nye aYeso irisim <optbreak /> naton itemak anu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />Ama anɔng, bafi imɛɛs aYohana tsɛ ba rip aYeso yɛ, &lt;&lt;Akyɛ sak fi iyit nɛ BaFarasi in temak yit nanu, awɛt na bafi imɛɛs ngɔn raba dang nye anɔng ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />AYeso ka ba rip yɛ, &lt;&lt;I se yɛɛt na bafidang amatek agwel nye kafa kawe ni izen fi iwu rēn se ni iba yɛ? Awɛy! Izen bi nye fɛ́ ba bi sok amatek agwel e ni iba, ni izen e yɔng, ba bi nɛ ba temak nanu.<verse eid="MAT 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />&lt;&lt;Vit anet fɛ́ a sok icek ikpin ifas fi i se dang te shungut, na di basak na ashungut agyɛt ikpin, nek ibisik e, da bang kɔrɔk agyɛt ikpin e, ni ku bang sarák. <verse eid="MAT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />Ke anet na tse na korok ashi anap afas ni itsung-kuruu kuzen. Ke ba nye anɔng, itsung-kukpa me da sarák. Ikyɛng inye yet, ashi anap afas, ba te ina ni itsung-kukpa kufas, na anɔng, ba di ki sak itsung-kukpa me, nɛ ashi anap e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso donong Kanamang <optbreak /> kakak nɛ Abining <optbreak /> fɛ́ a teng Asok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Na aYeso tsin ren cɛɛt, akɔk-ashon akak, tsɛ a te nyɔk ashon wu, a fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Kangas hom tsin mɛsɛng ku. Awɛt ngɔn bɛ́ tsi di sak kubɔk naton ka, ka da tɛ ka dorok.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />AYeso dorok, a ku kuus mo gung na bafi imɛɛs wu.<verse eid="MAT 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Ba se na anɔng, abining akak fɛ́ a bɔrɔng ni iteng nasok ayɛ kusɔk abe afaa, ne ama wu, a ra kanu ikpin aYeso, <verse eid="MAT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" />abining e fɛ̀ ayɛt iyɛ wu, &lt;&lt;Ki in kyem in ra kanu ikpin wu kyɛk, in da sɛ kukyang.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />AYeso tirik, a ku di, a fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Angas yin, sak iyɛ ngɔn ting! Inɔɔk atsak ngɔn mi da te kyang<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:22 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Inɔɔk atsak ngɔn mi da te kyang</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Itirik ikak ni ilem aGirik yet, </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">&lt;&lt;Inɔɔk atsak ngɔn mi da sheshek.&gt;&gt;</char></note>.&gt;&gt; Ni izen izining, abining e wat a sɛ kukyang.<verse eid="MAT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Izen fɛ́ aYeso tsɛ a ta ari akɔk-ashon e, a sɛ bafi ihwyɛrɛ iyɔm, ni kudyɛng banet nkum awɔng kaakyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />A fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Di nang yin irèn! Kanamang e mi ku awo, ka se ni nda.&gt;&gt; Banet e ku mas. <verse eid="MAT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Ama fɛ́ ba mi tun kudyɛng banet e amatse, aYeso nɔ ayɛt e, a sok kubɔk anamang e, kanamang e dorok. <verse eid="MAT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Kucɛɛt ikyɛng fɛ́ aYeso nye me, teng ku tseng kaakyɛ ni mben e.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso te bakpatɔn <optbreak /> nɛ akpey akak kyang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Na aYeso tsin won azɔng, bakpatɔn bafaa ku kuus mo, ba ta kutɔ, ba fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Arim agwɔm aDauda, fok angmishish yit!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Ama fɛ́ nɔ ari kakak, bakpatɔn e, tsɛ ba ku sɛ azɔng, a fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Iyin nɔɔk yin atsak fok imi da kyem in ki te yin kyang ɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:28">Ba fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Ey, aTisa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />A ma ka ba ra ayisi, a fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Won ni i ki sot yin kpaf ti inɔɔk atsak yin,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />ayisi ba wat a tarak. Ama anɔng, aYeso ka ba kɔrɔk kuto yɛ, &lt;&lt;Da i bi tak yin akak ikyɛng fi ite awo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Ngma na anɔng, iba ya kashon ni ishara ifɛ̀ naton wu kaakyɛ ni mben e.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Ni iba tsin wuru, ba se ni inɔs na anet akak fi kurɔk itseng ku sak a kyem a cɛɛt awo narɔ aYeso. <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />Ama fɛ́ ba tun itseng e, anet fi kucɛɛt tsang ku gaat e, kpa cɛɛt. Ayɔɔt yit kudyɛng banet fɛ́ ba se azɔng, ba fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Ba mang di ikyɛng ti ideng ni aIsrela awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />Awɛt BaFarasi fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Ayet agwɔm itseng wu a ku nesek agap fɛ́ a di turung itseng e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akɔ mi ben awɛt <optbreak /> itusung e rat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />AYeso teng a kat ni nwɔp nratek, ni nban e, na ras itees na narɔ inyis baYahuda, na shara ifɛ̀ itek ifi igwɔm, na tes banet nrɔk zizɛɛt nɛ bafi isɔ izot kyang. <verse eid="MAT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" />Ni izen fɛ́ a di kudyɛng banet, a fok angmishish ba, nek ba ka ba tes anyim, wɛt vit ayɔng fɛ́ a da ka ba se mo ti ítsamang fi i se vit anek de. <verse eid="MAT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" />Nek anɔng, a fɛ̀ na bafi imɛɛs wu, &lt;&lt;Itusung kuyak e se dot, awɛt bafi itomong e rat. <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" />Nek anɔng, ra yin awon sak na aTisa ikɔ me, na a tom banet itomong fɛ́ ba da tusung kuyak akɔ me.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="s">AYeso tom batom <optbreak /> kusɔk abe afaa me</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />AYeso yes bafi imɛɛs wu kusɔk abe afaa, a ka ba nɔɔk ice iturung áduk ábik ni irɔm banet, ni ites banet fɛ́ ba bɔrɔng ni nrɔk zizɛɛt nɛ bafi isɔ izot kyang.<verse eid="MAT 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />AYerek batom kusɔk abe afaa me na: Afi imɛsɛng e, aSiman, fɛ́ ba ku yes aBitrus, nɛ arunyining aAndarawus; AYakubu arim aZebedi, nɛ aYohana arunyining aYakubu e, <verse eid="MAT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />aFilibus, nɛ aBatalomi; aToma, nɛ aMatiyu anet ishashang itsɔm mben; aYakubu arim Alfayus, nɛ aTadiyus, <verse eid="MAT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />aSiman afi iwɔp aKanan, nɛ aJudas aIskariyoti ayɔng fɛ́ a rɛp aYeso.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />AYeso tom kusɔk abe afaa me, a ka ba nye igbat ifɛ̀ yɛ: &lt;&lt;Da i bi tse yin na narɔ bayɔng fɛ́ da ba yet baYahuda awo, ke ni tse yin ni nwɔp bafɛ́ aSamariya awo. <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" />Tit sak ni ítsamang aIsrela fi i mi wɛs kyɛk. <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" />Izen fi i tse yin, shara yin ifɛ̀ deng: &lt;Igwɔm azanɛn mi bɛ́ bakat.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Tes yin bafi nrɔk kyang, ni doro yin nkom banet, ni tes yin bakparong kyang, ni turung yin itseng ne banet. Ninang fɛ́ ba ki nɔɔk yin, ninang fi i da nesek yin. <verse eid="MAT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" />Da i bi bereng yin itsɔm na baya kudun awo, ke ifi itsɔm ata asɛng, ke afi itsɔm ata akan, ke afi itsɔm ata agigɛl awo, <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" />i bi bereng yin amala nek kutseet e awo, ke kukpin kukak, ke akpatak, ke agbanding awo. Nek i se kpaf, anet itomong na a sɛ itarang kudaam wu.<verse eid="MAT 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />&lt;&lt;Kaakyɛ kuwɔp ke kaban wɔp fi i di nɔ yin, tsɛt yin anet atek, sonong yin ari wu, sak izen fi i bi di tseng yin. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" />Ki i nɔ yin ari me, ni i ka ba te yin ashow. <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />Ke banet ari me yet batek, won i te ashow kukyang yin di nak ni ba. Kɛ banet ari me yet baduk e, won ite ashow yin ni ibun ni yin. <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" />Kɛ akak rawu dang ki shan yin, ke a rawu dang wes ato ni ifɛ̀ yin, ni waat yin kabung akpatak yin<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ni zuut yin kabung akpatak yin</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Ke afɛ́ aYahuda zuut kabung akpatak wu, itonong ibeseng iyɛ wu sak na banet ari me ke bafi iwɔp e ayi. I ti itonong ye banet e se cɛ́l awo.</char></note> ni izen fi i da wuruk yin ari me, ke kuwɔp e ayi. <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" />Won in ki tak yin atsak, in bi dung fok angmishish banet aSodom, nɛ aGomora, aza banet iwɔp yɔng atuk fɛ́ Adakunom bi ra ishɔt. <verse eid="MAT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />Imi tsin ki tom yin ti ítsamang ayɛt agbayɔrɔ. Nek anɔng, sot yin tsɛngtsɛng ti íhwyen ni bɛ̀ yin nhwyɛ tɛ ábɔp.<verse eid="MAT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />&lt;&lt;Nye yin yɛɛt na banet, nek ba bi ki nabak yin ashon banet ishɔt, ba bi ki tsosok yin na narɔ inyis baYahuda. <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" />Nek imi, ba bi ki kɔk yin sak ashon bagwɔmna nɛ ashon bágwɔm, nɔng i da sot nanu ifɛ̀ sak na bafi nhwyi. <verse eid="MAT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" />Awɛt izen fɛ́ ba bi ki tekap yin, i bi daam yin naton ikyɛng fi i bi fɛ̀ yin awo, ni kuri irèn fi i bi di fɛrɛng yin awo. Ni izen e yɔng, ba bi ki nɔɔk yin ikyɛng ifɛ̀. <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" />Nek a bi yet iyin ba i bi cɛɛt yin awo, a yet Kabik Ada yin wu ka bi cɛɛt ayɛt yin.<verse eid="MAT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />&lt;&lt;Arunyining bi rep arunyining, na ba ku fɛt, ada bi nye ni nggon wu kpaf anɔng, nnon bi doro fulul sak nɛ batek, ni binggɔ bá, ba bi sak ba ka ba fɛɛs. <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />Banet kusum bi ki rayin nek imi, awɛt ayɔng fɛ́ a nyeseng nɛ agap sak ni igang e, ba bi ku sheshek. <verse eid="MAT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />Izen fɛ́ ba ki nɔɔk yin iyɔm ni wɔp ku ka, ni teng yin sak ni ku ya. Won in ki tak yin atsak, i bi tsang gang yin igoroso nwɔp mben aIsrela ninyen awo, Arim Anet bi tsang bɛ́s wu.<verse eid="MAT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />&lt;&lt;Nggon imɛɛs kyem ka wat anet itees ka awo, ke asam na a wat atekari wu awo. <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" />Won nggon imɛɛs na ka tas anet itees ka, asam na a se tɛ atekari wu. Kɛ ba mi yes atekari me aBɛɛlzɛbul<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">aBɛɛlzɛbul</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Yet iyerek </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">aShetan ikak.</char></note>, ba da yes nnon ari me na akyɛ kuri iyerek ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayɔng fɛ́ a se gyat na <optbreak /> ba waat fok nnyim wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />Nek anɔng, i bi fok yin nnyim ba awo. Vit ikyɛng fi i se ni ifaam fɛ́ da ba bi rēn ide awo, ke idɔng fi i se ni nɛt fɛ́ da ba bi di ide awo. <verse eid="MAT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />Ikyɛng fi in ki mang ki tak yin natuk, cɛɛt yin ide ni nom, idɔng fi in kin ki tak yin ni nɛt, cɛɛt ide weshek. <verse eid="MAT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />Da i bi fok yin nnyim bayɔng fɛ́ ba fɛɛs kurɔm awɛt vit iba ni kukyem isok kutset awo. Ningya, fok nnyim ayɔng fɛ́ a da kyem na wey kutset ni kurɔm ari irong. <verse eid="MAT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />Ba rɛs naban abɔp nafaa nanu abɔk azining<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Abɔk azining</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Ni ilem aGirik abɔk azining e yet Assarion. Assarion yet abɔ́k ata akan afi mben aRoma. Naban abɔ́k ata akan e kusɔk abe karataat yet itsɔm itomong iwoso izining.</char></note> awɛ? Ngma nɛ anɔng, vit kazining ayɛt na fɛ́ ka da kpa aben, ke da ada yin shim awo. <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" />Ngma akwoy ice yin ba mi fa ina. <verse eid="MAT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" />Nek anɔng, i bi fok yin nnyim awo, iyin wat yin nanon dot ni iratek.<verse eid="MAT 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />Kaangan fɛ́ a tonong ice wu weshek ashon banet, fok iwu yet anaan, imi bi ku tonong weshek ashon Ada min fɛ́ a se azanɛn. <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" />Awɛt ayɔng fɛ́ a toon ashon banet, fok da iwu di rēn awo, imi bi ku toon ashon Ada min fɛ́ a se azanɛn, fok da imi ku irēn awo.<verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso bɛ́ ni kusonong <optbreak /> Kukyang awo tit awal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />I bi yiring yin ti imi bɛ́ ni kusonong kukyang azatse awo. Imi bɛ́ nek kusonong kukyang awo, tit awal. <verse eid="MAT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" />Nek imi bɛ́</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 10:35">&lt;&lt; &lt;ni in tirik nggon nɛ ada ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 10:35">angas nɛ anyining,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 10:35">akugon nɛ anekop.<verse eid="MAT 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />Banet ari anet, bi yet</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 10:36">bafi ifa ni iwu.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />&lt;&lt;Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a dung shim atek ke anyining ayi aza hom, a kyem na a sot anaan awo; ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a dung shim ari wu ke angas ayi aza hom, a kyem na a sot anaan awo. <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" />Kaakyɛ anet fɛ́ da a sok kukum itegak wu, a di kuus mo awo, a kyem na a sot anaan awo. <verse eid="MAT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />Kaakyɛ anet fɛ́ a shim a sɛ kutset wu, a da bit iko. Kaakyɛ anet fɛ́ a nɔɔk nwaa kutset wu nek imi, a bi sɛ iko.<verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />&lt;&lt;Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a ki shan yin, imi wu a di shan. Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a di shan, a shan ayɔng fɛ́ a di tom. <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a shan atan nek iwu yet atan, a da sɛ izang atan e. Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a shan anet nnyim Adakunom, nek iwu yet anet nnyim Adakunom, a da sɛ izang anet nnyim Adakunom. <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />Kɛ akak nɔɔk ayɔng fɛ́ a dung yet awosong ayɛt bafi ikuus hom ashi isɔ kyang, nek a yet afi ikuus hom, won in ki tak yin atsak, a da bit izang wu awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="s">AYohana anet aBatisma tom <optbreak /> bafi imɛɛs sak na aYeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Ama fɛ́ aYeso mi gang kucɛɛt nɛ bafi imɛɛs wu kusɔk abe afaa me, a won azɔng, a ya kashon ni itees, ni ishara ifɛ̀ ni nwɔp bà.<verse eid="MAT 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />Ni izen fɛ́ aYohana anet abatisma fɛ́ a se ari inyang, fok ikyɛng fɛ́ Anet-Isheshek se ni ira me, a tom bafi imɛɛs wu sak azɔng, <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />na ba ku rip yɛ, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn wu i yet ayɔng fɛ́ ba kin fɛ̀ fok, a bi bɛ́ me yɛ, kɛ ni in tot yit akak ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />AYeso ka ba bun ni ifɛ̀ yɛ, &lt;&lt;Ti bun yin, i da tak yin aYohana, ikyɛng fi i mi di yin, ni idɔng fi i fok yin: <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />Bakpatɔn tsin sɛɛs ayisi, bakun tsin tsees, ba tsin tes bakparong cɛ́l, bakpey tsin foos kucɛɛt, bayɔng fɛ́ ba mi kus tsin doro, ba tsin shara ifɛ̀ itek sak na bakan. <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />Awɛng se gung na ayɔng fɛ́ da a te gbɛrɛk ni ikuus awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />Ni izen fɛ́ bafi imɛɛs aYohana tsin bun, aYeso kpa kucɛɛt naton aYohana sak ni kudyɛng banet fɛ́ ba se azɔng yɛ: Akyɛ de fi i tse yin idi me na tse yɛ? I tsi di yin ki shishot agam fi kuwun fɛsɛm aze sak aza yɛ? <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />Akyɛ de fi i tse yin idi me ka yɛ? Ke anet fɛ́ a kana zem na ares fɛ́ a gyɛs ɛ? Awɛy, bayɔng fɛ́ ba kana zem na ares anɔng, ba ka ba sɛs ne nasa bágwɔm! <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />Won in ki rip yin, akyɛ de fi i tse idi yin ne yɛ? I di atan ɛ? Ey anɔng, won in ki tak yin, i tsi di yin ayɔng fɛ́ a wat atan. <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" />Naton aYohana wu fɛ́ ba kin di jɛk yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:10">&lt;&lt;Di atom hom e yong,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:10">in tsin ku tom ashon ngɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:10">na a nye irèn nek ngɔn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />Won in ki tak yin, vit anet fɛ́ ba mang tes azatse kang, fɛ́ a wat aYohana anet abatisma ni iratek. Ngma nɛ anɔng, ayɔng fɛ́ a dung yet awosong ayɛt igwɔm azanɛn, ku wat ni iratek. <verse eid="MAT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />Neme nkum izen itomong aYohana anet abatisma sak atut, ba tsɛsɛk igwɔm azanɛn ni ifa, bafi ifa me se ni kuren ni ide. <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />Nek ngma ijɛk batan, nɛ afumung ntsi aMusa a kin cɛɛt naton igwɔm e, dang ku bɛ́ aYohana. <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />Ki iyin shim ishan yin ifɛ̀ hom e, aYohana me wu a yet aIliya fɛ́ ba kin di cɛɛt naton wu fok, a bi bɛ́. <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />Ngma anet fɛ́ a bɛ̀ kuto, won na a fok!<verse eid="MAT 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />Na akyɛ fi in di ki mara banet nnu nang ɛ? Ba se kpaf ti nnon fɛ́ na kana tusung narɔ ijik, nɛ na yes bafidang yɛ,<verse eid="MAT 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />&lt;&lt;In ki ra yin ihwyɛrɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:17">i rayin dang to yin.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:17">In ki ra yin abom iyɔm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:17">i rayin dang tos yin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />Nek aYohana kin bɛ̀, a rawu dang yas nayak, na rawu dang sɔs ashi anap, wɛt ba fɛ̀ yɛ, &lt;&lt;A bi itsɛ́ng!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" />Fɛ Arim Anet bɛ́, in yas, ni in sɔs, wɛt banet tɛ ba fɛ̀ yɛ, &lt;&lt;Di yin kudayak kang wɔn kuyak kyɛk, ni ifeng, afidang bafi ishashang itsɔm mben nɛ bafi inɛn.&gt;&gt; Ngma nɛ anɔng, ba yɛrɛ kutsitsɛng Adakunom ayɛt ntomong bafuu.<verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kawɛy ni nwɔp fɛ́ banet e <optbreak /> raba iwosong anɛn bá</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Ama anɔng, aYeso kpa di tisik naton nwɔp yɔng fi iwu kin di ras kudot ntomong abes wu, nek banet kin raba dang wosong anɛn bá. <verse eid="MAT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />&lt;&lt;Ye kukuu! Kawɛy se naton ngɔn aKorazin! Kawɛy se naton ngɔn aBatseyida! Ke ba kin fɛ́ ba ra ntomong abes yɔng fi in kin ras ayɛt yin, ni nwop aTiya nɛ aSidon, ke ba ki mang tes agyɛɛt ares, nɛ ba korok ntong nkan na ace bá, ke ba man wosong anɛn bá neme. <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />Won in ki tak yin, atuk fɛ́ Adakunom bi bɛ́ ira ishɔt, a bi wat ifok angmishish banet aTiya nɛ aSidon aza yin. <verse eid="MAT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" />Wat ngɔn, aKafarnahum, ngɔn di tɛ ba bi da sok terere sak azanɛn ɛ? Awɛy! Ba bi da barak tsik ari-irong! Ke ba kin fɛ́ ba ras ntomong abes fɛ́ ba ras ayɛt ngɔn, ni wɔp aSodom, ke kuwop e ren di se mo sak atut. <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" />Won in da tak, atuk fɛ́ Adakunom bi bɛ́ ira ishɔt, a bi wat ifok angmishish banet aSodom aza ngɔn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bɛ́ yin ni imi i da <optbreak /> sɛ yin ifɔɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />Ni izen e yɔng, aYeso fɛ̀ yɛ, &lt;&lt;Ada, ngɔn fi i yet aTisa azanɛn nɛ kazatse! Imi da feng, nek ngɔn nɛt banet kutsitsɛng nɛ bafi irēn nkyɔrɔk nang, ngɔn tarak ayisi naban nnon ni ide. <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />Ey Ada, nek ikyɛng fi ngɔn kin nye, i da sas anɔng.<verse eid="MAT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />&lt;&lt;Ada hom mi di nɔk kaakyi ikyɛng ni bɔk in. Vit anet fɛ́ a rēn Arim e, tit Ada me aziwu, vit anet fɛ́ a rēn Ada me, tit Arim e aziwu nɛ bayɔng fɛ Arim e shim a ka ba tonong.<verse eid="MAT 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />&lt;&lt;Bɛ́ yin ni imi, ngma yin fi i se yin gbɛrɛk, fɛ́ acet yin ki se yin diring; imi da ki nɔɔk yin ifɔɔn. <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29" />Moon yin ice ni imi, imi da ki tonong yin irèn, nɔng i da mɛɛs yin ni imi, nek imi bi nhwyɛ, in bi imen ice makiyi, wɛt iyin da sɛ yin ifɔɔn na ayɛ yin. <verse eid="MAT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30" />Nek acet anaan se fakam, ntsi hom se bɛgɛlɛk.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="s">ATisa kunom aSabat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />Ni izen e yɔng, aYeso kin se ni igot abak akɔ alikama. Atuk e yɔng kin yet kunom aSabat. Bafi imɛɛs wu kin fok nzong, wat ba kpa hwyii ace alikama na ba ya. <verse eid="MAT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" />Fɛ́ BaFarasi di anɔng, ba fɛ̀ na aYeso, &lt;&lt;Di, bafi imɛɛs ngɔn, ba se ni inye ikyɛng fi ntsi yit ro ni ira me atuk aSabat.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />AYeso ka ba bun ni ifɛ̀ yɛ, &lt;&lt;Iyin man fa yin ikyɛng fɛ́ agbat agwɔm aDauda, kin nye ni izen fi iwu nɛ bafi itseet wu kin fok nzong awɛ? <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" />Fɛ́ a kin tsɛ a nɔ ni kutɔmɔng Adakunom, a ya akpam ntsi Adakunom, a da tɛ kaba bafi itseet wu ne, ikyɛng fi ntsi yit ro ni iya me tit áware kyɛk. <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" />Ke iyin ki mang fa yin afumung fɛ́ aMusa jɛk awɛ? Fɛ́ kaakyɛ kunom aSabat, áware ni itu iya Adakunom ntong beseng kunom aSabat, ngma nɛ anɔng, da ba nye inɛn awo. <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" />Won in ki tak yin, akak di se azeng fɛ́ a wat kutu iya Adakunom ntong e ni iratek. <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" />Ki i fi rēn yin ikyɛng fi ifɛ̀ deng fɛ̀, &lt;Imi tsɛɛt angmishish aza inabak-akuce,&gt; ki i mɔɔt yin bayɔng fɛ́ ba se vit inɛn awo. <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />Nek Arim Anet wu a yet aTisa aSabat.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Anet fi kubɔk sɔrɔk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />AYeso won karɔ fɛ́ a di se, a tsɛ a nɔ narɔ inyis baYahuda. <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />Anet akak se azɔng fi kubɔk wu mi sɔrɔk. Banet bakak azɔng tsɛt irèn fɛ́ ba di ki sɛ aYeso ni inɛn, ba ku rip, &lt;&lt;Ntsi yit fɛ̀ na ba te anet kyang atuk aSabat ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Won in fɛ̀ yit, akak ayɛt yin itsamang wu azining kpa ni ibong atuk aSabat. Anet e, da nabak kubɔk, a di tun iye awɛ? <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />Anet wat itsamang ni iratek! Nek anɔng, ntsi fɛ̀ na ba nye ikyɛng itek atuk aSabat.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />A fɛ̀ na anet e, &lt;&lt;Nabak kubɔk ngɔn.&gt;&gt; Wat anet e, nabak iko, kubɔk e wat ku te kyang kpaf ti kuzining e. <verse eid="MAT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />Wat BaFarasi wuruk amatse, ba kpa tɔ irèn fɛ́ ba di ki wey na aYeso.<verse eid="MAT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">ASam fɛ́ Adakunom myak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15" />Nek aYeso rēn ikyɛng fɛ́ BaFarasi se ne, a won karɔ me yɔng. Banet dot ku kuus mo, a ka ba te kyang ngma bá. <verse eid="MAT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />A ka ba kɔrɔk kuto yɛ da na ba tak akak, fok iwu yet angan awo. <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />A nye anɔng, nɔng ba bin di shining ikyɛng fɛ́ atan aIshaya kin fɛ̀,<verse eid="MAT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />&lt;&lt;Di yin, asam hom yong,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">fi in mi ku myak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">ayɔng fi imi shim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">in bi iyɛ ikan nek iwu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">Imi da te Kabik hom naton wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">a bi shara ifɛ̀ ishɔt atsak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">sak ngma ni mben azatse.<verse eid="MAT 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />A bi yet anet itsɛt ifa awo, ke afi shim iwɔng awo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:19">ba bi fok kutɔ wu naton irèn awo.<verse eid="MAT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />A bi but agam fɛ́ ngmash</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:20">na a but awo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">A bi fɛt kudun agaramun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:20">fɛ́ a bɛ́ bakat iku awo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:20">tit a bi sak ishɔt atsak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:20">ni iya kashon.<verse eid="MAT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />Bafi nhwyi ngma kusum</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:21">bi te iyɛ ni wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bakak di tɛmɛng aYeso fok <optbreak /> a ras kutomong nɛ agap aBɛɛlzɛbul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Ama anɔng, banet bakak tse na akpey akpatɔn akak fɛ́ a bi itseng, ba tse ni wu narɔ aYeso. AYeso ku te kyang, a kpa cɛɛt, na yɛrɛ gyat. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Ngma banet fɛ́ ba se azɔng ayɔɔt ka ba yit, wɛt ba fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;In fɛ̀ kɛ, Arim agwɔm aDauda yong awɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" />Ni izen fɛ́ BaFarasi fok anɔng, ba fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;A yet aBɛɛlzɛbul, agwɔm itseng wu, a nesek anet yong agap fɛ́ a di turung itseng!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />AYeso rēn kuyiring bá, a fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Kaakyi igwɔm fi i kaba ice de asa afaa, ni ira itsom ni ice de, igwɔm e, da kyem i nyeseng awo. Kaakyi kuwɔp ke kari fɛ́ banet e kana kaba nek ifà, ba da kyem ba ya kashon awo. <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" />Kɛ aShetan da tɛ a kpa turung aShetan, idɔng tonong, a se ni itsom ni ice wu. Na anɛ fi igwɔm wu da nyeseng ɛ? <verse eid="MAT 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />Ki imi turung itseng ni kukyem aBɛɛlzɛbul, wɛt nnon yin anɛ? Na agap angan fi ina di turung ɛ? Won ikyɛng fɛ́ ba kin ra, ide fi itonong fok iyin i mi dun yin. <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" />Awɛt ki imi turung itseng na Kabik Adakunom, idɔng tonong fok, Adakunom mi kpa iya igwɔm nate yin.<verse eid="MAT 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />&lt;&lt;Vit anet fɛ́ a kyem na a nɔ ari anet agap, na kok ikyɛng fɛ́ a bɛ̀, ma a tun rosom anet agap e ninyɛn, ama anɔng, na nɛ na kok nkyɔrɔk e.<verse eid="MAT 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />&lt;&lt;Kaakyɛ anet fɛ́ da a yet anaan awo, a se ni idi ramin. Ayɔng fɛ́ da a di ses mo itusung e awo, a se ni isharatat e. <verse eid="MAT 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" />Nek anɔng, won in ki tak yin, Adakunom bi fuut banet kaakyi kuri inɛn ni tonong ibyes fɛ́ ba ras, awɛt ayɔng fɛ́ a tonong ibyes naton Kabik aJɛrɛ, ba bi ku fuut e awo. <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" />Ke akak tonong ibyes naton Arim Anet, ba bi ku fuut e, awɛt ayɔng fɛ́ a tonong ibyes naton Kabik aJɛrɛ, ba bi ku fuut e awo, nkum yɔkɔnɔng sak na ayɛ fɛ a bi bɛ̀.<verse eid="MAT 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ba rēn kakon ni kuri <optbreak /> ica ka fɛ́ ka tes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />&lt;&lt;Kakon fɛ́ ka yet katek, ka tes ica itek. Kakon fɛ́ ka yet kamaan e, ka tes ica imaan e bà. Nek ba rēn kakon ni kuri ica fɛ́ ka tes. <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" />Iyin fi i yet yin nnon ámazɛrɛ! Na anɛ fi iyin ámaan ánet, da kyem i nye yin kucɛɛt kutek ɛ? Nek ikyɛng fi i se ayɛt iyɛ anet, ide fi iwuru na nu anet e. <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />Anet atek, nyes nkyɔrɔk ntek fi in nes narɔ fɛ́ a di tusung ni iyɛ wu, awɛt amaan anet ras nkyɔrɔk nmaane e fi in nes narɔ fɛ́ a di tusung ina ni iyɛ wu bà. <verse eid="MAT 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />Won in ki tak yin, kaangan bi tsɛ a tak atuk ishɔt igang azatse, kaaki kuri kucɛɛt kukpɛɛ me, fɛ́ a mang cɛɛt iko. <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />Nek kucɛɛt ngɔn da ka kusu ke ku da ka rosom ayi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Banet shim fok aYeso a ka ba <optbreak /> ra ikyɛng abes ikak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />Wat bakak ayɛt bafi itees ntsi aMusa nɛ BaFarasi fɛ̀ na aYeso, &lt;&lt;Anet itees, iyit shim in di yit ikyɛng idi ifɛ́ abes ni ngɔn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" />Wat aYeso fɛ̀ ni ba yɛ, &lt;&lt;Banet nnu nang yet ámaane, ba raba ikuus Adakunom, ba shim fok ma ba ka ba tonong ikyɛng idi abes. Vit ikyɛng idi ikak fɛ́ ba da tɛ ba ka ba tonong fi iwɛt ifɛ́ atan aYunana. <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" />Kpaf kyɔn tɛ fɛ́ aYunana kin sot nkɔs ntaat, kunom nɛ katuk, ayɛt afaa anyin ìzos, anɔng wu, fɛ Arim Anet bi nye nkɔs ntaat, kunom nɛ katuk ayɛt mben.<verse eid="MAT 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" />&lt;&lt;Atuk ishɔt igang azatse, banet aNineve bi dorok tsik nɛ banet nnu nang, ba bi te kukun ba, nek banet aNineve me kin wosong anɛn bá ama fɛ́ bá fok ishara ifɛ̀ Adakunom na nu aYunana. Di yin ayɔng fɛ́ a wat aYunana ni iratek azeng. <verse eid="MAT 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />Atuk ishɔt igang azatse, azɛnɛ mben aSheba bi dorok tsik nɛ banet nnu nang, a bi te kukun ba, nek iwu kin ne narɔ kayik-yik, a tsɛ a fok ifɛ̀ kutsitsɛng kutsik-tsik na nu agwɔm aSolomon. Di yin ayɔng fɛ́ a wat aSolomon azeng.<verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43" />&lt;&lt;Izen fi itseng wuruk ayɛt anet, i da teng i kat na narɔ na koot ni itsɛsɛk karɔ ifɔn, ke da i tsi i sɛ karɔ awo. <verse eid="MAT 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44" />Ni fɛ̀ ni ice de, &lt;In da tin bun ari hom fi in tsang di se.&gt; Izen fi bi ta, i bi sɛ karɔ me mo kakoot, ni iyɛs ni i nye ika yɛɛt. <verse eid="MAT 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" />Ni ti bun, ni tsi ni sok itseng ikak kanakataat fi i ki de wat nɛ anyas, ni i tsi i nɔ, ni i sot azɔng. Ama me, ni nse anet e, wat nfi imɛsɛng e ni imaan e. Ikyɛng fi i bi te nɛ ánet nnu nang dɔng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nggɔ aYeso nɛ Barunyining</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Ni izen fɛ́ aYeso rēn tsin cɛɛt nɛ banet, nggɔ wu nɛ barunyining se amatse, ba shim ke ba fɛrɛng ni iwu. <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />Nek anɔng, akak tsɛ a fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Di nggɔ ngɔn nɛ barunyining ngɔn yɔng amatse, ba shim ke ba fɛrɛng ni ngɔn.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Afumung akak fɛ́ ba kin jɛk ina ni mbɔk afɛ́ ashon da a bi ibyat ifi </char><char style="fv">47</char> awo.</note><verse eid="MAT 12:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />AYeso fɛ̀ nɛ anet e yɛ, &lt;&lt;Angan wu fɛ́ a yet nggɔ min ɛ? Bangan ba ba yet baruneng ɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Wat a di nabak kubɔk nɛ bafi imɛɛs wu, a fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Di nggɔ min nɛ baruneng ba! <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" />Kaangan fɛ́ a ras ikyɛng fɛ́ Ada hom naton aza shim, iwu wu fɛ́ a yet aruneng nɛ anganeng ni nggɔ hom.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="s">Igorok icɛɛt naton <optbreak /> anet inas ija</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />Atuk kazining e yɔng, aYeso wuruk ayɛt ari, a tsɛ a sonong na anu izek. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" />Kudyɛng banet makiyi ku te nate, fi i sak a nɔ ayɛt kukyɛ ashi, a sonong, wɛt banet e ngma, tsɛ ba nyeseng ni ice ibanang. <verse eid="MAT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />AYeso ka ba nye ncɛɛt zizɛɛt ayet igorok icɛɛt, a fɛ̀ ni ba: &lt;&lt;Anet ikap akak kin tsɛ a nas ija wu. <verse eid="MAT 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />Ni izen fɛ́ a se ni inas e, ikak kpas naton irèn, wɛt nanon berem na tang ide. <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />Ikak kpas na agbondong, narɔ fɛ da ntong mak di se awo. I tang i wat i rasak, nek ntong e se gbɛngɛjɛng. <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />Wat izen fi kunom ngarak nate, ku shosh ide, i wat nkoot, nek aney e tsang nɔ yik-yik ayet mben awo. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />Ikak kpas ayɛt itsitsan, itsitsan rasak i ki de ro ni kurasak. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />Wat ikak kpas ni ntong ntek, ites ica, ikak anakat, ikak nsɔk karataat, ikak nsɔk ntaat. <verse eid="MAT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />Ayɔng fɛ́ a bɛ́ kuto, won na a fok ifɛ̀.&gt;&gt; <figure style="fig" alt="Man sowing seed" file="WA03841b.tif" size="col" loc="MAT 13:9" copy="Wade images" ref="13:1-9">Anet inas ija</figure><verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikyɛng fi sak aYeso ras <optbreak /> igoroso icɛɛt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Bafi imɛɛs e, bɛ́ ni wu, ba fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Akyɛ sak fi ngɔn cɛɛt nɛ banet ni igoroso icɛɛt ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni ba, Iyin ba mi ki nɔɔk yin kurēn narɔk igwɔm azanɛn, awɛt i se anɔng sak ni ishɛrɛp banet e awo. <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" />Nek anet fɛ́ a bi ikyɛng, ba bi tɛ ba ku barang mo shɛkɛdɛk, awɛt ayɔng fɛ́ a se vit ikyɛng, igyet e dɔng fɛ́ a bɛ̀ ngma, ba bi shan ide ni wu. <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" />Ikyɛng de fi i sak in di cɛɛt ni iba ni igorok icɛɛt: Banet ba se tɛ ba bɛ ayisi akabes, awɛt ba nɛ ba yɛrɛ awo; ba se tɛ ba foos kucɛɛt, ba kyem ba fok nɛ ba yit awo. <verse eid="MAT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />Nek anɔng, ikyɛng fɛ́ atan aIshaya ki mang fɛ̀, ishining naton ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">&lt;&lt;I bi woso ifos yin akabes,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:14">awɛt i bi kyem i rēn yin awo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:14">i bi woso yɛrɛ yin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:14">awɛt i bi kyem i di yin awo.<verse eid="MAT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />Nek ayɛ banet nang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">mi te kashalang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">ato ba tɛ a foos awo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">ba mi fam ayisi bà.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">Ke da anɔng awo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">ke ba di yɛrɛ na ayisi me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">ke bayɔng ba foos na ato bá.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">Ke bayɔng ba kyem ba rēn atsak e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">na ayɛ bá,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">ke bayɔng ba tirik sak ni imi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">nɔng imi da ka ba te kyang.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />Awɛt iyin bɛ̀ yin awɛng nek ayisi yin kyem a yɛrɛ, nɛ ato yin foos. <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" />Won in ki tak yin atsak: Batan dot, nɛ banet dot fɛ́ ba kin nye ikyɛng fɛ́ Adakunom kin shim, ba tsɛt ke ba di ikyɛng fi iyin tsin yɛrɛ yin, awɛt ba kyem ba sɛ awo, ba tsɛt ba fok ikyɛng fi i tsin foos yin, awɛt ba kyem ba fok awo.<verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso tak ikyɛng fi <optbreak /> igorok icɛɛt e tonong</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />Wes yin ato, nɔng i da rēn yin ikyɛng fi igorok icɛɛt anet inas ija me tonong:<verse eid="MAT 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />Anet yɔng fɛ́ ke a fok ifɛ̀ igwɔm Azanɛn, ni i ku gaat irēn, a se ti ica me dɔng fi i kpas naton irèn, na amaan e bɛ́ na shan ikyɛng fɛ ba mi tsang tuus ni iyɛ wu nɛ agap. <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />Ija me dɔng fi i kpas naton agbondong, i se tɛ anet fɛ́ ke a fok ifɛ̀ me, ayɛt izen izining na wat ishan ifɛ̀ me ni iyɛ ikan. <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />Awɛt nek vit iwu na aney, a kyem a nye nkɔs nfaa awo. Izen fi mgbang bɛ́, ke ba kpa ku nesek iyɔm nek ifɛ̀ me ayi, ni izen izining na wat na bun na kama. <verse eid="MAT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />Ija me dɔng fi i kpas narɔ fi itsitsan di se, i se tɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ke ba fok ifɛ̀ me, awɛt ni ndaam nkyɔrɔk azatse, ni nta, ni kurúm, ro ni ifɛ̀ me kurasak, ni sot vit kutes. <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />Wat idɔng fi i kpas ni ntong ntek, i se tɛ anet yɔng fɛ́ ke a fok ifɛ̀ me, na rēn ide gyat. Na a di ra kutomong ni ide gyat, kpaf idɔng fi ites ica anakat, ikak nsɔk kanakataat, ikak nsɔk ntat.<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Igorok icɛɛt naton <optbreak /> agam nɛ alikama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />AYeso tɛ a ka ba nye igorok icɛɛt ikak: Igwɔm azanɛn se tɛ anet fɛ́ a tsɛ a tuus ija itek ni ikɔ wu. <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />Awɛt ni izen fɛ́ kaangan se ni nda, anet ifa ni wu, tsɛ a di tuus agam ayɛt alikama me, a tseng akɔɔn wu. <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />Izen fɛ́ alikama bɛ́ a rasak, a tes ice, agam dorok bà.<verse eid="MAT 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />Basam atek ikɔ me tsɛ ba ku sɛ, ba fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Atekari, i kin yet ija itek fi ngɔn kin tuus awɛ? Wat agam e yong, nɛ a ne akɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />&lt;&lt;Atekari me fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;Anet ifa ni imi yɔng, a tsɛ nye kutomong yɔng.&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:28">&lt;&lt;Basam e ku rip yɛ, &lt;Ki ngɔn shim ni in tsin ngaa yit ina yɛ?&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />&lt;&lt;A fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;Awɛy, nek kɔng ni izen ingaa agam me, i bi wɛt i di ngaa yin alikama i di moon yin. <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />Won yin ide ni i rasak gung sak izen itusung nayak. Ni izen e yɔng, imi bi tak banet itusung e: Tusung yin agam e, rosom yin nsom-nsoom e, di te yin árong; Tusung yin alikama me, da tse yin ne ni imyɛ.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Igorok icɛɛt naton kica amusta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />AYeso tɛ a ka ba nye igorok icɛɛt yɛ, &lt;&lt;Igwɔm azanɛn se ti kica amusta, fɛ́ anet sok a tsɛ a tuus ni ikɔ wu. <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" />Ngma nɛ fi ide de i yet ibaane aza kaaki ija, awɛt ni izen fi i bi i rasak, na sot kakon na ka wat kaakyɛ kakon fɛ́ ba tup ni igɔɔt e, nɛ nanon tsɛ na di nok arɛ na na ahwyang e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />AYeso tɛ a ka ba nye igorok icɛɛt ikak bà, &lt;&lt;Igwɔm azanɛn se tɛ ayiis fɛ́ abining sok, a di riit ni nkpe alikama itsɛn imaas itaat, nɛ a ma dorok fungam.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />AYeso nyes kudyɛng banet e kucɛɛt ayet igorok icɛɛt; vit ikyɛng fɛ́ a ka ba tak fɛ́ da a di te igorok icɛɛt awo. <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" />A nye nɔng, mok a di shining ikyɛng fɛ́ atan ki mang fɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">&lt;&lt;Imi bi cɛɛt ni iba ni igoroso icɛɛt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:35">in bi ka ba tak nkyɔrɔk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:35">fi in kin se ni nɛt neme</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:35">dun na ba nye kazatse.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 78:2">Abom 78:2</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="MAT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso ka ba tak <optbreak /> ikyɛng fi igorok icɛɛt <optbreak /> agam nɛ alikama me tonong</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Ama anɔng, aYeso wosong kudyɛng banet e, a tsɛ a nɔ ari. Bafi imɛɛs wu, tsɛ ba ku sɛ ayɛt e, ba fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ki tak yit ikyɛng fi igorok icɛɛt agam ni ikɔ me tonong.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Anet fɛ́ a tuus ija itek e yet Arim Anet. <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />Ikɔ me yet kazatse, ija itek e yet banet fɛ́ Adakunom ya igwɔm natoon ba. Agam e yet banet fɛ́ ba ras nggɔn anyas, <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />wɛt anet ifup fɛ́ a ka ba tuus e yet aShetan. Izen itusung e, yet izen igang azatse, wɛt banet itusung e yet batomaza.<verse eid="MAT 13:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />&lt;&lt;Kyɔn tɛ fɛ́ ba di ngaa agam e, ba shosh iwu ni rong, i bi se kpaf anɔng ni izen igang azatse. <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" />Arim Anet bi tom batomaza wu, na ba tusung ngma bayɔng fɛ́ ba saas banet nɛ ba kpas ni inɛn, nɛ ngma bayɔng fɛ́ ba ras ntomong anyas ayɛt igwɔm wu. <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" />Ba bi ka ba bara ayɛt árong fɛ́ a ya makiyi, azɔng wu ba bi tos, na ba ros anyi bá. <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" />Wat bafi kusot atsak, bi ron ti kunom ayɛt igwɔm ada bá. Ayɔng fɛ́ a bɛ̀ kuto, won na a fok ifɛ̀.<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Igorok icɛɛt naton kurúm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />&lt;&lt;Igwɔm azanɛn se tɛ kurúm fɛ́ ba nɛt ni mben. Ni izen fɛ́ akak sɛ kurúm e, a tsɛ a nɛt iko azɔng bà, nek iyɛ ikan, a tsɛ a rɛp ngma kusum ikyɛng fɛ́ a bɛ̀, a tsɛ a di shan ikɔ me.<verse eid="MAT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />&lt;&lt;Kpaf anɔng, igwɔm azanɛn se tɛ agbat anet ijik fɛ́ a shashang ata fɛ́ a bi itsɔm makiyi. <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />Fɛ́ a sɛ kuta kutek kuzining kufi itsɔm makiyi, a tsɛ rɛɛs ngma ikyɛng fɛ́ a bɛ̀, a tsɛ a di shan iko.<verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Igorok icɛɛt naton <optbreak /> agunung iyisik ízos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />&lt;&lt;Igwɔm azanɛn se tɛ agunung iyisik ìzos, fɛ́ ba ta iwu ayɛt idung, a yisik nzam-nzam ìzos. <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" />Izen fɛ́ a shining, banet iyisik ìzos e, kɔrɔk iwu sak ni ice ibanang. Wat ba sosok aben, ba kasa ìzos itek, ba te na akɔmɔng, ba nosong iduk e yik-yik. <verse eid="MAT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />I bi te kpaf anɔng ni izen igang azatse. Batomaza bi bɛ́ ba kaba banet anyas nɛ bafi kusot atsak <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" />ba bi bara bafɛ́ anyas e ayɛt árong fɛ́ a ya makiyi, azɔng wu fɛ́ ba bi tos nɛ ba ros anyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />AYeso ka ba rip yɛ, &lt;&lt;Iyin yɔng i rēn yin ngma nkyɔrɔk e yɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:51">Ba fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ey.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />A fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Nek anɔng, ngma anet itees ntsi fɛ́ ba mi ku tees naton igwɔm azanɛn, a se tɛ atekari fɛ́ a turung kurúm kufas ni kuzen narɔ fɛ́ a di tusung.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Banet aNazaret raba aYeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />Ama fɛ́ aYeso mi gang igorok ncɛɛt e yɔng, a won karɔ me yɔng. <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" />A bun sak ni wɔp wu. A tees banet narɔ inyis baYahuda azɔng, ayɔɔt ka ba yisik, nɛ ba nye, &lt;&lt;Anet yong sɛ kutsitsɛng kutsik kang akɛ? A sɛ agap iras kutomong abes kang akɛ? <verse eid="MAT 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />A barɔ! Arim anet kutomong itosop ákon yong awɛ? Anyining yɔng ba ku yes aMarya awɛ? Barunyining yɔng ba yet ba: aYakubu, nɛ aYusufu, nɛ aSiman, nɛ aJudas awɛ? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />Banganyining yɔng ba se ni mbɔk yit awɛ? Anet yong tsɛ a ne ni nkyɔrɔk nang akɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" />Ayɛ bá wɛt a beseng ni iwu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:57">Awɛt aYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Banet ngma ba nesek atan iratek, nkum banet iwɔp wu, nɛ bafɛ́ ari wu kyɛk fɛ́ ba ku byɛs.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />A kyem a nye kutomong abes dot azɔng awo, nek avit atsak bà.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="s">Iku aYohana anet aBatisma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />Ni izen yɔng, aGbat agwɔm aHiridus fok kucɛɛt fɛ́ banet nye naton aYeso. <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />Wat a fɛ̀ na bafi itomong wu, &lt;&lt;Anet yong da yet aYohana anet abatisma. Ba mi tɛ ba dorok kukom wu! Nek anɔng wu fɛ́ a di bɛ̀ agap iras ntomong abes anɔng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3" />Nek aHiridus kin tekap aYohana, a rosom, a ku sak ari inyang, ikyɛng fi i sak a kin nye anɔng yet fok, aHiridus kin sok aHirodiya, abin arunyining aFilibus, <verse eid="MAT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4" />nek aYohana woso nye ni iwu yɛ, &lt;&lt;I se yɛɛt fi i sok abin arunyining ni weneng awo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />AHiridus shim a fɛt aYohana, awɛt a nɛ foos nnyim banet, nek banet sok aYohana yet atan.<verse eid="MAT 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />Atuk fɛ́ aHiridus kin yiring ni kunom ites wu, angas aHirodiya kin to ashon batsen fɛ́ ba kin rini. Nato me kin tɛrɛk aHiridus iyɛ makiyi. <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />Nek anɔng, a nɔɔk angas kanu ngma ni kushi yɛ, a da ku nɔɔk ngma ikyɛng fɛ́ a rip. <verse eid="MAT 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Nggɔ ka ka ka te kyɛbɛt ni ifɛ̀ fok, na ka fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Di sak ice aYohana anet abatisma aze ni kube!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />Agbat agwɔm nɔ kudaam, awɛt nek kushi fɛ́ a mi tsang nye, nɛ batsen wu, a nɔɔk kanu fok na ba ka ka nɔɔk ngma ikyɛng fɛ́ ka shim. <verse eid="MAT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />A sak na ba tsɛ ba tun ice aYohana anet abatisma ari inyang. <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />Ba sok ice me ni kube, ba tsɛ ba nɔɔk kanamang e, ka tsɛ ka nɔɔk anyining. <verse eid="MAT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />Bafi imɛɛs aYohana anet abatisma, tsɛ ba sok kukum e, ba tsɛ ba nɛt iko. Ama anɔng, ba tsɛ, ba tak aYeso.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso ya nɛ banet fɛ́ <optbreak /> ba wat agup atoon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Ni izen fɛ́ aYeso fok ikyɛng fi i te nɛ aYohana, a nɔ ayɛt kukyɛ ashi, a tat sak ni nyi ku yá, karɔ fɛ́ vit banet azɔng, a tsɛ a sonong aziwu. Ni izen fɛ́ banet fok anɔng, ba wosong nwɔp bá, ba yit irèn sak azɔng na atak. <verse eid="MAT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Ni izen fɛ́ aYeso tik ayɛt kukyɛ ashi, a di kudyɛng banet, a fok angmishish bà, a tes bafi nrɔk bá kyang.<verse eid="MAT 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Fɛ́ kahwyɛ bɛ́ bakat, bafi imɛɛs wu, bɛ́ ba ku sɛ, ba fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Di kunom mi tse, karɔ kang se wiin. Te banet e ni irèn, nɛ ba nɔ na naban wɔp, na ba tsɛ ba tsɛt ice bá ikyɛng iya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Wat aYeso fɛ̀ ni iba yɛ, &lt;&lt;I se gbing-gbing na ba tseng awo, iyin ka ba nɔɔk yin ikyɛng iya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />Ba fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Vit iyit ni ikikak azeng, nkum ágbang akpam atoon, ni ìzos ifaa kyɛk.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />A fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Bɛ́ yin ni ide aze.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />Wat a fɛ̀ na ba ka ba sas na ba sosok naton agam. A sok ágbang akpam atoon e, ni ìzos ifaa me, a ta ayisi sak azanɛn, a nɔɔk ifeng sak narɔ Adakunom nek ide, a bushung, a nɔɔk bafi imɛɛs wu, na ba kabasa banet e. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />Banet ngma kusum, ba yas ba hwyas. Ishɛrɛp e tuk, wɛt bafi imɛɛs wu, shining nakɔmɔng kusɔk abe afaa, na fi icɛk e fi i tuk. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />Kudot banet fɛ́ ba kin yas e, kin se batek wɔɔn ba agup atoon, dang nnon nɛ banyining.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso tseng naton ashi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Ba tsin gang idɔng, aYeso wat a sak bafi imɛɛs wu, na ba nɔ ayɛt kukyɛ ashi me, na ba tseng ashon wu sak ni nyi ku yá, nɔng iwu da te banet ni irèn. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23" />Ama fɛ́ a mi te banet e ni irèn, iwu aziwu a tsɛ a ngarak ni ihwyanang, a ra awon. Kawuwuri ku sɛ azɔng aziwu, <verse eid="MAT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24" />ni izen e yɔng, kukyɛ ashi me, mi tsang tseng yik-yik. Ne agbos ashi woso zim kukyɛ ashi me makiyi, nɛ awun ka ba yirik sak ama.<verse eid="MAT 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" />Bakat itsɔm itaat ifɛ́ adiding, aYeso tsin tseng naton ashi sak itse narɔ bá. <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />Izen fɛ́ bafi imɛɛs e ku di na tsin tseng naton ashi, nnyim ka ba yit, ba fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Yɛ afaben!&gt;&gt; Wat iba ta nkun nek nnyim.<verse eid="MAT 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Wat aYeso wat a fɛrɛng ni iba yɛ, &lt;&lt;Tekap yin ayɛ yin! Imi wu. I bi fok yin nnyim awo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />Wat aBitrus fɛ̀ ni iwu yɛ, &lt;&lt;ATisa, kɛ a yet ngɔn yɔng, fɛ̀ ni imi, ni in shesh naton ashi in da sɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />A fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Bɛ́.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 14:29">Wat aBitrus wuruk ayɛt kukyɛ ashi me, a kpa tseng naton ashi sak ibɛ narɔ aYeso. <verse eid="MAT 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />Izen fɛ́ a di awun fɛ́ a fɛsɛm nɛ agap, nnyim ku yit, a kpa nye rep. A ta kukun yɛ, &lt;&lt;ATisa, di sheshek!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />Wat aYeso wat a ta kubɔk, a ku yit mo, a fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn anet inɔɔk atsak igyebet, akyɛ sak fi iyɛ ngɔn to yɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />Ni izen fɛ́ ba nɔ ayɛt kukyɛ ashi me, kuwun e nyeseng ting. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />Wat bayɔng fɛ́ ba se ayɛt kukyɛ ashi me, kpa ku ya ntong, nɛ ba nye, &lt;&lt;Na tsak e, ngɔn wu i yet Arim Adakunom!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso te banet <optbreak /> aJɛnɛsarɛt kyang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />Ama fɛ́ ba tat sak ni nyi ku yá me, ba nɔ ni mben aJɛnɛsarɛt. <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />Ni izen fɛ́ banet iwɔp e rēn fok aYeso yɔng, ba toos ni itom sak ni ishɛrɛp narɔ ngma kusum, banet ku bɛ́s nɛ ngma bafi nrɔk. <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />Ba ra awon fok na a ka ba won, na ba raas nanu ikpin wu. Ngma bayɔng fɛ́ ba raas, a ka ba te kyang.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="s">Itees naton ayɛ fɛ́ a se cɛ́l <optbreak /> nɛ ayɔng fɛ́ a se gbiridik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Ama anɔng, bakak ayɛt BaFarasi, nɛ bafi itees ntsi aMusa nɛ na aRushelima tse na aYeso, ba fɛ̀ ni iwu yɛ, <verse eid="MAT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />&lt;&lt;Akyɛ sak fɛ́ bafi imɛɛs ngɔn beseng nggɔn bashɔn yit ɛ? Nek ba raba dang kus mbɔk, ba da nɛ ba yas.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />AYeso ka ba bun ni ifɛ̀ yɛ, &lt;&lt;Awɛt akyɛ sak iyin beseng yin ntsi Adakunom tit nggɔn yin kyɛk ɛ? <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" />Nek Adakunom kin fɛ̀ yɛ, &lt;Nɔk ada ni nggɔ ngɔn iratek, wɛt a tɛ a fɛ̀ yɛ, Kaangan fɛ́ a tosong ada wu, ke nggɔ wu ayi, i se gbing-gbing na ba ku fɛt awɛ?&gt; <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5" />Awɛt iyin nye yin yɛ, anet na a fɛ̀ na ada wu ke nggɔ wu ayi yɛ, &lt;Ikyɛng fi in kin tsang fɛ̀ in da ka nɔk, in mi di nye Adakunom kunang.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6" />Wat ke anet ma fɛ̀ anɔng, ni iyin nye yin, i se gbing-gbing anet na a nɔɔk ada wu iratek awo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:6 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">ada wu iratek awo</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Afumung akak bɛ̀ ni nggɔ wu iratek awo.</char></note>. Na anɔng, fi i di beseng yin ifɛ̀ Adakunom nek i di kuus yin ntsi yin. <verse eid="MAT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />Iyin bafɛ́ nanu nafifaa! Nek anɔng wu fi atan aIshaya kin di cɛɛt ni ifɛ̀ Adakunom naton yin, fok,<verse eid="MAT 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />&lt;Banet bang, di nesek iratek</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:8">na nanu bá kyɛk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:8">awɛt ayɛ bá se yik-yik ni imi.<verse eid="MAT 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />Ba di ya ntong nabap</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:9">itees bá yet itees ntsi banet.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />AYeso yes kudyɛng banet e, a fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Wes yin ato, da rēn yin. <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" />Ayet ikyɛng dɔng fi inɔɔs nanu anet de fi i ku saas na a sot gbiridik awo, tit ikyɛng dɔng fi iwuru nanu anet e fi i ku saas na a sot gbiridik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />Ama anɔng, bafi imɛɛs wu, bɛ́ ba fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn rēn fok kucɛɛt fi i nye beseng BaFarasi iyɛ ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Kaakyi ikyɛng fɛ́ da aDa min fɛ́ a se azanɛn wu a tup ide awo, ba bi ngaat ide. <verse eid="MAT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14" />Ka ba won in, ba yet bakpatɔn, fɛ́ ba tsin kɔk bakpatɔn. Ke akpatɔn tsin kɔk afidang akpatɔn, ngma ba ba da tsɛ ba kpas ni bong.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />ABitrus fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Ki tak yit ikyɛng fi igorok icɛɛt e tonong.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />Wat aYeso ku rip yɛ, &lt;&lt;Tit iyin resek yin dang rēn yin ɛ? <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />Iyin yɛrɛ yin fɛ́ ngma ikyɛng fɛ́ anet ya, tung gosok nanu, sak ayɛt afaa, ni i ma wuru na abing awɛ? <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />Ikyɛng da fi iwuru nanu anet de, fi ines ni iyɛ, ide de i sak anet na a sot gbiridik. <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" />Nek ni iyɛ anet wu kuyiring kumaan e di nes, kuyɔng fi ku sak anet di fɛt akak, na di ra irɔs, na di ra kujang, ni itsang, ni mbɔɔs naton akak, ke na di beseng iyerek akak ayi. <verse eid="MAT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" />Nkyɔrɔk nang na fi in saas banet nɛ ba sot gbiridik. Kuyak vit ikusu mbɔk, bɛ́s ni ku gbiridik awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Anya aKanan fɛ́ a nyeseng <optbreak /> gak ni inɔɔk atsak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />AYeso dorok a won azɔng, a tseng sak ni mben aTiya nɛ aSidon. <verse eid="MAT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />Abining akak, afi iwɔp aKanan, fɛ́ a se abak azɔng, a bɛ́ ni wu, a sok kutɔ a da fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;ATisa hom, Arim agwɔm aDauda, kabɔk fok angmishish hom! Angas yin sɔ iyɔm makiyi ni bɔk itseng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iwu ikikak awo. Nek anɔng wu, bafi imɛɛs wu, di ban ni wu fok, &lt;&lt;Ku ro, na a tseng! Nek a yɔng a teng a ki kuus yit mo, na a ki daam yit ni iwɔng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />A bun ni ifɛ̀ yɛ, &lt;&lt;Ba di tom sak ni itsamang fi i mi wɛs, banet aIsrela kyɛk.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Abining e, bɛ́ a tsɛ gururuk ashon wu, a fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;ATisa, di se mo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Wat aYeso fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;I se gyat na ba sok kuyak nnon, na ba nɔɔk ákabu awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />Abining e shim, a fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Ey, aTisa i se anɔng, wɛt ngma na anɔng, ákabu ya icek nayak atekari ná, fɛ̀ a kpas aben.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />AYeso shim, a fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Nggɔ, inɔɔk atsak ngɔn bɛ̀ agap! Ba mi da tarang kudaam ngɔn.&gt;&gt; Ayɛt izen e yɔng, angas wu wat a sɛ kukyang.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso te banet dot kyang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />AYeso won karɔ me yɔng, a got abak ifam izek aGalili. Ama anɔng, a tsɛ a ngarak ihwyanang, a sonong azɔng. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Kudyɛng banet ku kuus mo sak azɔng. Ba tses na bayɔng fɛ́ ba yet bakun, nɛ bakpatɔn, nɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba yɔmɔng, nɛ bakpey, ni ishɛrɛp bakak dot. Ba tsɛ ba ka ba saas ashon wu, wat iwu ka ba tes kyang. <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />A te banet yɔɔt makiyi fɛ́ ba di bakpey cɛɛt, nɛ bakun tseng tabat, nɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba yɔmɔng tseng gyat, nɛ bakpatɔn yɛrɛ wɛshɛk, wat banet kusum tere Adakunom afi aIsrela.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso ya na banet <optbreak /> fɛ́ ba wat agup anaas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />AYeso yes bafi imɛɛs wu sak narɔ wu, a fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;In foos angmishish banet bang, nek nkɔs ba ntaat atut azeng ni imi, wɛt vit iba ni ikyɛng iya. Imi shim in ka ba te ni irèn ni nzong awo, nek nsong bá da rasak ni irèn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />Bafi imɛɛs wu ku rip yɛ, &lt;&lt;In da se yit ikyɛng iya akɛ nate ayit kang, fi in da nɔɔk yit kudyɛng banet tɛ ba bang ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />AYeso ka ba rip yɛ, &lt;&lt;Ágbang akpam amang fi i bɛ́ yin ɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 15:34">Iba fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;A se kanakataat nɛ nabin ìzos gyet kyɛk.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />AYeso te banet ngma na ba sosok aben. <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />Wat iwu sok ágbang akpam kanakataat nɛ nabin ìzos e, a nɔɔk ifeng sak na Adakunom, a kpa bushung e, na nesek bafi imɛɛs, ni iba kabasa banet e. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />Ngma ba, ba yas ba hwyas. Ama anɔng, bafi imɛɛs wu tusung icɛk e fi i kyɛk, ba sɛ nakɔmɔng kanakataat. <verse eid="MAT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />Kudot banet fɛ́ ba ya, kin se bamatek kyɛk agup anaas, dang ba di moon nɛ banyining ni nnon.<verse eid="MAT 15:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Anɔng wu, aYeso ka ba te mo ni irèn, a nɔ ayɛt kukyɛ ashi, a yit irèn sak ni mben aMagadan.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="s">Banet tsɛt aYeso <optbreak /> a ka ba tonong <optbreak /> ikyɛng idi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />Bakak ayɛt BaFarasi nɛ BaSadusi tsɛ na aYeso, nɔng ba bin ku mara. Ba fɛ̀ ni wu, yɛ na a ka ba tonong ikyɛng idi, fi i da sak ba di rēn fok iwu ne na Adakunom.<verse eid="MAT 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />Wat aYeso fɛ̀ ni iba yɛ, &lt;&lt;Ke kahwyɛ nye, nɛ kaza sɛng, ni nye yin, &lt;Ey yaa! Kaza da se gyat.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" />Wat nadiding, &lt;Ki i di yin kaza seng, nɛ anɔk, ni nye yin atut ba da sɛ aduk awun iza.&gt; Iyin fi irēn taas yin kaza, awɛt ni irēn nkyɔrɔk fi in tsin tes yɔkɔnɔng ki gaat yin. <verse eid="MAT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" />Banet nnu nang yet ámaane, ba raba ikuus Adakunom! Ba tsɛt fok ma ba ka ba tonong ikyɛng idi abes, awɛt vit ikyɛng fɛ́ ba da ka ba tonong tit ifɛ́ aYunana.&gt;&gt; AYeso ma ka ba won, a tseng.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYiis BaFarasi nɛ BaSadusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />Ni izen fɛ́ bafi imɛɛs aYeso tat sak ni nyi ku ya, ba te burum dang bereng akpam. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Ka na nye yin, nɔ yin ni nhwyɛ yin nɛ ayiis BaFarasi nɛ BaSadusi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Ba kpa cɛɛt wɔɔn ba, ba fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Ke nek in won yit dang bereng yit akpam ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />Wat aYeso rēn ikyɛng fɛ́ ba tsin cɛɛt natoon e, a ka ba rip yɛ, &lt;&lt;Iyin bafi inɔɔk atsak gyegyet, akyɛ sak fi icɛɛt yin wɔɔn yin ni di tes yin kucɛɛt ite burum akpam ɛ? <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" />Iyin resek yin dang rēn yin ɛ? Iyin mi te burum yin fi in kin ya nɛ banet agup atoon nɛ ágbang akpam atoon, nakɔmɔng namang fi iyin kin tusung yin ɛ? <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" />Ke i mi te burum yin fi in kin ya na banet agup anaas nɛ ágbang akpam kanakataat, nakɔmɔng namang fi iyin kin tusung yin ɛ? <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />Akyɛ sak fi i ki gaat yin irēn fok da akpam wu fi in di cɛɛt natoon e awɛ? Nye yin nhwyɛ nɛ ayiis BaFarasi nɛ BaSadusi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Ama anɔng, ba da nɛ ba rēn fok da aYeso tsin cɛɛt naton ayiis yɔng fɛ́ ba di nyes akpam awo, a se ni i ka ba tonong fok na ba nye nhwyɛ ni itees BaFarasi nɛ BaSadusi.<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">ABitrus nɔɔk kanu <optbreak /> ifɛ̀ naton aYeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Ni izen fɛ́ aYeso tsɛ ta ni mben aKaisariya aFilipi, a fɛ̀ na bafi imɛɛs wu, &lt;&lt;Banet fɛ̀, imi, Arim Anet yet angan ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />Wat iba fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Bakak fɛ̀, ngɔn yet aYohana anet abatisma; bakak fɛ̀, ngɔn yet aIliya; wɛt bakak nye, ngɔn yet aIrimiya ke azining ayɛt batan ayi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />Wat iwu ka ba rip yɛ, &lt;&lt;Awɛt iyin di yes yin angan ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />ASiman Bitrus ku bun ni ifɛ̀ ye, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn yet Anet-Isheshek, Arim Adakunom atset.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;ASiman arim aYunana, ngɔn yet anet awɛng, nek ayet kurɔm ko ku da tonong ikyɛng deng awo, ayet Ada hom fɛ́ a se naton aza wu. <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" />Nek anɔng, in tsin da tak, ngɔn yet aBitrus, naton kuta kang ko fi in di ki nok bafi ikuus hom, fɛ́ vit agap ari-irong fi ku da kyem ka ya agap bá. <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" />In da ka nɔk ícarak itarak katitu igwɔm azanɛn, ngma ikyɛng fi i tekpaf yin azatse, i da sot ni itekpaf azanɛn; ngma ikyɛng fi i bisik yin azatse, i da sot ni bisik azanɛn.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Ama anɔng, a kɔrɔk bafi imɛɛs wu me kuto, yɛ da na ba tak akak fok iwu wu a yet Anet-Isheshek e awo.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso tak kuri iku fɛ́ a bi ku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />Nkum izen e yɔng, aYeso kpa taas bafi imɛɛs wu ye, i se gbing-gbing na a tse na aRushelima, na a sɔ mgbang zizɛɛt ni bɔk bashɔn, nɛ bagbat áware, nɛ bafi itees ntsi aMusa. Ba bi ku fɛt, ni kunom kufɛ́ ataat, ba bi ku donong.<verse eid="MAT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />ABitrus ku kɔrɔk ni ifam, a ku gyɔng yɛ, &lt;&lt;ATisa, jɛm-jɛm! Ikyɛng deng da kyem ite ni ngɔn awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />AYeso tirik, a fɛ̀ na aBitrus, &lt;&lt;Sek azeng, aShetan! Ngɔn di yet kuta ituruk kutak, nek kuyiring ngɔn yet kufɛ́ Adakunom awo, tit kufɛ́ banet.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />Wɛt aYeso fɛ̀ na bafi imɛɛs wu, &lt;&lt;Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a shim a di kuus mo, i se gbing-gbing na a nɔɔk nwaa ice wu, na a sok kukum itegak wu, na a di kuus mo. <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" />Nek ayɔng fɛ́ a shim a sɛ kutset wu, a da bit iko; awɛt ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a te nwaa kutset wu, nek a di kuus mo, a da sɛ iko. <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" />Ke anet sɛ kazatse kang ngma kusum na bit kutset wu, wɛt itek e yet akyɛ? Ke akyɛ de fɛ́ anet da kyem a nɔɔk nanu kutset wu yɛ? <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" />Nek Arim Anet bi bɛ́ ayɛt ízɔk Ada wu nɛ batomaza, na anɔng wu, a bi tarang kaakyɛ anet izang wu kpaf ni kuri kutomong fɛ́ a kin ra. <verse eid="MAT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />Won in ki tak yin atsak, bakak di se ni nyeseng azeng, fɛ́ da ba bi bamang iku awo, sak izen ibun Arim Anet ayɛt igwɔm wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="s">Bafi imɛɛs aYeso bataat <optbreak /> di ishesheng nse wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />Ama nkɔs karataat, aYeso sok aBitrus nɛ aYakubu nɛ aYohana arunyining aYakubu me, ba tsɛ ba ngarak ihwyanang iratek ikak, ba tsɛ ba sot azɔng zɛɛt ba. <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />Wat ba di nse wu kpa shesheng na yisi bá. Ayisi wu ron tɛ kunom, ares wu gyɛs tɛ mgbey irong. <verse eid="MAT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Bafi imɛɛs wu bataat e, zɛngɛ ba wat ba di atan aMusa nɛ atan aIliya ku wuruk, ba tsin cɛɛt nɛ aYeso.<verse eid="MAT 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Wat aBitrus fɛ̀ nɛ aYeso, &lt;&lt;ATisa, i se yɛɛt ni in sot yit azeng. Ki ngɔn shim a, in da nok yit abut ataat azeng, kuzining nek ngɔn, kuzining nek aMusa, kuzining nek aIliya bà.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />Na tsin rēn cɛɛt, anɔk akan wat a ka ba te gyip, ba fok kutɔ ayɛt anɔk e yɛ, &lt;&lt;Arim hom yong, a yɔng fi in kushim, ni iwu fi in di bi itɛrɛk iyɛ makiyi. Fok yin ifɛ̀ wu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />Ni izen fɛ́ bafi imɛɛs e fok anɔng, ba kpa na ayisi gup aben nek nnyim. <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Awɛt aYeso bɛ́ a ka ba raas, wɛt a fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Dorok yin! I bi fok yin nnyim awo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />Ni izen fɛ́ ba sok ace naton, ba di vit akak azɔng nkum aYeso kyɛk. <figure style="fig" alt="Transfiguration" file="WA03858b.tif" size="col" loc="MAT 17:8" copy="Wade images" ref="17:1-8">Ishesheng nse aYeso</figure><verse eid="MAT 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />Ni izen fɛ́ ba se ni itisik sak aben ihwyanang e, aYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Da i bi tak yin akak ikyɛng fi i di yin ninyen awo, tit ama fɛ́ ba mi dorok Arim Anet ni iku.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />Bafi imɛɛs e ku rip yɛ, &lt;&lt;Akyɛ sak fɛ́ bafi itees ntsi aMusa nye fok, i se gbing-gbing ma aIliya tung bɛ́ ninyen ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />AYeso ka ba bun ni ifɛ̀ yɛ, &lt;&lt;AIliya mi bɛ̀, nɔng a da nye nkyɔrɔk fi in mi beseng. <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" />Awɛt imi fɛ̀ ni yin, aIliya man na a bɛ́, wɛt banet nɛ ba kurēn awo, iba ku nyes ikyɛng fɛ́ ba shim. Kpaf anɔng fɛ́ Arim Anet da sɔ izot ni mbɔk bá.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />Ne anɔng wu, fɛ́ bafi imɛɛs wu di rēn fok a se ni icɛɛt naton aYohana anet abatisma.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso te nggon <optbreak /> fɛ́ ka bi itseng kyang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />Fɛ́ ba tsɛ ba ta narɔ kudyɛng banet e, anet akak bɛ́ ne aYeso, a te gururuk ashon wu. <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />A fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;ATisa, fok angmishish arim hom, a kus itsitsiring, a sɔ izot makiyi. A tɛn na kpa ni rong, ni izen ikak na kpas na ashi. <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />I mi bɛ́ ni wu na bafi imɛɛs ngɔn, awɛt ba kyem ba ku te kyang awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Iyin bafi kuzam kang, fi i se yin vit inɔɔk atsak, ni kana boroso yin, sak akyɛ kuri izen fi in da woso tsesek ni iyin ɛ? Bɛ́ yin ni nggon e aze.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />AYeso gyɔng itseng e, i wuruk ayɛt nggon e, nkum izen e yɔng, nggon e wat ka te kyang.<verse eid="MAT 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />Ama anɔng, bafi imɛɛs e tsɛ narɔ aYeso ni nɛt, ba ku rip yɛ, &lt;&lt;Akyɛ sak itseng e ki gaat yit itun e yɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Nek inɔɔk atsak yin yet ibaane. Won in ki tak yin atsak, ki inɔɔk atsak yin yet ibaane ti kica amusta, i da kyem i fɛ̀ yin ni ihwyanang yɛ, &lt;Serek aze sak aza&gt; I da serek. Vit ikyɛng fi i da ki gaat yin.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Afumung akak afɛ́ ashon fɛ́ ba kin jɛk ni mbɔk bɛ̀ ibyat ifɛ́ </char><char style="fv">21</char> ane: <char style="fqa" closed="false">Awɛt ideng ikyɛng, ma nɛ awon, ni itekap anu, ba da nɛ ba di tun itseng e.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 17:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22" />Ni izen fɛ́ banet ngma kusum tsɛ ba nyim na aGalili, a fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Ba da nabak Arim Anet ni bɔk banet, <verse eid="MAT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23" />ba da ku fɛt, ni kunom kufɛ́ ataat, ba bi ku donong ni kutset.&gt;&gt; Bafi imɛɛs wu beseng iyɛ makiyi.<verse eid="MAT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itarasa itsɔm mben</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />Ama fɛ́ aYeso nɛ bafi imɛɛs wu tsɛ ba ta na aKafarnahum, bafi ishashang itsɔm mben nek inok kutu iya Adakunom ntong, tsɛ ba sɛ aBitrus ba fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Anet itees yin tarasa itsɔm mben awɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />A fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Ey, a tarasa.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:25">Ni izen fɛ́ aBitrus tsɛ a nɔ ari, aYeso wu a tung fɛrɛng, &lt;&lt;ASiman, ngɔn di anɛ? Bangan bá ba tarasa bágwɔm itsɔm inɔɔs ni itsɔm mben ɛ? Ayet nnon mben e ya? Ke banet baduk ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />ABitrus fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Na baduk.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:26">AYeso fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;A sot nnon mben e tarasa awo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" />Kɔn in bi ka ba beseng yit iyɛ, tse ni ikang, i da tsi barak iguk ngɔn. Ìzos yɔng fi i da tun yit, tarak kanu yɛ, i da sɛ kuta itsɔm kukan, tun iko, tsi ki tarang yit mo itsɔm inok kutu iya Adakunom ntong e, ifɔɔn ni inaan.<verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="s">Angan wu a wat ni iratek <optbreak /> ni igwɔm azanɛn ɛ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />Ni izen e yɔng, bafi imɛɛs aYeso bɛ́ ba ku rip yɛ, &lt;&lt;Angan wu a wat ni iratek ni igwɔm Azanɛn ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />AYeso yes nggon kabaane sak ni wu, a ka ka te ka nyeseng ashon bá, <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" />wɛt a fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Won in ki tak yin atsak, Ma nggɔn yin shesheng in sot ti in fi nnon, ke da anɔng awo, vit iyin ni inɔ ayɛt igwɔm Azanɛn. <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a ya kashon ni imen ice tɛ kaban nggon kà, iwu wu a wat ni iratek ni igwɔm Azanɛn. <verse eid="MAT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />Kaangan fɛ́ a shan nggon tɛ ka kang ni iyerek hom, imi wu a di shan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikyɛng fi ites <optbreak /> banet ikpas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />&lt;&lt;Ke anet akak te kazining ayɛt nnon nabaane na, na kpa ayɛt ishan atsak na, i da wat got gyat na ba rosom kunyin kuta-ikɔɔ ni tɔ anet e, na ba ku barak rep ayɛt izek itsik.<verse eid="MAT 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />&lt;&lt;Kawɛy se azatse kang, nek ka saas banet ba kpas ni inɛn, i se gbing-gbing banet na ba kpa ni inɛn! Awɛt kawɛy se naton ayɔng fɛ́ a tarak irèn ikpa me! <verse eid="MAT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />Ki kubɔk ngɔn, ki kutak ngɔn ayi da ka bɛ́ ni ikpa, tɛn iko, da barak. Kaduk ni inɔ ayɛt kutset vit igang ni kubɔk ke kutak kuzining ayi, aza fɛ́ ba da ka barak ari irong ni mbɔk nfa nɛ atak afaa. <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />Wat ke ayisi ngɔn da ka te ni ira inɛn, tun ide, barak. Kaduk ni inɔ ayɛt kutset vit igang ni iyisi izining, aza fɛ́ ba da ka barak ari irong nɛ ayisi afaa.<verse eid="MAT 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Igorok icɛɛt naton <optbreak /> itsamang fi i wey</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10" />&lt;&lt;Nɔ yin nhwyɛ yin, i bi byɛs yin kazining ayɛt nnon nang awo. Nek in tsin ki tak yin, batomaza ba se ashon aDa hom ayɛt azanɛn kaaki izen.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Afumung akak afɛ́ ashon fɛ́ ba kin jɛk ni mbɔk bɛ̀ ibyat ifɛ́ </char><char style="fv">11</char> ane: <char style="fqa" closed="false">Nek Arim Anet bɛ́ nɔng ka da tsɛt bayɔng fɛ́ ba mi wey.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />&lt;&lt;Iyin di yin anɛ? Ke anet bɛ̀ ítsamang anakat azining, wɛt izining ayɛt de wey, akyɛ fɛ́ a da nye yɛ? A da won ishɛrɛp anakat vit azining e ni ihwyanang, na tsɛ na tsɛt izining e yɔng fi i wey awɛ? <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />Ama fɛ́ a sɛ iye, in ki tak yin atsak, a da nye iyɛ ikan naton yɛ aza ishɛrɛp de anakat vit izining yɔng fi da i wey dɔng awo. <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />Idɔng kpaf anɔng, Ada yin fɛ́ a se azanɛn, da a shim kazining ayɛt naban e nang na ka wey awo.<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arunyining fɛ́ a <optbreak /> da nye inɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />&lt;&lt;Ke arunyining da nye inɛn, ngɔn tsɛ ni wu, da ku tonong inɛn wu, nkum yin bafaa kyɛk. Ke a da fok, a sot ngɔn mi ti ibun na arunyining. <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" />Awɛt ke a rawu dang na a da fok, ni ti ni tsɛ gung na anet azining ke bafaa ayi, &lt;Nɔng kaakyi ite kukun, da sɛ itis nanu banet bafaa ke bataat ayi.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 19:15">Iyɛrɛk Ntsi 19:15</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />Ke arunyining e rawu dang ka ba fok, ni tse ni kucɛɛt e ashon bafi ikuus, ke a rawu dang ka ba fok gbak, ku sok in tɛ afi nhwyi, ke anet ishashang itsɔm mben ayi.<verse eid="MAT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />&lt;&lt;Won in ki tak yin atsak, ngma ikyɛng fi irosom yin azatse, ida sot ni irosom azanɛn. Ngma ikyɛng fi ibisik yin azatse, ida sot ni ibisik azanɛn.<verse eid="MAT 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />&lt;&lt;Won in bang ki tak yin atsak, ke banet bafaa ayɛt yin azatse, ba fɛ̀ ey naton kaakyɛ fɛ́ ba rip ide ayɛt awon, Ada hom fɛ́ a se azanɛn da ki nye yin e. <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />Nek karɔ fɛ́ banet bafaa ke bataat ayi di nyim ni iyerek hom, imi se gung ni ibá.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Igorok icɛɛt naton asam <optbreak /> fɛ́ a se vit angmishish</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Ba se nɛ anɔng, aBitrus bɛ́ a rip aYeso yɛ, &lt;&lt;ATisa, tɛ kamang fɛ́ aruneng di ki ras inɛn ni in ku fuut e yɛ? Te kanakataat ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />AYeso fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Won in da tak, da ite kanakataat awo, tit ite kanakataat nsɔk kanakataat.<verse eid="MAT 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />&lt;&lt;Nek igwɔm Azanɛn se tɛ agwɔm akak fɛ́ a shim a fa kurúm wu fi ku se ni bɔk basam wu. <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />Ni izen fɛ́ a kpa ifá me, ba bɛ́ na anet akak fɛ́ agwɔm e ku kuus kuta atalen<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:24 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">atalen</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Kudot atalen yet itsɔm itarang anet nfɛ́ ayɛ nsɔk nfa. Kudot ayɛ me fɛ́ ba ku kuus yet ayɛ (200,000).</char></note> agup kusɔk. <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />Nek kuta me ku gaat itarang, atekari me sak na ba tsɛ ba rep anet e, nɛ abining wu, ni nnon wu, ni ikyɛng fɛ́ a bɛ̀ ngma kusum ba di tarang kuta me.<verse eid="MAT 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />&lt;&lt;Asam e kpa kpeshek ashon wu, a woso ra awon, &lt;Kabɔk, ban di nang kizen, in da tarang ngma ikyɛng fi i di kuus.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />Atekari asam e fok angmishish wu, a ku wosong kuta me, a ku won a tseng ari.<verse eid="MAT 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />&lt;&lt;Awɛt izen fɛ́ asam e yɔng wuruk azɔng, a se ni kutseet, a wat a nyim nɛ anet akak ayɛt bafidang itomong wu fi iwu ku kuus adinari<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:28 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">adinari</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Yet itarang anet itomong ifi kunom kuzining.</char></note> anakat azining. A firik afidang kutɔ, a fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;Di tarang ikyɛng fi in da kuus!&gt;<verse eid="MAT 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />&lt;&lt;Afidang e kpa a te akut aben, a ra awon ni wu yɛ, &lt;Kabɔk, di nang kizen in da ka tarang.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />&lt;&lt;Awɛt a rawu, a tsɛ a tekpaf afidang e ari inyang, ma a tarang kuta me. <verse eid="MAT 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />Ni izen fi ishɛrɛp basam itomong ari agwɔm e di ikyɛng fi ite, ikyɛng e ka ba beseng iyɛ makiyi, ba tsɛ ba tak atekari me ngma ikyɛng fi ite.<verse eid="MAT 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />&lt;&lt;Nek anɔng, atekari me sak na ba ku yes asam e yɔng fɛ́ a nye ikyɛng e dɔng, a fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;Ngɔn agwɔm kutomong anyas! Imi da wosong ngma ikyɛng fi in da kuus, nek kanak fi ngɔn tos sak ni imi. <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />Ki i se gyat ngɔn ni i fok kanak afidang itomong ngɔn bà, kpaf ti fi imi di fok kafɔɔn bà.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" />Iyɛ agwɔm e beseng makiyi, a wat a sok a nabak bafi itosok kari inyang e, na ba tsɛ ba ku nesek mgbang ma a tarang kaakyi ikyɛng fɛ́ ba ku kuus.<verse eid="MAT 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />&lt;&lt;Kpaf anɔng fɛ́ Ada hom fɛ́ a se azanɛn da nye ni iyin, ki i rayin dang fuut yin bafidin anɛn bá ni iyɛ yin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="s">Itees fɛ́ aYeso nye naton <optbreak /> ikam kuweneng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Ama fɛ́ aYeso mi gang itees e, a won mben aGalili, a tseng sak ni mben aJudiya, fi in se ni inyi kukyɛk aJodan. <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />Kudyɛng banet dot ku kuus mo, a ka ba tes kyang azɔng.<verse eid="MAT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />BaFarasi bakak tsɛ ba shim ba ku mara, ba ku rip, yɛ, &lt;&lt;Ntsi yit fɛ̀ ey, anet na arɔ abining wu nek kaakyi ikyɛng fi ite yɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Iyin ki mang fa yin ikyɛng fɛ́ ba jɛk ni kufumung ifɛ̀ Adakunom awɛ? Ba jɛk yɛ, ni imɛsɛng e, &lt;Adakunom ka ba nye, amatek nɛ abining.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" />A fɛ̀, &lt;Nek anɔng, anet da won ada wu ni nggɔ wu, na di basak na abining wu, nɛ bafaa me sot kurɔm kuzining.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" />Nkum atuk e yɔng da ba tɛ ba yet bafaa awo, tit kurɔm kuzining. Nek anɔng, ngma ikyɛng fɛ́ Adakunom mi mon, da anet akak na a kam ide awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />Ba fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Wat akyɛ sak fɛ́ aMusa fɛ̀ ni ijɛk wu, fok anet da kyem a nɔɔk abining wu kufumung ikam iweneng, na te abining e ni irèn ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />Wat aYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;AMusa kin ka ba won nɛ ba kam nweneng, nek ákashalang ayɛ fi iyin bɛ̀ yin. Awɛt ikyɛng e kin se anɔng ni imɛsɛng e awo. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" />Awɛt imi fɛ̀ ni yin, ngma anet fɛ́ a kam kuweneng nɛ abining wu, tit nek kujang, a tɛ a di bɔ akak, a se ni ira kujang.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Bafi imɛɛs wu fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Ki ikyɛng fi i se nate amatek nɛ abining yɔng, kaduk anet na a sot anɔng dang kuweneng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />Wat aYeso ka ba bun ni ifɛ̀ yɛ, &lt;&lt;Ayet kaakyɛ anet fɛ́ a da kyem a shan itees yeng awo, tit bayɔng fɛ́ Adakunom mi ka ba nɔɔk irēn ye kyɛk. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Bakak yet amaring neme ni ites ba. Wat bakak yet amaring, nek banet ka ba te ba sot anɔng. Wat bakak raba dang ra kuweneng nek iyɛ ngash igwɔm Azanɛn. Ayɔng fɛ́ a da kyem a shan itees yeng, na shan iye.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso tes nnon <optbreak /> nabaane awɛng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Ama anɔng, banet tses ni nnon sak na aYeso, nɔng a bin di saas mbɔk wu naton na, na te a di ras awon ni na. Awɛt bafi imɛɛs wu kpa ka ba kɔn.<verse eid="MAT 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Won yin nnon naban e na na bɛs ni imi! I bi ka ba ro yin awo, nek igwɔm Azanɛn yet ifɛ́ banet tɛ ba bang.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />Ama fɛ́ a mi di saas kubɔk azaton na, a ya kashon ni kutseet wu.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Acam akak fɛ́ <optbreak /> a bɛ̀ kurúm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />Atukak, anet akak tsɛ na aYeso, a ku rip yɛ, &lt;&lt;Anet itees atek, akyi ikyɛng itek fi in da ra, in di sɛ kutset vit igang ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />Wat aYeso fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Akyɛ sak fi ngɔn di risim naton ikyɛng fi iyet itek ɛ? Anet azining wu kyɛk fɛ́ a yet atek. Ki i shim i sɛ kutset, ni berese ntsi Adakunom nang.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />Anet e tɛ rip aYeso, &lt;&lt;Ntsi in ngan me yɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 19:18">AYeso fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;I bi fɛt akak awo; i bi ra kujang awo; i bi nye itsang awo; i bi bɔ mbɔɔs naton akak awo; <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" />nɔɔk ada ngɔn, ni nggɔ ngɔn iratek; shim afidang isot ngɔn ti ice ngɔn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />Acam e fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Imi mang bereng ntsi nang ngma, akyɛ fi i di kyɛk mo yɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />AYeso ku bun ni ifɛ̀ yɛ, &lt;&lt;Ki ngɔn shim i da sot gyat, tse da tsi irɛp ngma ikyɛng fi ngɔn bɛ̀, nɔng i da bin kaba bakan e, i da ma sɛ kurúm azanɛn. Ama anɔng, ni bi ni di kuus mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Ni izen fɛ́ acam e fok anɔng, a yit irèn ni ibeseng iyɛ, nek a bɛ̀ kurúm makiyi.<verse eid="MAT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Wat aYeso fɛ̀ na bafi imɛɛs wu, &lt;&lt;Won in ki tak yin atsak, i bi se ni mgbang fɛ́ arum da sɛ kunɔ ayɛt igwɔm Azanɛn! <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />Won in bang ki tak yin, i bi se kaduk itsaap-igung ni i nɔ ni iyisi kufet, aza fɛ́ arum da nɔ ayɛt igwɔm azanɛn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />Ni izen fɛ́ bafi imɛɛs wu me fok anɔng, ikyɛng e ka ba te yɔɔt makiyi, ba kpa kana risim, &lt;&lt;Wat ki ikyɛng e se anɔng, angan wu fɛ́ a bi kyem a sɛ isheshek e yɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />AYeso ka ba yɛrɛk, a ma fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Ikyɛng fi i gaat anet awe, kaakyi ikyɛng se begelek na Adakunom.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />ABitrus ku bun ni ifɛ̀ ye, &lt;&lt;Di, iyit yɔng in mi won yit kaakyi ikyɛng in da kuus yit mo! Akyɛ fi iyit da sɛ yit ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Won in ki tak yin atsak, na kazatse kafas fɛ́ ka bi ne, ni izen fɛ́ Arim Anet bi sonong ni ízɔk kuta igwɔm wu. Iyin fi i di kuus yin, iyin bi sosok yin na ata igwɔm kusɔk abe afaa, ni ras yin icén kusɔk abe afaa ifi aIsrela ishɔt. <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />Wɛt ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a mi wosong nasa, ke barunyining, ke banganyining, ke ada, ki nggɔ, ki nnon, ke akɔ ayi, nek imi, a da sɛ ikyɛng fi iwat idɔng hwyɛt, ama anɔng, a bi sɛ kutset vit igang. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" />Awɛt banet dot fɛ́ ba se ashon yɔkɔnɔng, bi bun bafɛ́ ama, nɛ bakak dot fɛ́ ba se ama yɔkɔnɔng, bi bun bafɛ́ ashon.<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="s">Banet itomong <optbreak /> ni ikɔ anap</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />&lt;&lt;Nek igwɔm azanɛn se tɛ atek ikɔ akak fɛ́ a wuruk bop nadiding, a tsɛ tsɛt banet itomong itsɔm, na ba tsɛ ba ra kutomong ni ikɔ anap wu. <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />Ni izen fɛ́ a sɛ banet e, ba ra ijik naton ikyɛng fɛ́ a da ka ba tarang, kaakyɛ anet da woso naton adinari azining, wɛt a ka ba yirik na ba tsɛ ba ra kutomong ni ikɔ wu me.<verse eid="MAT 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />&lt;&lt;Ni itsɔm bɔk agyɛng azining, a tɛ wuruk amatse, a tsɛ a sɛ banet bakak narɔ ijik ni nyeseng vit ikyɛng ira. <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />A fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;Iyin, tsi ra yin kutomong ni ikɔ anap hom bà; in da ki tarang yin ikyɛng fi i se kpaf.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />Ba fɛ̀ ey, ba yit irèn ba tseng.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:5">&lt;&lt;A tɛ wuruk ni ikaba kunom, nɛ ni itsɔm itaat ifɛ́ ahwyɛ, a tɛ nye kpaf anɔng. <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />Ni itsɔm bɔk itoon ifɛ́ ahwyɛ, a tɛ wuruk a tsɛ a sɛ bakak ni nyeseng kyɛk. A ka ba rip, &lt;Akyɛ sak fi iyin woso yin azeng ni nyeseng vit ikyɛng ira yɛ?&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />&lt;&lt;Wat iba fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;Vit ayɔng fɛ́ a mi bɛ́ a ki sok yit ni itomong.&gt; A fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;Iyin, tseng yin tsi ra yin kutomong ni ikɔ anap hom bà.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />&lt;&lt;Ni izen fɛ́ kahwyɛ nye, atek ikɔ me fɛ̀ na anet iyɛrɛ bafi itomong e, &lt;Yes banet fɛ́ ba ra kutomong ni ikɔ me. Ka ba tarang, tumung na bafɛ́ ama sak na bafɛ́ ashon.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />&lt;&lt;Banet itomong fɛ́ ba ka ba sok ni itsɔm bɔk itoon ifɛ́ ahwyɛ, kaangan ba shan adinari azining. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />Ni izen fɛ́ bayɔng fɛ́ ba tung ka ba sok nadiding bɛ́, ba yes gyan ifuu bá da wat ifɛ́ bafidang. Wat ba tarang kaangan ayɛt ba adinari azining bà. <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" />Ama fɛ́ ba shan itsɔm e, ba kpa ngɔɔt nanu sak na atek ikɔ me. <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" />Na ba nye, &lt;Di, banet bang fi i ka ba sok nama, fɛ́ ba ra kutomong irus itsɔm bɔk izining kyɛk, ngɔn ka ba tarang kpaf ni iyit, iyit fi in bɔrɔng yit ni kutomong, ánom tɛ a di gang ni yit.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />&lt;&lt;Awɛt a fɛ̀ na azining ba, &lt;Afidang hom, vit imaane fi in ki nye yin e. Ngɔn fɛ̀ ey fok i da woso naton adinari azining awɛ? <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />Shan itsɔm itomong ngɔn, da yit irèn. Ayet kushim in ni in nɔɔk anet fi in ku sok ni igang e kpaf ikyɛng fi in da ku nɔɔk. <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />Imi kyem fi in da nye ikyɛng fi iyɛ hom shim, ni itsɔm hom awɛ? Ke ngɔn nye ifup fok nek in bɛ̀ kubɔk washak ɛ?&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" />&lt;&lt;I se anɔng, bafi imɛsɛng e, bi bun bafɛ́ ama, bafɛ́ ama bi bun bafɛ́ ashon.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso tɛ a nye kucɛɛt <optbreak /> naton iku wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Ni izen fɛ́ aYeso se ni kutseet sak ne aRushelima, a kɔrɔk bafi imɛɛs wu kusɔk abe afaa me ni ifam, a fɛ̀ ni iba, <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" />&lt;&lt;Fok yin, iyit yɔng in tseng yit sak ni aRushelima, narɔ fɛ́ ba da nabak Arim Anet ni bɔk bagbat áware nɛ bafi itees ntsi aMusa. Iba da ku tsɛɛt ishɔt iku; <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" />ama anɔng, ba bi ku nabak ni bɔk Ícɛn-iduk, nɔng ba da ku tonong ibyɛs, nɔng ba da ku hwyereng, nɔng ba da ku tegak ni ikum. Ni kunom kufɛ́ ataat, ba bi ku donong ni kutset.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Awon fi nggɔ aYakubu <optbreak /> nɛ aYohana ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Ama anɔng, nggɔ nnon aZebedi tsɛ a aYeso, iwu ni nnon wu. A sak akut ashon wu, a tsɛt aYeso na a ku ra ikyikak.<verse eid="MAT 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />AYeso ku rip yɛ, &lt;&lt;Akyɛ fi ngɔn tsɛt ɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:21">Abining e fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Ikyɛng fi in shim yet, kazining ayɛt nnon in na ka sonong ni bɔk iyak ngɔn, kakak ni bɔk imen ngɔn ayɛt igwɔm ngɔn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />Wat aYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Iyin rēn yin ikyɛng fi i tsin ra yin awon e awo, iyin da kyem i sɔ yin ayɛt aridɛ fi in da sɔ yɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:22">Ba fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;In da kyem yit.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;I se gbing i da sɔ yin ayɛt aridɛ hom, awɛt ifi sonong ni yak ke ni men ayi, idɔng yet inaan awo. Ada hom wu a bi bɛ́ a nesek narɔ sak na bayɔng fɛ́ a mi tsang sak nek iba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Fi ishɛrɛp bafi imɛɛs kusɔk e fok anɔng, iyɛ ba beseng nɛ baruneng bafaa me. <verse eid="MAT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" />Wat aYeso ka ba yes ngma ba, a fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Iyin rēn yin fok bayɔng fɛ́ ba ya igwɔm naton bafi nhwyi, ba mɔɔt banet bá, bazɔk bá, tonoso kukyem naton banet e. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" />Awɛt, i da se anɔng ni iyin awo. Ke akak ayɛt yin shim a sot aratek nate yin, i se gbing-gbing na a sot anet itomong bafidang. <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a shim a sot afi imɛsɛng e, i se gbing-gbing na a sot asam bafidang. <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" />Kpaf kyɔn tɛ Arim Anet bɛ́ azatse, da nek ba ku ra isam awo tit iwu na a ra isam, na a nɔɔk kutset wu nek ibisik banet dot.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bakpatɔn bafaa fɛ́ ba <optbreak /> ka ba te kyang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Ni izen fɛ́ aYeso nɛ bafi imɛɛs wu tsin won aJeriko, kudyɛng banet ku kuus mo. <verse eid="MAT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Bakpatɔn bafaa kin se ni ifam irèn. Fɛ́ ba fok yɛ aYeso se ni igot, ba ta kutɔ na agap yɛ, &lt;&lt;ATisa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:30 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">ATisa</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Afumung akak afɛ́ ashon fɛ́ ba kin jɛk ni mbɔk bɛ̀ aTisa awo.</char></note>, Arim agwɔm aDauda! Fok angmishish yit!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Kudyɛng banet e ka ba kɔn, ba fɛ̀ ni iba, na ba te yuu. Wat iba bang fɛrɛng nya-nyat, yɛ, &lt;&lt;ATisa, Arim agwɔm aDauda, fok angmishish yit!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />AYeso nyeseng, a ka ba yes, a ka ba rip yɛ, &lt;&lt;Akyɛ fi iyin shim yin, in ki nye yin ne yɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />Iba fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;ATisa, iyit shim yit, ayisi yit na a tɛ a yɛrɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />AYeso fok angmishish ba, wɛt a ra ayisi bá. Ni izen izining, ba kpa yɛrɛ, ba wat ba kpa ku kuus mo.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="s">AYeso nɔ na aRushelima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />Ni izen fɛ́ aYeso nɛ bafi imɛɛs wu ta bakat nɛ aRushelima, ba sɛ kaban wɔp aBetafaji fɛ́ ka se ni Ihwyanang Ifat, aYeso tom bafi imɛɛs wu bafaa, <verse eid="MAT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />a fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Tseng yin sak naban wɔp ya fɛ́ ka se ashon yin. Ni tsin nɔɔs yin, i da di yin ka tarakai kakak ni rosom ni nggon yɛ. Bisik yin ide, da bɛ́ yin ne. <verse eid="MAT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />Ke anet akak ki rip yin ikyɛng kak, ni fɛ̀ yin ni iwu, &lt;ATisa wu a shim ide&gt;, iwu da wat a tom e ziri ziri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Ikyɛng deng te anɔng, nɔng ba di ki shining ikyɛng fɛ́ atan ki mang fɛ̀ yɛ,<verse eid="MAT 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />&lt;&lt;Tak yin banet aSihiyona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">&lt;Di yin agbat agwɔm yin yong</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">a wuruk sak narɔ yin!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">A men ni nhwyɛ wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">a ngarak naton ki tarakai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">a tsin tseng na kaban tarakai.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />Bafi imɛɛs wu me, tsɛ ba nye ikyɛng fɛ́ aYeso fɛ̀ ni iba. <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />Ba bɛ́ ni itarakai e ni ki nggon e me, ba turung ágɔdɔ bá, ba tarasa ina naton itarakai e, aYeso teyak ika. <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />Kudyɛng banet e turung ágɔdɔ bà, ba tarak naton irèn, ba tsɛ ba bushung atop izizerek, ba tarak ina naton irèn e. <verse eid="MAT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" />Kudyɛng banet fɛ́ ba se ashon na bayɔng fɛ́ ba se ama, ba tang ntɔ, na ba nye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">&lt;&lt;AHosana sak na arim aDauda!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">&lt;&lt;Awɛng se gung na ayɔng fɛ́ a bɛ́s</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:9">ni iyerek aTisa!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">&lt;&lt;AHosana, itere naton aza!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Ni izen fɛ́ aYeso nɔ ayɛt aRushelima, nhwyɛ banet iwɔp e dorok, ba kpa risim yɛ, &lt;&lt;Angan yong ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />Wat kudyɛng banet e, shim, ni ifɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Atan aYeso fɛ́ a ne na aNazaret ni mben aGalili yɔng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso ayɛt kutu iya <optbreak /> Adakunom ntong</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />AYeso nɔ na atasa karɔ iya Adakunom ntong, a ro ngma banet fɛ́ ba se ni ijik azɔng. A nye gup ákon banet ishesheng itsɔm, nɛ ákon isosok bafi irɛɛs ábɔp. <verse eid="MAT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;I se ni ijɛk ni fumung Adakunom fok, &lt;Ba da yes kari hom, kari awon,&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">AIshaya 56:7</ref></char>.</note> awɛt iyin mi tirik yin ika ka sot, &lt;karɔ inɛsɛk bafi itsang agap.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 7:11">ARimiya 7:11</ref></char>.</note>&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />Bakpatɔn nɛ banet bakun, tsɛ ba ku sɛ narɔ iya Adakunom ntong, a ka ba tes kyang. <verse eid="MAT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />Ni izen fɛ́ bagbat áware nɛ bafi itees ntsi aMusa di kutomong abes fɛ́ a se ne, ni nkun fi nnon tang ina, na na nye, &lt;&lt;AHosana sak na Arim agwɔm aDauda!&gt;&gt; Ikyɛng e ka ba beseng iyɛ.<verse eid="MAT 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" />Nek anɔng, ba rip aYeso yɛ, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn foos ikyɛng fi nnon nang taas awɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:16">AYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Ey, in mi fok. Iyin ki mang fa yin awɛ?&gt;&gt; Fɛ́ ba mang jɛk yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:16">&lt;&lt; &lt;Na nanu nnon nabaane nɛ na fi mbɔk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:16">fi itere atsak di nes.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 8:2">Abom 8:2</ref></char>.</note>&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />AYeso ka ba won, a wuruk ama iwɔp e sak na aBetani, a tsɛ a kɔsɔ azɔng.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso te kakon atafo kawɛy</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />Nadiding bop akatson, na tsin bun sak ayɛt iwɔp, nzong daam aYeso. <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />Fɛ́ a di kakon atafo kakak ni fam irèn, a tse bakat azɔng, a tsɛ a sɛ vit ica ni ka, wɔn afumung kyɛk. Wat a fɛ̀ ni ika, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn bi ti ites ica awo, ayɛ na ayɛ!&gt;&gt; Ni izen izining, kakon e wat kakoot.<verse eid="MAT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />Ni izen fɛ́ bafi imɛɛs wu di ikyɛng fi ite, ayɔɔt ka ba yit. Wat ba ku rip fok, &lt;&lt;Akyɛ sak kakon atafo me wat ka koot ziri anɔng ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Won in ki tak yin atsak, ki i bɛ́ yin inɔɔk atsak, vit ite digit, da nkum ikyɛng fɛ́ ba nye na kakon atafo me kyɛk fi i da kyem inye yin awo, i da kyem ni fɛ̀ yin ni ihwyanang ye, &lt;Tun ice ngɔn aze, tsi kpa ayɛt izek,&gt; i da te kpaf anɔng. <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" />Ki i bɛ́ yin inɔɔk atsak, i da sɛs yin ngma nkyɔrɔk fi irisim yin ina ayɛt awon.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ba nye irip ni i bi ice <optbreak /> fɛ́ aYeso bɛ̀</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />AYeso tɛ nɔ na atasa karɔ iya Adakunom ntong e. Ni izen fɛ́ a se ni itees banet, bagbat áware nɛ bashɔn iwɔp tse ni wu, ba ku rip yɛ, &lt;&lt;Ni ice angan wu fi ngɔn di iras nkyɔrɔk nang ɛ? Angan da nɔk ice deng ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Won in ki nye yin irip bà. Ki i di tak yin irip inaan, imi da ki tak yin nɛ akyi ice fi in di ras nkyɔrɔk nang e. <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" />AYohana anet abatisma kin sɛ ice iras abatisma wu akɛ? A kin sɛ na Adakunom a? Kɛ na banet ɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:25">Ba kpa cɛɛt wɔɔn bá, &lt;&lt;Awɛt akyɛ fi in da fɛ̀ yit ɛ? Ki in fɛ̀ yit yɛ, &lt;I kin ne na Adakunom&gt;, a yɔng a da ki rip yit, &lt;Awɛt akyɛ sak fi iyin kin shan yin atsak e ni wu awɛ?&gt; <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Ki in fɛ̀ yit, &lt;Narɔ banet&gt;, iyit foos yit nnyim ikyɛng fɛ́ banet da ki ra yit e, nek banet ngma kusum mi sok fok aYohana yet atan Adakunom.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Nek anɔng, iba fɛ̀ na aYeso, &lt;&lt;Iyit irēn yit awo.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:27">Wat iwu fɛ̀ ni iba bà, &lt;&lt;Imi bà, in da ki tak yin ni ice angan fi in di ras nkyɔrɔk nang awo.<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Igorok icɛɛt naton <optbreak /> nnon nafaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />&lt;&lt;Iyin di yin anɛ? Anet akak kin bɛ̀ nnon nafaa. A tse na akoo me, a fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;Arim hom, in shim i da tse i di ra kutomong ni ikɔ anap hom atut.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />&lt;&lt;Arim wu me fɛ̀ nɛ ada wu, &lt;Awɛy, imi da tse awo!&gt; Ama me, a da nɛ shesheng kuyiring wu, a tsɛ a ra kutomong e.<verse eid="MAT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />&lt;&lt;Atek e, tse na awosong e, a fɛ̀ ni wu kpaf ikyɛng fɛ́ a fɛ̀ na akoo me. Wat ari wu awosong e, a shim a fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;Ey, ada, imi da tse,&gt; wɛt a nɛ a tse awo.<verse eid="MAT 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />&lt;&lt;Angan ayɛt nnon nafaa me, fɛ́ a ra ikyɛng fɛ́ ada wu shim ɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Iba fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Akoo me.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Wat aYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Won in ki tak yin atsak: bafi ishashang itsɔm mben, ni ínyak agwɔm bi tun nɔs ayɛt igwɔm Adakunom aza yin. <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" />Nek aYohana anet abatisma kin bɛ́ nek a ki tonong yin irèn atsak ikyɛng fɛ́ Adakunom shim ni i nye yin, iyin rayin dang shan yin atsak ni ifɛ̀ wu, awɛt bafi ishashang itsɔm mben, ni ínyak agwɔm ba bi shan atsak ni wu. Ngma ni ikyɛng fi iyin di yin e, i rayin dang shesheng yin ayɛ yin, ni i di shan yin atsak.<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Igorok icɛɛt naton banet <optbreak /> iyɛrɛ igɔɔt anap</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />&lt;&lt;Kɔ fok yin, igorok icɛɛt ikak yɛ: Anet akak kin kap ikɔ, a di tuus nakon anap. A tɛnɛng igɔɔt e ni kubat gyat, a di ta ibong karɔ ifii ica anap e, a tɛ nok iriyɔng fɛ́ anet iyɛrɛ igɔɔt e di ki sosok. A sok igɔɔt e, a won iye ni bɔk banet fɛ́ ba sok iye ni itsɔm, a da nɛ nye kutseet sak ni iwɔp kukak. <verse eid="MAT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />Fi izen itusung kuyak nye, a tom basam wu sak na bafi iyɛrɛ igɔɔt e, yɛ na ba ku shan kanu kafuu ayɛt ikyɛng fi i mi been.<verse eid="MAT 21:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />&lt;&lt;Wat bafi iyɛrɛ igɔɔt e yisik basam e, ba tsot azining, ba da bin fɛt azining, ba woro azining na ata. <verse eid="MAT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />Atek igɔɔt e, tɛ a tom basam wu bakak fɛ́ ba got bafi imɛsɛng e ni kudot. Wat bafi iyɛrɛ igɔɔt e, tɛ ba nye ni iba kpaf ikyɛng fɛ́ ba di nye na bafi imɛsɛng e. <verse eid="MAT 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />Ni igang e, a tom ari wu sak ni ba, a fɛ̀ nyan, &lt;Ba da fok kunanang ari hom.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />&lt;&lt;Awɛt ni izen fɛ́ bafi iyɛrɛ igɔɔt e di ari wu me, ba fɛ̀, &lt;Anet iya kurúm e yong. Bɛ́ yin, in fɛt yit iwu, nɔng kurúm e da sot kufiit!&gt; <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" />Ba tsɛ ba ku yit, ba sok ba barak ama kubat, ba tsɛ ba fɛt.<verse eid="MAT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />&lt;&lt;Nek anɔng, ke atek ikɔ me bɛ́s wu, akyɛ fɛ́ a bi nye nɛ bafi iyɛrɛ ikɔ me yɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />Iba fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;A bi fɛɛs banet anyas yɔng, na ma sok ikɔ me, na nɔk bafi itomong e bakak, bayɔng fɛ́ ba da ku nesek kanu kafuu kafi ica nakon e, ni izen fɛ́ na been.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, Iyin ki mang fa yin ikyɛng fi i se ni ijɛk ayɛt afumung ifɛ̀ Adakunom awɛ? Yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">&lt;&lt; &lt;Kuta yɔng fɛ́ banet inok raba iko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">ku mi sot kuta itsok itu kutek.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">Ikyɛng fɛ́ aTisa nye dɔng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">iyet ikyɛng ayɔɔt na ayisi yit.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />&lt;&lt;Nek anɔng, in tsin ki tak yin, ba da shan igwɔm azanɛn ni yin, ba da nɔɔk bakak fɛ́ ba da ra kutomong yɔng fɛ́ ku da ta ice fɛ́ Adakunom shim. <verse eid="MAT 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />Ngma anet fɛ́ a kpa ni kuta kang, a da kana bushung acɛk-acɛk e, awɛt ki kuta me ko ku di kpa na anet e, ku da ku kɔɔ minin ti nkpe.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Afumung akak afɛ́ yame bɛ̀ ibyat </char><char style="fv">44</char> awo.</note><verse eid="MAT 21:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />Ni izen fɛ́ bagbat áware nɛ BaFarasi fok nzam-nzam igorok icɛɛt fɛ́ aYeso ras, ba wat ba rēn fok a se ni icɛɛt naton ba. <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />Ba tsɛt irèn fɛ́ ba da ku yit mo. Wat iba foos nnyim kudyɛng banet e, nek ba mi sok aYeso naton ayet atan fɛ́ a ne na Adakunom.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="s">Igorok icɛɛt naton amok iweneng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />AYeso tɛ nye banet igorok icɛɛt, a fɛ̀, <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" />&lt;&lt;Igwɔm azanɛn se tɛ agbat agwɔm akak fɛ́ a moon amok iweneng nek ari wu. <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />A tom basam wu na ba tse sak na bayɔng fɛ́ ba mi ka ba rini nek amok e, na ba ka ba yes na ba bɛ́, awɛt banet e raba dang tse.<verse eid="MAT 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />&lt;&lt;A tɛ tom basam e bakak sak na bayɔng fɛ́ ba ka ba rini me yɛ nɛ ba ka ba tak fok, &lt;In mi gang inye kaakyɛ ifɛ́ amok e: Ba mi tsɛk ámung ni ínyak fi i nɔ makiyi, ba mi gang kaakyɛ. Bɛ́ yin amok kuweneng e.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />&lt;&lt;Wat bayɔng fɛ́ ba ka ba rini me di te nhwyɛ ba ni ifɛ̀ me awo, ba ya kashon ni inye ikyɛng fi i se ashon ba kyɛk: Akak tse ni ikɔ wu, akak tse narɔ ijik wu. <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" />Wat ishɛrɛp ba, yisik basam e, ba tsosok zii, ba fɛs iba. <verse eid="MAT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />Agbat agwɔm e nye kafa kawe makiyi. Nek anɔng, a tom batsom wu, ba tsɛ ba fɛs bafi ifɛs banet yɔng, ba di kas árong ni wɔp bá me.<verse eid="MAT 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />&lt;&lt;Ama anɔng, agwɔm e fɛ̀ na basam wu, &lt;Ba mi gang inye nayak amok iweneng e, awɛt bayɔng fɛ́ ba ka ba rini me, bi ízɔk e awo. <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />Nek anɔng, di kuus yin agbat irén, yes yin ngma bayɔng fi i kyem i sɛ yin.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />Basam e wuru, ba kuus agbat irén, ba tusung ngma banet fɛ́ ba kyem ba sɛ, ngma batek e nɛ aduk e, nek anɔng kutu amok iweneng e shining na batsen.<verse eid="MAT 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />&lt;&lt;Awɛt izen fɛ́ agbat agwɔm e nɔ, nɔng a da bin di batsen e, a di anet akak azɔng fɛ́ da a te ares fɛ́ a yet afɛ́ amok iweneng e awo. <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />A ku rip yɛ, &lt;Arɔ, ngɔn tsa anɛ fi inɔ azeng, dang te ares fɛ́ a yet afi iweneng ɛ?&gt; Anet e di wey yuu.<verse eid="MAT 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" />&lt;&lt;Wat agwɔm e fɛ̀ nɛ banet itomong wu, &lt;Ku rosom yin, mbɔk nɛ atak, da barak yin iwu ni rin amatse, azɔng fɛ́ ba da tos ni ros anyi.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />&lt;&lt;A yet banet dot fɛ́ ba rini, awɛt gyet fɛ́ ba kasa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Irip naton itarasa itsɔm mben</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />Ama anɔng, BaFarasi tsɛ ba tɔ ikyɛng fɛ́ ba da nye ba di yit aYeso ni ifɛ̀. <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />Ba tom bakak ayɛt bafi ikuus bà nɛ banet-aHiridus na ba tse ni wu, wɛt iba fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Anet itees, iyit irēn yit ngɔn yet anet fi i bɛ̀ atsak na anu. Ngɔn tees banet kucɛɛt Adakunom kufɛ́ atsak. Vit ngɔn ni ishim ice, nek banet ngma kusum ba yet ikyɛng izining ashon ngɔn. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />Ki tak yit ikyɛng fi ngɔn di i se kpaf. Ni ku di ngɔn, ntsi yit fɛ̀ ni in tarasa yit aKaisar agwɔm aRoma itsɔm mben a? Ke Awɛy ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Wat aYeso mi rēn kuyiring anyas bà, a fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Iyin bafɛ́ nanu nafifa, akyɛ sak fi i di tsɛt yin ni inɛn ni ifɛ̀ hom ɛ? <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />Di tonong yin itsɔm fi i di tarasa yin itsɔm mben e.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:19">Ba ku bɛ́ ni ica itsɔm aRoma me, <verse eid="MAT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />a ka ba rip yɛ, &lt;&lt;Nawu angan, ni iyerek angan de fɛ́ ba di te naton itsɔm e yɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />Ba fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Na fɛ́ aKaisar.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:21">A fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Nɔk yin aKaisar ikyɛng fi iyet ifɛ́ aKaisar, ni nɔk yin Adakunom ikyɛng fi iyet ifɛ́ Adakunom.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Ni izen fɛ́ ba fok anɔng, ikyɛng e wɛt i ka ba te kpɔrɔk, ba ku won, ba tseng.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Irip naton idoro bafaben</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />Atuk e yɔng, BaSadusi tse na aYeso. Iba wu ba nye fok vit idoro bafaben. <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" />Ba tsɛ ba ku rip yɛ, &lt;&lt;Anet itees, aMusa kin fɛ̀, &lt;Ke akak ku dang tes nnon, i se gbing-gbing arunyining na bereng abining e, a ku tsɛt mo izit.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Fok, barɔ bakak kanakataat nin nggɔ bá kin se azeng ni yit, afi imɛsɛng e bɔ abining, a bɛ́ a ku dang nggon, nek anɔng, arunyining bɛ́ a sok abining e. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Iwu tɛ a di ku anɔng bà dang nggon. Afɛ́ ataat sak afɛ kanakataat bɛ́ ba di sot nɛ abining e, ba di kus anɔng vit kutes. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />Ama me, abining e nɛ a ku. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />Wat ni izen idoro bafaben, abining e bi yet afɛ́ angan ayɛt banet kanakataat yɔng ɛ? Nek kaangan bá mi sot ni wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Iyin wey yin irèn nek vit iyin ni irēn ikyɛng fi kufumung Adakunom fɛ̀ ni kukyem wu. <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />Nek izen idoro bafaben, bamatek bi tɛ ba ras nweneng awo, banyining bi tɛ ba tsees nweneng awo. Ba bi sot tɛ batomaza. <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />Naton idoro bafaben, iyin ki mang fa yin ikyɛng fɛ́ Adakunom kin fɛ̀ ni iyin awɛ? Ba kin jɛk yɛ, <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" />&lt;Imi wu in yet Adakunom aIbrahim, Adakunom aIshaku, nɛ Adakunom aYakub.&gt; Idɔng tonong yɛ, a yet Adakunom bafi kutset, da afɛ́ bafaben awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Ni izen fɛ́ kudyɛng banet e fok itees wu me, ikyɛng e ka ba te kpɔrɔk.<verse eid="MAT 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Agbat-ifɛ̀ iratek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />Ni izen fɛ́ BaFarasi di aYeso mi mees BaSadusi ni kucɛɛt, iba tsɛ ba kana tusung. <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35" />Azining ayɛt ba, fɛ́ a yet agwɔm irēn ntsi aMusa, tsɛ a ku mara ni irip yɛ, <verse eid="MAT 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />&lt;&lt;Anet Itees, akyɛ agbat-ifɛ̀ fi iwat iratek ngma ayɛt ntsi aMusa yɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt; &lt;Shim Adakunom ni iyɛ ngɔn ngma, ni kutset ngɔn, ni kuyiring ngɔn ngma kusum.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38" />Ntsi nang na fi in yet nfɛ́ ashon e, ni in yɔng fi in wat ni iratek. <verse eid="MAT 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" />Nfɛ́ afaa fi in se ti iyɔng e yet: &lt;Shim afidang isot ngɔn ti ice ngɔn.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" />Ngma ishɛrɛp ntsi ni ijɛk afumung batan e, nye shɛɛt naton nfaa nang.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Irip naton arim anet fɛ́ <optbreak /> a yet Anet-Isheshek e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />Ni izen fɛ́ BaFarasi me mi kana tusung, aYeso ka ba rip yɛ, <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" />&lt;&lt;Iyin di yin tɛ Anet-Isheshek e yet angan ɛ? A yet arim angan ɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:42">Ba fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;A yet arim aDauda.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />A fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Wɛt akyɛ sak Kabik te aDauda ku yes aTisa yɛ? Nek aDauda kin fɛ̀ yɛ,<verse eid="MAT 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />&lt;ATisa fɛ̀ na aTisa hom:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">&lt;&lt;Sonong aze ni ibɔk iyak hom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 22:44">ma in sak bafi fa ni ngɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">na ba kpa natak ngɔn.&gt;&gt; &gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Abom 110:1</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="MAT 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />Ke aDauda kin ku yes &lt;ATisa,&gt; nɛ anɛ fɛ́ Anet-Isheshek e da sot arim aDauda kong ɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />Vit anet fɛ́ a kyem a fɛ̀ na aYeso ikikak. Nkum atuk e yɔng, vit anet fɛ́ a tɛ bɛ̀ agap iyɛ a tɛ a ku rip ikikak.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="s">AYeso tarak itees banet <optbreak /> naton nggɔn bafi itees ntsi <optbreak /> aMusa nɛ BaFarasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Ama anɔng, aYeso cɛɛt ni kudyɛng banet nɛ bafi imɛɛs wu, yɛ, <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />&lt;&lt;Bafi itees ntsi aMusa nɛ BaFarasi, ibá bá ba ka ba nɔk kukyem itees banet ntsi aMusa. <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" />Nek anɔng, nye yin ngma ikyɛng fi iba ki itees yin, di kuus yin itees e. Awɛt iyin bi di kuus yin nggɔn bá awo, nek iba nyes ikyɛng fɛ́ ba itees awo. <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />Ba rosom banet adiring ares fɛ́ a wat agap ba, na ba ka ba saas e naton ace-mbɔk, wɛt ni iba raba dang ka ba ta mo itsambɔk na acet e ngma.<verse eid="MAT 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" />&lt;&lt;Kaakyi ikyɛng fɛ́ ba nye, ba nye mok banet ka ba di mo kyɛk: Ba rosom anyin-anyin alaw fɛ́ ba di jɛk Ifɛ̀ Adakunom na natii bá, ba tɛ ba di barasa agboo akpin asɔp bà.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ba roos anyin-anyin alaw e nɛ ibarasa acɛk akpin na agboo akpin e, nɔng banet ba bin di tonong banet fok iba ba ba kuus Adakunom gyat yɛɛt.</char></note> Nɔng banet bin di fok iba kuus Adakunom gyet awo. <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />Ba tsɛsɛk narɔ isosok agbat banet na narɔ kuyak nɛ narɔ isosok naratek na narɔ inyis baYahuda, <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />ba tsɛsɛk banet na ba ka ba nye ashow na narɔ ijik, na ba tɛ ba ka ba yes, &lt;Anet itees.&gt;<figure style="fig" alt="A mang with a phylactery" file="hk00274c.tif" size="col" loc="23:7" copy="Horace Knowles Images" ref="23:5-7">Kunyin kulaw natii nɛ acɛk akpin luu</figure><verse eid="MAT 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />&lt;&lt;Awɛt iyin, i bi shim yin banet ki yes yin, &lt;Anet itees&gt; awo, nek ngma yin i yet yin baruneng, anet itees yet azining kyɛk. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />Iyin bi yes yin anet akak azatse, &lt;ada,&gt; awo nek iyin bɛ̀ yin Ada azining, ayɔng fɛ́ a se azanɛn. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />I bi won yin ba ki yes yin, &lt;anet itees&gt; awo, nek Anet itees yin yet azining, Anet-Isheshek. <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" />Won ayɔng fɛ́ a wat ni iratek ayɛt yin, na a sot anet itomong yin. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" />Nek ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a sok ice wu garang, ba da ku tik lɛɛ, wɛt ayɔng fɛ́ a tik ice wu lɛɛ, ba da ku sok garang.<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13" />&lt;&lt;Kawɛy se gung ni iyin Bafi itees ntsi aMusa nɛ BaFarasi! Bafɛ́ nanu nafifaa! I mi tɛnɛng yin banet irèn inɔs ni igwɔm azanɛn. Iyin ice yin, da i nɔ yin awo, da i won yin bayɔng fɛ́ ba shim inɔ me, na nɔ awo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Afumung ijɛk akak afɛ́ ashon bɛ́ ibyat ifi </char><char style="fv">14</char> ane: <char style="fqa" closed="false">Kawɛy se gung ni iyin bafi itees ntsi aMusa nɛ BaFarasi! Iyin bafɛ́ nanu nafifa! Itisik yin na nasa bakuma, ni ras yin awon asɔp, nɔng i di tonoso yin kukyem yin. Nek anɔng, ba bi ki nɔɔk yin izot makiyi!</char></note><verse eid="MAT 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />&lt;&lt;Kawɛy se gung ni iyin bafi itees ntsi aMusa nɛ BaFarasi! Iyin bafɛ́ nanu nafifa! Iteng i kat yin ni mben zizɛɛt, ni tasak yin izek zizɛɛt, nek itsɛt yin anet azining kyɛk fɛ́ a da kuus ifɛ̀ itees yin, ama fi i mi ku sɛ yin, ni bang ku sak yin, na sot nggon ari irong aza yin.<verse eid="MAT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />&lt;&lt;Kawɛy se naton yin! Bakpatɔn fɛ́ ba kɔk bakak agbanding, nek i nye yin fok, &lt;Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a nye kushi ni Kutu Iya Adakunom Ntong, kushi me da ku yit awo, awɛt ayɔng fɛ́ a nɛ nye kushi nɛ ata asɛng afi kutu iya ntong e, ni kushi me ku ya.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Iyin ashɔp ákpatɔn! Ingan deng de fi wat iratek ɛ? Ata asɛng e a? Kɛ Kutu Iya Adakunom Ntong e fi ku sak ata asɛng e di sot jɛrɛ yɛ? <verse eid="MAT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />I ti tees yin banet fok, &lt;Ngma anet fɛ́ a nye kushi ni kuta ashosh Adakunom, kushi da ku yit awo, tit anet fɛ́ a nye kushi naton ikyɛng fɛ́ ba nabak e wu, ti kushi me da ku ya mo.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />&lt;&lt;Iyin bakpatɔn! Ingan deng de i wat ɛ? Kunang e ko a? Kɛ kuta ashosh e ko fi ku saas kunang e sot jɛrɛ yɛ? <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />Nek anɔng, ngma anet fɛ́ a nye kushi ni kuta ashosh Adakunom, a nye kushi ni kuta ashosh e ni ikyɛng fi i se ni iko. <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />Ne ayɔng fɛ́ a nye kushi ni Kutu Iya Adakunom Ntong, a nye kushi naton ko nɛ Adakunom fɛ́ a se ayɛt ko. <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" />Ne anet fɛ́ a nye kushi nɛ kazanɛn, a nye kushi ni kuta igwɔm Adakunom nɛ anet fɛ́ a di sosok ni iko.<verse eid="MAT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />&lt;&lt;Kawɛy se gung ni iyin bafi itees ntsi aMusa nɛ BaFarasi! Iyin bafɛ́ nanu nafifaa! I nesek yin igbasak kamazɛng ni nfi nkpɛnɛng nseng ni nkpɛnɛng nwe, awɛt ni wosong yin dang nye yin nkyɔrɔk yɔng fi ntsi wɛt shim, nkyɔrɔk ti ina: ishɔt atsak ni ifoos angmishish ni iras atsak. Nkyɔrɔk nang ná, in se yɛɛt ni i nye yin ina, vit iwosong yin ida. <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />Iyin bakpatɔn fi i kɔk yin bakak agbanding! I shirishi yin ashi kɔng i bi di ngɔnɔng yin katamun, ngma nɛ anɔng, ni ngɔs yin itsaap-igung.<verse eid="MAT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />&lt;&lt;Kawɛy se gung ni iyin, bafi itees ntsi aMusa nɛ BaFarasi! Bafɛ́ nanu nafifaa! Iyin kus yin nama aridɛ nɛ nama natsereng, awɛt nayɛt na mi shining ni imak ni ishim ice. <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />Ngɔn akpatɔn aFarasi! Tung kusu kayɛt aridɛ nɛ kayɛt katsereng e ninyen, nɔng kama me da bin se cɛ́l bà.<verse eid="MAT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />&lt;&lt;Kawɛy se gung ni iyin, bafi itees ntsi aMusa nɛ BaFarasi! Bafɛ́ nanu nafifaa! Iyin se yin ti nrɛk fɛ́ ba di kpɛng kutɔp kukan ni na, fi in yet ntek amatse, awɛt nayɛt na mi shining na akup bafaben, ni nkyɔrɔk agbɛk-gbɛk e. <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" />I se kpaf anɔng, banet ki yɛrɛ yin tɛ banet atsak, awɛt ayɛt yin, ayɛ yin mi shining nɛ nanu nafifaa nɛ bafi ibeseng ntsi.<verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29" />&lt;&lt;Kawɛy se gung ni iyin, bafi itees ntsi aMusa nɛ BaFarasi! Bafɛ́ nanu nafifa! Iyin noos yin batan arɛk atek, ni nye yin arɛk bafɛ́ atsak gyat. <verse eid="MAT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30" />Ni nye yin fok, &lt;Ki in kin fi in se yit ni izen badakop yit, ki in kin ka ba sɛ yit mo ifɛs batan e awo.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" />Na anɔng wu, fi i di tonoso yin fok iyin yet yin nnon bayɔng fɛ́ ba kin fɛs batan e. <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />Te yin nyɛk, i da ka gang yin kutomong badakop yin!<verse eid="MAT 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />&lt;&lt;Iyin ahwyen! Iyin ánon ámazɛrɛ! Akyɛ de i da ro na ba ki te yin ari irong ɛ? <verse eid="MAT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />Nek anɔng, imi fɛ̀ ni yin, in da ki tom yin batan nɛ bafi kutsitsɛng kutsik nɛ bafi itees. I da fɛs yin bakak ba, i da tegak yin bakak bà, i da tsosok yin bakak ayɛt ba na narɔ inyis, ni ka ba nesek in mgbang, nkum kuwɔp ku kà sak ni ku yá. <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" />Nek anɔng, ngma nasok banet atsak, fɛ́ ba ki mang fɛɛs, da se naton ace yin, ikyɛng fi iyit nkum izen inosong nasok anet atsak aHabila sak ni izen inosong nasok aZakariya arim aBerikiya, fi i kin ku fɛt yin nate kutu aJɛrɛ nɛ kuta ashosh Itu Iya Adakunom Ntong. <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" />Won in ki tak yin atsak, ngma nkyɔrɔk e da te naton kuzam kang.<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso nye kafa kawe <optbreak /> naton aRushelima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />&lt;&lt;Ye kaa! Banet aRushelima! Ye kaa! Banet aRushelima! Iyin fi i mi fɛɛs yin batan ni i mi woro yin batom Adakunom nɛ ata! Ite kamang fi imi da woso ki tusung yin tɛ anyinyon di famasa naban e na akufabak ye, ngma nɛ anɔng ni rayin. <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" />Di yin, nasa yin mi sot abát, vit anet ayɛt na. <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" />Wat in tsin fɛ̀ ni iyin, i bi ti i di di yin awo, ma atuk fi i fɛ̀ yin, &lt;Awɛng Adakunom se naton ayɔng, fɛ́ a bɛ́s ni iyerek aTisa.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="s">AYeso tak kuri ikpa fi Kutu <optbreak /> Iya Adakunom Ntong di ki kpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Ni izen fɛ́ aYeso se ni iwuruk ni itu iya Adakunom ntong, a se ni itseng, wɛt bafi imɛɛs wu tse ni wu, ba ku tonong nzam-nzam inok kutu iya ntong e. <verse eid="MAT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />Iwu fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;I di yin inok e deng a? Won in ki tak yin atsak, vit kuta kuzining azeng fɛ́ ba bi won iko naton kufidang, fɛ́ da ba bi yirik iko sak aben.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itumung mgbang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Ni izen fɛ́ aYeso se ni isonong ni Ihwyanang Ifat, bafi imɛɛs wu tse ni wu ni nɛt. Ba kpa ku risim fok yɛ, &lt;&lt;Ki tak yit, ikyɛng e deng bi te azik ɛ? Akyɛ bi yet ikyɛng fi i bi ki tonong yit izen kubɛ́ ngɔn, ni izen igang azatse me yɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />AYeso shim, a fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Bɛ́ yin ni nhwyɛ yin bakat, kɔn akak bi ki wɔrɔk yin! <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" />Nek banet dot bi bɛ́ ni iyerek hom, wɛt kaangan ba bi nye, Imi wu in yet Anet-Isheshek e. Ba bi wɔrɔk banet dot. <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />I bi foos yin ncɛɛt naton itsom ni iwoot-ncɛɛt itsom. Ngma na anɔng, i bi fok yin nnyim awo, nek i se gbing-gbing nkyɔrɔk e ni in te anɔng, awɛt igang e mi nye ninyen awo. <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />Banet ba, bi dorok itsɔm na ba yá. Igwɔm idè da dorok itsom ni igwɔm idá. Ba bi nye nzong ni izuut mben ne narɔ zizɛɛt. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />Ngma nkyɔrɔk e yɔng yet itumung irus kurɔ ites.<verse eid="MAT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />&lt;&lt;Ba bi ki yisik yin, ba bi ki nasap yin ni bɔk banet na ba ki nesek yin izot, na ba ki fɛs yin. Kazatse ngma ka bi ki rayin, nek iyerek hom. <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />Ni izen e yɔng, banet dot bi bun kama ayɛt inɔɔk atsak bá, ba bi rɛs bafidang bá, ba bi raba bafidang bá. <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" />Batan nbɔs dot bi wuru, ba bi tes banet dot na ba wey irèn. <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Nek banet anyas bi se dot makiyi, ishim fɛ́ banet bɛ̀ sak na bafidang, bi shirim. <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" />Awɛt ayɔng fɛ́ a kyem a nyeseng sak ni igang e, ba bi ku sheshek. <verse eid="MAT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" />Wat ba bi shara ifɛ̀ itek ifi igwɔm deng kaakyɛ azatse, i bi sot kanu icɛɛt naton banet kusum, ama anɔng, ni igang e bɛ́.<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso nye kucɛɛt naton <optbreak /> aDuk Mgbang fi in bi bɛ́</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />&lt;&lt;Wat i bi fi di yin, &lt;Na ba mi nye aduk nkyɔrɔk&gt; narɔ kaJɛrɛ, idɔng fɛ́ atan aDaniyɛl kin di cɛɛt naton e (won anet fɛ́ a tsin fa na a rēn). <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" />Won banet fɛ́ ba bi se na aJudiya, na ba teng sak na ahwyanang. <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" />Da ayɔng fɛ́ a se naton agubuk itu, bi fɛ̀ fok iwu tik aben a tsɛ sok ikikak ayɛt itu awo. <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />Da ayɔng fɛ́ a se ni ikɔ, bi fɛ́ fok iwu tɛ bun ari a tsɛ sok ikyɛng ifam irɔm awo.<verse eid="MAT 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />&lt;&lt;Kawɛy naton banyining afa, nɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba tsin ngasa nnon ni izen e yɔng! <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />Ra yin awon sak na Adakunom, kɔn ikyɛng deng bi te ni izen abolosh kɛ Atuk Ifɔɔn baYahuda, fɛ́ ka yet aSabat awo. <verse eid="MAT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />Nek izen e yɔng, ba bi nye aduk mgbang, kuri yɔng fɛ́ ba ki mang nye ina neme ni itumung kazatse kang awo, ba bi tɛ ba nye kuri na kong awo. <verse eid="MAT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />Kɛ da nek Adakunom wu a kyɛk nnom e yɔng awo, kɛ vit anet azining fɛ́ a da kyem a hwyet. Awɛt nek bayɔng fi iwu mi tsang myak fi i sak a kyɛk nnom e. <verse eid="MAT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />Ni izen e yɔng, kɛ akak fɛ̀ ni iyin, &lt;Di, Anet-Isheshek e yo!&gt; kɛ &lt;Di, a kya!&gt; I bi nɔɔk yin atsak ni ifɛ̀ wu awo. <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" />Nek banet-Isheshek mbɔɔs, nɛ batan nbɔs, bi bɛ́s na ba ras ntomong abes nratek, ni nkyɔrɔk ajingjing nɔng ba bin di wɔrɔsɔ banet, pet na bayɔng fɛ́ ba mi tsang ka ba myak, ki i da kyem ite anɔng. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />Di yin! In mi ki tak yin gyam dang ni ite.<verse eid="MAT 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />&lt;&lt;Nɔng kɛ banet fɛ̀ ni yin, &lt;A kya ayɛt ayit,&gt; i bi tse yin awo; kɛ na ba fɛ̀, &lt;A yo ayɛt itu ayɛt e!&gt; I bi nɔɔk yin atsak ni ifɛ̀ ba awo. <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" />Nek kubɛ́ Arim Anet bi se gobok kpaf ti adɛbɛt iza nkum abatin sak abace. <verse eid="MAT 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" />Karɔ fi kukom di se, azɔng fi ájɛrɛwɛsh da kana tusung mo.<verse eid="MAT 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />&lt;&lt;Zɛng-ngɛ-ziri, ama mgbang nnom e yɔng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 24:29">&lt;Kunom bi wat ku te ngmalak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 24:29">kufɛn bi rako dang nɔɔk mgbɛy ko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 24:29">Ádat bi kpas aben,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 24:29">nkyɔrɔk azanɛn bi zuut.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 24:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />&lt;&lt;Ni izen e yɔng, banet bi di naton aza, ikyɛng fi i bi tonong kubɛ́ Arim Anet e. Ngma banet azatse bi tos nek nnyim, ni izen fɛ́ ba bi di Arim Anet naton anɔk aza ni kukyem ni ízɔk iratek. <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" />A bi tom batomaza wu na ba fɛɛp kugba gbɛrɛy, ba bi tusung ngma bayɔng fɛ́ ba myak na atsok anaas, nkum kubat azatse kaa sak ni ku yá.<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />&lt;&lt;Won mɛɛs yin ikikak naton atin-akon atafo. Ni izen fɛ́ ahwyang e kpa turup, nɛ afumung e kpa tang, ni wat irēn yin, ikos bɛ́ bakat. <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />Idɔng kpaf anɔng, ki iyin di yin ngma nkyɔrɔk nang fi imi tsin fɛ̀ ni yin, ni wat rēn yin fok izen e bɛ́ bakat, a se natitu. <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" />Atsak fi in tsin ki tak yin, kuzam ku kang da tsang got awo, ma nkyɔrɔk nang te ngma. <verse eid="MAT 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" />Kazanɛn nɛ kazatse bi gang, awɛt ifɛ̀ hom bi gang awo.<verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vit ayɔng fɛ́ a irēn atuk <optbreak /> e ki izen e ayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />&lt;&lt;Vit anet fɛ́ a irēn atuk e ki izen e ayi, pet nɛ batomaza nɛ Arim e<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:36 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Arim e</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Afumung akak afɛ́ ayame bɛ́ ijɛk yeng awo.</char></note>, ma Ada me aziwu kyɛk fɛ́ a rēn. <verse eid="MAT 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" />Kpaf ti fi i kin te ni izen aNuhu, kubun Arim Anet yɔng ku bi se kpaf anɔng. <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" />Nek ni izen aNuhu me, dang ashi abes e na a bɛ́, ba se ni iyas ni isɔ, bamatek se ni ira nweneng, na ba nesek bangas ni nweneng sak atuk fɛ́ aNuhu di nɔ ayɛt kukyɛ ashi me. <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" />Iba kin rēn ikyɛng fi i tsin tseng awo, ashi abes e bɛ́ a ka ba ya ngma kusum. I bi se anɔng, ni izen fɛ́ Arim Anet bi bɛ̀. <verse eid="MAT 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />Banet bafaa bi se ni ikɔ; ba bi sok azining, na ba won azining. <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />Banyining bafaa bi se ni ku kɔɔ; ba bi sok azining, na ba won azining.<verse eid="MAT 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />&lt;&lt;Nek anɔng, bɛ́ yin ni nhwyɛ yin bakat, nek da iyin rēn yin atuk e ki izen e, fɛ́ aTisa yin bi bɛ́ awo. <verse eid="MAT 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" />Rēn yin ane: Ke atekari fɛ́ a rēn izen fɛ́ akpatang di ki nɔ ari wu, ke arɔ na ayisi wu nda, ke a won ba ku nɔ ari awo. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Nek anɔng, i se gbing-gbing ni kana nye yin, nek Arim Anet bi bɛ̀ ni izen fi i mi di te yin iyɛ awo.<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />&lt;&lt;Angan wu fɛ́ a yet asam afi kutsitsɛng yɔng fɛ́ ba di te iyɛ yɔng ɛ? A yet ayɔng fɛ́ atekari wu ku sak na a kuyɛrɛ kari, na a nesek ishɛrɛp basam e kuyak kpaf ni izen e. <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />Awɛng bi yet a fɛ́ asam e yɔng fɛ́ atekari wu bɛ́ a ku sɛ na tsin ra ikyɛng fi i se yɛɛt. <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" />Atsak fi in tsin ki tak yin, atekari me, bi ku sak na a kuyɛrɛ ngma kurúm wu. <verse eid="MAT 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" />Awɛt ke asam e yet afɛ́ anyas, fɛ́ a fɛ̀ ni ice wu, &lt;Kye! Atekari hom ma tsɛ a sha wu narɔ kutseet e.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" />Wat a kpa tsosok ishɛrɛp basam e, na yas na sɔ na bafi sɔ. <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />Atekari me bi bɛ́s wu atuk fɛ́ asam e di te iyɛ awo, ni izen fɛ́ da a rēn awo. <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />Atekari wu bi ku nye iduk itsot, na ma ku moon nɛ bafɛ́ nanu nafifaa, azɔng wu fɛ́ a bi tos na ros anyi.<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="s">Igorok icɛɛt naton <optbreak /> nanamang kusɔk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />&lt;&lt;Ni izen e yɔng, igwɔm azanɛn bi se ane: Nanamang nakak kusɔk, fɛ́ na sok agaramun na, na tse ishan amatek agol. <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" />Batoon ayɛt ba yet áshɔp e nɛ batoon batsitsɛng e. <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" />Áshɔp átoon e, sok agaramun bá, vit dang bereng name fɛ́ ba di ki barang. <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" />Wat batsitsɛng e, berese agaramun bá name na atsung name bà. <verse eid="MAT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" />Amatek agol e, a sok izen ishɔp dang bɛ́, ngma ba nda ka ba yisik, ba men nda.<verse eid="MAT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" />&lt;&lt;Nasamang a te tuk, ba fok iyes fok, &lt;Amatek agol e yong a wuruk! Bi ku shan yin!&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" />&lt;&lt;Wat ngma nanamang kusɔk e, dorok ni nda, ba di barasa nrong agaramun bá. <verse eid="MAT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" />Áshɔp átoon e, fɛ̀ na batsitsɛng e, &lt;Ki nang yit name yin, nek agaramun yit, tseng sak ikus.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />&lt;&lt;Ba ka ba bun ni ifɛ̀ yɛ, &lt;Awɛy, na da ki kyem yit ngma ni iyin awo. Tseng yin sak na bayɔng fɛ́ ba rɛs name me, nɔng i da bin shan yin na fiin.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />&lt;&lt;Na anɔng wu, fɛ́ áshɔp ánamang e, di berem narɔ ishan name me. Wat ama fɛ́ ba mi tseng, amatek agol e bɛ́ a ta. Nanamang natoon fɛ́ na mi ka na nye, nɔ gung ni iwu sak narɔ fɛ́ ba mi nye nek amok e, ba ma fam katitu.<verse eid="MAT 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />&lt;&lt;Ama anɔng, áshɔp ánamang e, bɛ́s na, ba fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;Atekari! Atekari! Ki tarak yit katitu!&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" />&lt;&lt;Awɛt iwu fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;Atsak fi in tsin ki tak yin, Imi ki irēn yin awo.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" />Nek anɔng, aYeso gang ifɛ̀ wu yɛ, &lt;&lt;Kana nye yin kaaki izen, nek da i irēn yin kunom e ki izen e awo.<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Igorok icɛɛt naton <optbreak /> basam bataat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />&lt;&lt;Igwɔm azanɛn bi se tɛ ane: anet akak bɛ̀ kutseet ashon wu, wɛt a yes basam wu, a ka ba kaba kurúm wu. <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" />A nɔɔk azining atalen atoon<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni ilem aGirik </char><char style="fk" closed="false">atalen atoon</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Kin yet kunanang ata asɛng fɛ́ a kin se bakat itarang itsɔm itomong anet azining afi nnom agup atoon (5,000).</char></note>, a nɔɔk anet afɛ́ afaa me atalen afaa, anet afɛ́ ataat, a ku nɔɔk izining, a nɔɔk kaangan kpaf na agap wu. Ama anɔng, a nye kutseet wu me. <verse eid="MAT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />Anet yɔng fɛ́ a shan atalen atoon e, wat a kpa tirisi ina ni ijik, a sɛ ibarang akak atoon naton na. <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />Kpaf anɔng, fɛ́ anet atalen afaa, di sɛ ibarang akak afaa. <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />Awɛt anet fɛ́ ba ku nɔɔk izining e, a tsɛ a ta ibong aben, a di nɛt atalen atekari wu me.<verse eid="MAT 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />&lt;&lt;Ama izen isɔp, atekari basam e, bɛ́s wu, a fɛ̀ ni iba, na ba ku tak ikyɛng fɛ́ ba di nye na atalen wu. <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Anet fɛ́ ba ku nɔɔk atalen atoon e, bɛ́ na akak atoon. A fɛ̀, &lt;Atekari, ngɔn kin di nɔɔk atalen atoon, di, in mi di sɛ ibarang atoon.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" />&lt;&lt;Atekari wu, fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;Show! Ngɔn yet asam atek fɛ́ anet di ki te iyɛ! Ngɔn mi tonong atsak ni ikyɛng ibaane; Imi da ka nɔɔk iratek naton ikyɛng igbat e. Nɔ i da fɔɔn ni iyɛ ikan aze ni imi!&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />&lt;&lt;Anet fɛ́ ba ku nɔɔk atalen afaa, bɛ́ na akak afaa. A fɛ̀, &lt;Atekari, ngɔn kin di nɔɔk atalen afaa, di, in mi di sɛ ibarang afaa.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />&lt;&lt;Atekari wu, fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;Show! Ngɔn yet asam atek fɛ́ anet di ki te iyɛ! Ngɔn mi tonong atsak ni ikyɛng ibaane, imi da ka nɔɔk iratek naton ikyɛng igbat e. Nɔ i da fɔɔn ni iyɛ ikan aze ni imi!&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" />&lt;&lt;Wat anet yɔng fɛ́ ba kin ku nɔɔk atalen azining e, a bɛ́, a fɛ̀, &lt;Atekari, imi irēn nse ngɔn se gadiring, i tsɛk narɔ fi da ngɔn di tuus awo, itusung narɔ fi da ngɔn di waat awo. <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" />Nek anɔng, imi fok nnyim, in tsin in da nɛt atalen ngɔn ni ibong. Nga ikyɛng ngɔn de.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" />&lt;&lt;Atekari wu, fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;Ngɔn aduk asam arut! Ɔɔ ngɔn irēn fok imi tsɛk narɔ fi da imi di tuus awo, ni in tusung narɔ fi da imi di waat ija awɛ? <verse eid="MAT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" />Ey ya! Ki i se anɔng, ki ngɔn tsi i di sak atalen hom ni imyɛ itsɔm, nɔng imi bi fi in bɛ́s yin, ni in tsin shan ide ni ibarang naton e.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />&lt;&lt;Ama anɔng, atekari me fɛ́rɛ́ng na basam wu, &lt;Shan yin atalen e ni bɔk wu, nɔɔk yin anet yɔng fɛ́ a bɛ̀ atalen kusɔk e. <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" />Nek ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a bɛ̀, ba bi ku barang mo, nɔng a da bin sɛ shɛrɛk, wɛt ayɔng fɛ́ a se vit ikyɛng, igyet e dɔng fɛ́ a bɛ̀, ba da shan ide ni wu. <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" />Tekap yin kufunam yɔng, barak yin amaan ayɛt ahwyi, narɔ fɛ́ a da ya ának, na ros anyi.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ishɔt igang azatse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />&lt;&lt;Ni izen fɛ Arim Anet bi bɛ́, ayɛt ízɔk wu, nɛ batomaza ngma kusum, ni izen e yɔng wu, a bi sonong ni kuta igwɔm ízɔk wu. <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" />Ngma icen azatse bi kana tusung ashon wu, iwu bi kaba banet kyɔn tɛ anet ija di kas ibon itsamang ni ibon iwe. <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />A bi sak itsamang ni bɔk iyak, na sak iwe ni bɔk imen.<verse eid="MAT 25:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />&lt;&lt;Wat agwɔm e, bi fɛ̀ nɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba se ni bɔk iyak wu, &lt;Bɛ́ yin, iyin fɛ́ aDa hom mi ki te yin awɛng; bɛ́ yin, bi nɔ yin ayɛt igwɔm fɛ́ ba mang nye nek iyin, neme ni inye kazatse. <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" />Nek imi kin fok nzong, iyin di nɔɔk yin nayak, imi kin fok iyɛ ingash, iyin di nɔɔk yin ashi isɔ, imi bɛ́ itsen, iyin di shan yin nɛ nasa yin. <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />Izen fi in se dang ares ite, iyin di te yin ares. A di rɔ, iyin di fiis yin gyat. In se ari inyang, iyin di bɛ́ yin itsen.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />&lt;&lt;Wat bafɛ́ atsak e, bi fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;ATisa, akyi izen fi iyit kin da di yit ni nzong, in da nɔɔk yit nayak ɛ? Ki in da di yit ni tsin fok iyɛ ingash ayi, in da nɔɔk yit ashi isɔ yɛ? <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />Na ki izen fi in kin da di yit atsen, in da shan yit sak nɛ nasa yit ɛ? Kɛ in da di yit vit ares, in da nɔɔk yit ares ɛ? <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />Na ki izen fi in kin da di yit ni irɔk, ke ari inyang ayi, in tsin in da fiis yit ɛ?&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" />&lt;&lt;Agwɔm e, bi fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;Atsak fi in tsin ki tak yin, ngma ikyɛng fi iyin nye yin azining ayɛt bayɔng fɛ́ ba dung rat ayɛt baruneng ba, imi wu fi i di nye yin ne.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />&lt;&lt;Wat a bi fɛ̀ na bayɔng fɛ́ ba se ni bɔk imen wu, &lt;Won yin azeng, ámaan ánet! Tseng yin sak ayɛt irong fi ku ya vit igang, fɛ́ ba kin nye nek aShetan nɛ batomaza wu. <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />Nek imi kin fok nzong, iyin rayin dang di nɔɔk yin kuyak. Imi kin fok iyɛ ingash, iyin rayin dang i di nɔɔk yin ashi isɔ. <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />Imi kin bɛ́ itsen, iyin rayin dang di shan yin nɛ nasa yin. Imi se vit ares ite, iyin rayin dang di te yin ares. Imi se ni irɔk nɛ ari inyang, iyin rayin dang ni tsi i di yin.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />&lt;&lt;Wat iba bi fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;ATisa, na ki izen fi iyit kin da di yit ni nzong kɛ ni iyɛ ingash, kɛ atsen, kɛ vit ares, kɛ ni irɔk, kɛ ari inyang ayi, in rayit dang da sɛ yit mo yɛ?&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />&lt;&lt;Iwu bi fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;Atsak fi in tsin ki tak yin, ngma ikyɛng fi i rayin dang nye yin azining ayɛt bayɔng fɛ́ a dung rat, ayɛt ba ba, imi wu fi i rayin dang di nye yin ne.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" />Nɛ ba ma tseng ni iba, sak narɔ mgbang vit igang, awɛt nɛ ba tseng nɛ bafɛ́ atsak sak ni kutset vit igang.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="s">Bakɔk-ashon tɔ naton <optbreak /> itekap aYeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />Ama fɛ́ aYeso mi gang ncɛɛt e yɔng, a fɛ̀ na bafi imɛɛs wu, <verse eid="MAT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" />&lt;&lt;Kyɔn ti iyin irēn yin, ishɛrɛp nkɔs nfaa ni in nɔ yit ayɛt amok aPasova, ba da nabak Arim Anet ni mbɔk banet, na ba ku tegak nakon.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Wat bagbat áware nɛ bashɔn iwɔp, kana tusung na atasa ari agbat-agbat àware fɛ́ ba ku yes aKayafas. <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />Ba kpa tsɛt irèn fɛ́ ba di ki tekap aYeso nifam, na ba fɛt. <verse eid="MAT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />Ba tak ace ba, &lt;&lt;In bi ku tekap yit ni izen amok awo, nek banet da ki kpa yit ni ifa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ba korok aYeso name <optbreak /> nɛ aBetani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Na aYeso resek mo na aBetani ari aSiman fɛ́ a kin tsang yet akparong. <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" />Wat abining akak, tsɛ a ne na name nkɔn ntek ni kitsung alabasta, fɛ́ na bi itsɔm makiyi. Ni izen fɛ́ aYeso se ni kuyak, abining e tsɛ a ku korok name me.<verse eid="MAT 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" />Wat izen fɛ́ bafi imɛɛs wu di anɔng, ayɛ bá beseng, ba fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Akyɛ kuri ibeseng name yɔng anɔng ɛ? <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />Zɔng ke ba rɛp name nang ni itsɔm dot, nɔng ba bin kaba bakan itsɔm e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />Nek aYeso rēn kuyiring bá, a fɛ́ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Akyɛ yet kudaam yin nɛ abining yong ɛ? Iwu mi di nye imi ikyɛng itek. <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" />Bakan bi gang azeng nate yin awo, awɛt imi di ki nak azeng azatse ni iyin awo. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />Name fɛ́ a di korok e ni irɔm, a di nye nɔng ba bin di te mo ni irɛk. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" />Atsak fi in tsin ki tak yin, kaakɛ fɛ́ ba bi shara ifɛ̀ itek deng azatse, ba bi yiring ni ikyɛng fɛ́ abining yong nye.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">AJudas fɛ̀ ey iwu <optbreak /> da rɛp aYeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Ama anɔng, azining ayɛt kusɔk abe afaa me, fɛ́ ba ku yes aJudas aIskariyoti, a wuruk sak narɔ bagbat áware, <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />a tsɛ a ka ba rip yɛ, &lt;&lt;Akyɛ fi i di ki nɔɔk yin, ki in ki nabak yin iwu yɛ?&gt;&gt; Iba ku nɔɔk ica atsɔm akan nsɔk ntaat. <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />Nkum izen e yɔng, aJudas nɔ itsɛsɛk irén fɛ́ a di ki nabak aYeso.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso ya nayak amok <optbreak /> aPasova nɛ bafi imɛɛs wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />Ni kunom kufi imɛsɛng amok iya akpam fɛ́ a se vit ayist e, bafi imɛɛs aYeso tsɛ ba ku rip yɛ, &lt;&lt;Akɛ fi ngɔn shim in tsin da nye yit e, fi i da tsi i di ya nayak amok aPasova me yɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Tseng yin sak ayɛt iwɔp, i da sɛ yin anet akak, fɛ̀ yin ni iwu, &lt;Anet itees fɛ̀: Izen hom mi bɛ́ bakat. Imi da ya nayak amok e ari ngɔn nɛ bafi imɛɛs hom.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />Wat bafi imɛɛs aYeso me tsɛ ba nye kpaf ikyɛng fɛ́ a ka ba tak, ba nye kuyak amok aPasova me.<verse eid="MAT 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />Ni izen fɛ́ kahwyɛ nye, aYeso tse narɔ iyak nɛ bafi imɛɛs wu kusɔk abe afaa me. <verse eid="MAT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />Izen fɛ́ ba se ni kuyak, a fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Atsak fi in tsin ki tak yin, azining ayɛt yin di ki rɛp.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Ba nɔ kudaam makiyi, ba kpa ku risim bazizining, &lt;&lt;Ka! ATisa, ngɔn di ti imi wu yɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Anet yɔng fɛ́ a tsin tes kubɔk ni itsɛn gung ni imi, iwu fɛ́ a di ki rɛp. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" />Arim Anet da tseng kpaf tɛ fɛ́ ba kin di jɛk, awɛt kawɛy se naton anet yɔng fɛ́ a di ki rɛp! I da sot anet e, kaduk ke da ba kin ku tes awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Wat aJudas fɛ́ a da rɛp aYeso me fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Ka! ATisa, ngɔn di ti imi wu yɛ?&gt;&gt; AYeso fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn mi fɛrɛng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itumung iya nayak aTisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />Ba se ni iya kuyak, aYeso sok akpam, a di nɔɔk ifeng sak ne Adakunom, a bushung akpam me, a nesek bafi imɛɛs wu, a fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Nga yin, ya yin, kurɔm hom kang.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Wat a sok kitsɛ̀n ashi me, a di nɔɔk ifeng sak ne Adakunom, a sok a ka ba nɔɔk, a fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Sɔ yin, ngma yin. <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" />Nasok hom nang na fi kushi, fɛ́ ba da nosong nek ifuut anɛn banet dot. <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />Won in ki tak yin, imi bi ti in sɔ ashi anap nang awo, tit ma atuk fi in bi sɔ afas gung ni iyin ni igwɔm aDa hom.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />Ama fɛ́ ba ra abom, ba wuruk sak ni Ihwyanang Ifat.<verse eid="MAT 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso tak ibes itoone <optbreak /> fɛ́ aBitrus da nye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />Wat aYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, Atut natuk kang, ngma yin i da teng yin i di won yin, nek i se ni ijɛk,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 26:31">&lt;&lt; &lt;In da rus anek e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 26:31">kukpara me da te sharatat.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />&lt;&lt;Ama fɛ́ ba di dorok ni irɛk, imi bi tung tseng sak na aGalili aza yin.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />Wat aBitrus fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Ke ngma ba ba teng nek ikyɛng fi i da te ni ngɔn, imi da teng awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Atsak fi in tsin da tak, natuk atut, na atsanyon resek dang tɛp, ngɔn di ki toon ite kataat.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Awɛt aBitrus fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Ki in da ku, imi da ka toon awo.&gt;&gt; Ngma ishɛrɛp bafi imɛɛs e fɛ̀ anɔng bà.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso ra awon na <optbreak /> aGetsemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Ama anɔng, aYeso nɛ bafi imɛɛs wu, ba tseng narɔ kakak fɛ́ ba yes ika yɛ aGetsemani, a fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Tsing ra di sonong yin azeng ninyen, imi da serek aza, in da ra awon.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />A sok aBitrus ni nnon aZebedi nafaa, aYakubu nɛ aYohana, a nɔ kudaam ni ibeseng iyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />Wat a fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;In bi kudaam ni iyɛ ti ku di ki fɛt. Sot yin azeng, in da tot yit gung.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />A bang serek ashon, a kpa na ayisi aben, a ra awon, yɛ, &lt;&lt;Ada hom, ki i da nye, won na ba sok kitsɛ̀n mgbang kang ashon hom. Ngma na anɔng, da kushim hom awo, won kufɔɔn ni ku sot.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Ama anɔng, a tɛ bun sak narɔ bafi imɛɛs wu, a tsɛ a ka ba sɛ ni nda. A rip aBitrus, &lt;&lt;Iyin da kyem itot yin nfi igip izining awɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />&lt;&lt;Tosok yin ace yin, ni ras yin awon, kɔn i bi kpa yin ni imara. Kabik shim, awɛt kurɔm se gbɛrɛk.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />A tɛ bun ifɛ́ afaa narɔ ira awon e, a fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Ada hom, kɛ ba da kyem ba di sok kitsɛ̀n mgbang e awo, ma in sɔ ika, won ni in nye kushim ngɔn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />Ni izen fɛ́ a tɛ a bɛ́s wu, a tɛ ka ba sɛ ba se ni nda, nek ayisi ba mi te tsorgos ni nda. <verse eid="MAT 26:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />Wat iwu tseng a ka ba won, a tsɛ a ra awon afɛ́ ataat, a tɛ a fɛ̀ nɛ Adakunom kpaf tɛ fɛ́ a mi fɛ̀ ni iwu.<verse eid="MAT 26:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Ama anɔng, a tɛ bun sak narɔ bafi imɛɛs e, a fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;I rēn se yin ni nda ni fɔrɔng yin ɛ? Di yin, izen e mi bɛ́ bakat fɛ́ ba da nabak Arim Anet ni mbɔk bafi inɛn. <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" />Dorok yin, in tseng yit! Anet irɛp hom yong a mi bɛ́ ta!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ba tekap aYeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Na aYeso tsin rēn cɛɛt, aJudas azining ayɛt bafi imɛɛs wu kusɔk abe afaa me, tsɛ a ta zɔng gung ni kudyɛng banet fɛ́ ba berese áwal ni íshɛn; ayet bagbat áware nɛ bashɔn iwɔp wu ba tom banet e. <verse eid="MAT 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />Anet irɛp e mi tɔ ni iba ikyɛng fi iba di ki te ayisi: &lt;&lt;Ayɔng fi imi ku wusup nɛ kanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:48 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">wusup nɛ kanu</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: A kin yet ashow baYahuda ni izen e yɔng fɛ́ anet da sak kanu nisek afidang.</char></note>, iwu me yɔng; Ku tekap yin.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Nkum ba tsin nɔɔs kyɛk, aJudas di berem sak narɔ aYeso, a fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Show, Anet Itees!&gt;&gt; Awat a ku yit ni iwusup.<verse eid="MAT 26:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Afidang yin, nye ikyɛng fi i bɛ́ ni ngɔn.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:50">Wat banet e ne, ba ku tekap, ba ku yit gak. <verse eid="MAT 26:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />Ni i di anɔng, azining ayɛt bayɔng fɛ́ ba se gung nɛ aYeso, a kɔrɔk àwal wu, a di tɛmɛng kuto asam agbat-agbat àware.<verse eid="MAT 26:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Sɔɔn àwal ngɔn ayɛt kubas ko. Nek ngma anet fɛ́ a sok awal, awal wu a da ku ya. <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />Iyin di yin ti imi da kyem ni in tak aDa min, na wat a di tom batomaza fɛ́ ba wat kudyɛng batsom kusɔk abe afaa awɛ? <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Wat na anɛ wu fɛ́ ba di ki shining ikyɛng fi i se ni ijɛk ni ifumung Adakunom ɛ? Ifɛ̀ me tonong fok, i se gbing-gbing nkyɔrɔk nang ni in te anɔng!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />Ama anɔng, aYeso fɛ̀ nɛ banet e, &lt;&lt;Wat iyin bɛ yin na áwal ni íshɛn i bi i di tekap yin mo, imi yet anet itsang agap ɛ? Kaakyi kunom imi wosok itees banet ni itu iya Adakunom ntong, iyin da i di tekap yin awo. <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />Ngma nkyɔrɔk nang te anɔng, nɔng ikyɛng fɛ́ batan kin mang jɛk bin sɛ i di shining.&gt;&gt; Ama anɔng, ngma bafi imɛɛs wu me, teng ba ku won.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso ashon kazumung ishɔt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Banet fɛ́ ba tekap aYeso, tse ni iwu ashon aKayafas, agbat-agbat àware, narɔ fɛ́ bafi itees ntsi aMusa nɛ bashɔn iwɔp mi kana tusung mo. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />ABitrus ka ba kuus mo ama yik-yik, sak atasa agbat-agbat áware me. A nɔ, a tsɛ a sonong nɛ banet itosok kasa me, nɔng a da bin di ikyɛng fi i da te.<verse eid="MAT 26:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />Bagbat áware me nɛ bafɛ́ azumung ishɔt e, ba sɛ ni itsɛt inɛn nbɔs fɛ́ ba da bɔ aYeso ne, nɔng ba bin se ba ku fɛt mo. <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60" />Awɛt da ba kyem ba sɛ awo, ngma nɛ anɔng banet dot bɛ́ ba nesek nanu mbɔɔs naton wu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:60">Ni igang e, banet bafaa tsɛ ba ne, <verse eid="MAT 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61" />ba fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Anet yong fɛ̀, &lt;Iwu da kyem a fo kutu iya Adakunom ntong kang, na tɛ na nok iko ni nkɔs ntaat.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Wat agbat-agbat àware me, dorok tsik, a fɛ̀ na aYeso, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn bi ikyɛng fi i da fɛ̀ naton kukun fɛ́ banet bang bɛ́ ne naton ngɔn awɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />AYeso di wey yuu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:63">Agbat-agbat àware me, fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Imi da shi min ashon Adakunom aza: Ki tak yit kɛ ngɔn wu i yet Anet-Isheshek, Arim Adakunom e yɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />AYeso fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn mi fɛrɛng. Awɛt atsak fi in tsin ki tak yin: Azeng sak ashon, i bi di yin Arim Anet ni isonong ni ibɔk iyak Azɔk Bazɔk, na tsin bɛ́s wu ayɛt anɔk aton aza.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65" />Ni izen fɛ́ agbat-agbat àware me fok anɔng, a sarak kukpin wu nek ibeseng iyɛ, a fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;A mi beseng iyerek Adakunom kari! Akyɛ ikyɛng icɛɛt fi in tsɛt yit kong ari? Yɔkɔnɔng, iyin mi fok yin kuri ibyɛs fɛ́ a nye Adakunom e. <verse eid="MAT 26:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66" />Akyɛ fi iyin di yin ɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:66">Iba fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;I se kpaf na a ku!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />Ba cish aYeso ncicɛ na yisi, ba ma ku tsot. Bakak ku tang mbɔk na a fok <verse eid="MAT 26:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />na ba ku risim, &lt;&lt;Anet-Isheshek, tak ibes, angan wu fɛ́ a da rus ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="s">ABitrus toon irēn aYeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Ni izen e yɔng, na aBitrus resek mo atasa, kanamang kakak fɛ́ ka ra kutomong ari me, bɛ́ ka ku sɛ, ka fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn kin se gung na aYeso anet aGalili me yɔng bà.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Awɛt aBitrus toon ashon ba ngma, yɛ, &lt;&lt;Imi rēn ikyɛng fi iyin di cɛɛt yin naton e awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />A wuruk sak na tunyeneng, kanamang kakak fɛ́ ka ra isam azɔng e tɛ ka ku di, ka fɛ̀ nɛ banet fɛ́ ba se azɔng, &lt;&lt;Anet yo, se gung nɛ aYeso anet aNazaret e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />A tɛ toone, ni kushi: &lt;&lt;Imi rēn anet e awo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />Ama kizen gyet, banet fɛ́ ba se ni nyeseng azɔng, bɛ́ ba fɛ̀ na aBitrus, &lt;&lt;Na atsak e, ngɔn yet azining ba. Kucɛɛt ngɔn, mi da tonong.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:73" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />A kpa yes kawɛy naton ice wu, na a woso nyes kushi ashon ba, &lt;&lt;Imi rēn anet yong awo!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:74">Ni izen e yɔng, atsanyon wat a kpa tɛp. <verse eid="MAT 26:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />Wat aBitrus yiring ni ikyɛng fɛ́ aYeso fɛ̀ ni iwu, yɛ, &lt;&lt;Na atsanyon dang tɛp, ngɔn da nye nanan hom kataat.&gt;&gt; A di berem amatse, a tsɛ ya kanak makiyi.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="s">AJudas te kudun ni <optbreak /> itɔ wu ni kudun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />Na abop adiding, ngma ágbat áware nɛ bashɔn iwɔp mi gang kucɛɛt fok ba da fɛt aYeso. <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />Ba ku rosom, ba tseng ni iwu, ba nabak aYeso sak na agwɔm aBilatus.<verse eid="MAT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />Ni izen fɛ́ aJudas fɛ́ a rɛp aYeso, di ba mi tsɛɛt aYeso ishɔt iku, ikyɛng e kudaam, a tɛ bun nɛ áney nsɔk ntaat e sak narɔ bagbat áware nɛ bashɔn iwɔp e. <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />A fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Imi mi nye inɛn, in mi rɛp anet fɛ́ a se vit inɛn fɛ́ ba sok kutset wu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:4">Iba fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Akyɛ yit di se yɛ? Kudaam ngɔn yɔng ku yet kuyɔ́ng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />Wat aJudas sok ica itsɔm e, a nosong ide azɔng nitu iya Adakunom ntong, a wuruk, a tsɛ a te kudun ni tɔ.<verse eid="MAT 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />Bagbat áware sok itsɔm, ba fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Ntsi yit rone ni in te yit itsɔm nasok ni imyɛ kutu iya Adakunom ntong.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Nek anɔng, ba tɔ fok na ba di shan ikɔ ikak ni itsɔm e, ba shan ikɔ anet inoos nadonong, nɔng karɔ me bin sot arɛk batsen ke ba kus. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Nek anɔng wu fɛ́ ba di yes karɔ me Ikɔ Nasok sak atut. <verse eid="MAT 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" />Na anɔng wu ikyɛng fɛ́ atan aIrimiya kin fɛ̀ di shining, &lt;&lt;Ba sok itsɔm áney nsɔk ntaat, itsɔm fɛ́ banet aIsrela di te ba da tarang naton ice wu dɔng, <verse eid="MAT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" />ba sok ide ba di shan ikɔ anet inoos nadonong, kpaf tɛ Adakunom kin di tak mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso ashon aBilatus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />Na aYeso se ni nyeseng ashon agwɔmna, wɛt agwɔmna me ku rip, yɛ, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn wu i yet agwɔm baYahuda me yɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:11">AYeso ku bun ni ifɛ̀ yɛ, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn mi fɛrɛng.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />Awɛt izen fɛ́ agbat àware nɛ bashɔn iwɔp se ni ites kukun wu, iwu fɛrɛng ikikak awo. <verse eid="MAT 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Wat aBilatus fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn fok ikyɛng fɛ́ ba cɛɛt naton ngɔn awɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />AYeso sot yuu dang fɛrɛng ikikak, naton kukun fɛ́ ba te naton wu, ikyɛng e te agwɔmna yɔɔt makiyi.<verse eid="MAT 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ba tsɛɛt aYeso ishɔt iku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />Ni izen amok aPasova, agwɔmna mi di mɛɛ na te washak afi inyang azining fɛ́ banet e kasa. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />Ni izen e yɔng, anet iduk idoro nhwyɛ akak fɛ́ a kin se ari inyang, fi iyerek wu kin yet aBarabas. <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Wat izen fɛ́ kudyɛng banet e mi kana tusung, aBilatus ka ba rip yɛ, &lt;&lt;Angan yo me fi iyin shim yin, in ki bisik yin ne ɛ? ABarabas a? Kɛ aYeso fɛ́ ba ku yes Anet-Isheshek e yɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />Nek iwu rēn ayet nek naman wu kyɛk fɛ́ ba di nabak aYeso ashon wu.<verse eid="MAT 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Na aBilatus ni isonong ni kuta igwɔm wu, abining wu tom ni itom fok yɛ: &lt;&lt;Ngɔn bi di sak kubɔk na anet ajɛrɛ yɔng awo, nek in bɔrɔng nɛ aduk nabos naton wu natuk atut.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Awɛt bagbat áware nɛ bashɔn iwɔp e, tees kudyɛng banet fok na ba fɛ̀, na ba wosong aBarabas na ba fɛt aYeso.<verse eid="MAT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />Agwɔmna tɛ a ka ba rip yɛ, &lt;&lt;Angan ayɛt banet bafaa bang fi iyin shim yin ba ki bisik yin e yɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:21">Ba bun ni ifɛ̀, &lt;&lt;ABarabas.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />ABilatus fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Akyɛ fi iyin shim yin ni in nye na aYeso fɛ́ ba ku yes Anet-Isheshek ɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:22">Ngma ba ba fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Ba ku tegak!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />ABilatus ka ba rip, &lt;&lt;Akyɛ imaan e fɛ́ a nye yɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:23">Ba bang tang nkun na agap, &lt;&lt;Ba ku tegak!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" />Fɛ́ aBilatus di a da kyem a ya agap ba awo, a di ke a ya kashon ifa da dorok azɔng, a fɛ̀ na ba ku nɔk ashi, a di kusu mbɔk wu ashon kudyɛng banet e. A fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Kubɔk hom di se ni iku anet yong awo! Ngma ikyɛng fi ite a se ni bɔk yin!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />Wat ngma banet e fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Won nasok wu, na na sot na ace yit ni nnon yit!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Wat aBilatus ka ba bisik aBarabas. A sak na ba nye aYeso ahwyereng ni ízining, a ma ka ba nabak iwu, na ba tsɛ ba ku tekak.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Batsom e tonong <optbreak /> aYeso ibyɛs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Ama anɔng, batsom agwɔm me, sok aYeso sak ni katasa karɔ isosok batsom, ba tusung ishɛrɛp batsom e, ba te aYeso nate. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />Ba ku tun kukpin wu, ba ku te kugboo kukpin kukak kuseng ti kufɛ́ bágwɔm, <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />ba ma ku bat àbong itsitsan, ba ku te ne ni ice, ba ku sak a bereng ishɛn ni ibɔk iyak wu, ni iba ma nye gururuk ashon wu, na ba nye ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Kutset ngɔn ni ku bang te kusɔɔp Agwɔm baYahuda!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />Ba ku cish acicɛ na yisi, ba shan ishɛn e, na ba woso iku tsosok mo ice. <verse eid="MAT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />Ba gang ibyɛs wu ngma, ba da nɛ ba ku tun kugboo kukpin e, ba ku te mo ku fuu, ba tseng ni iwu sak ba tsɛ ba tegak.<verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ba Tegak aYeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />Fɛ́ ba se ni irèn sak azɔng, ba nyim na anet iwɔp aSirin akak, fɛ́ ba ku yes aSiman, ba di te gbing ni wu na a sok kukum itegak aYeso. <verse eid="MAT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />Ba tsɛ ba ta narɔ fɛ́ ba yes ika, aGolgota, fɛ́ ka yet, karɔ akup ice banet. <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />Azɔng wu fɛ́ ba ku nɔk ashi anap fɛ́ ba di te ikyɛng ikpashak, ama fɛ́ ba ku nɔk, a fubuk, a rawu dang sɔ. <verse eid="MAT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" />Ama fɛ́ ba mi ku tegak, ba kaba ares wu ayet ibara icang. <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />Ama anɔng, ba sonong azɔng ba tsin ku tot. <verse eid="MAT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />Ba jɛk ikyɛng fi i sak ba ku tegak mo, ba basak ide abace wu: AYESO AGWƆM BAYAHUDA YO.<verse eid="MAT 27:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />Ba kin ku tegak gung nɛ bakpatang agap bakak bafaa, azining ni yak wu, azining ni men wu. <verse eid="MAT 27:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" />Banet fɛ́ ba se ni igosok, nye digit ice, nɛ ba tosong aYeso, <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" />na ba nye, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn anet fi i fɛ̀, i da yirik Kutu Iya Adakunom Ntong, i da ti nok iko ayɛt nkɔs ntaat, wɛt mara sheshek ice ngɔn kong awɛ? Ki ngɔn yet Arim Adakunom, tik naton kukum e in da di yit!&gt;&gt; <figure style="fig" alt="The Crucifixion of Jesus" file="WA03926b.tif" size="col" loc="MAT 27:40" copy="Wade Images" ref="27:32-40">Ba tegak aYeso</figure><verse eid="MAT 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41" />Kpaf anɔng, fɛ́ bagbat áware nɛ bafi itees ntsi aMusa nɛ bashɔn iwɔp ku tonoso ibyɛs bà nɛ ba nye, <verse eid="MAT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42" />&lt;&lt;A sheshek bakak, wɛt isheshek ice wu ku gaat! Ki iwu fɛ́ a yet Agbat aGwɔm aIsrela, won na a tik naton kukum kang, iyit da nɔɔk yit atsak ni iwu. <verse eid="MAT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" />Iwu te iyɛ na Adakunom, won Adakunom e ku sheshek, nek iwu nye, &lt;Imi yet Arim Adakunom.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />Kpaf anɔng, fɛ́ bakpatang agap e fɛ́ ba ka ba tegak gung ni iwu woso ku korok itok.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iku aYeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />Nkum kate inom sak ni itsɔm itaat, kurin yit mben e ngma kusum. <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" />Asamang itsɔm itaat, aYeso ta kutɔ nɛ agap, a fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Eloy, Eloy, lama sabaktani?&gt;&gt; I tonong, &lt;&lt;Adakunom hom, Adakunom hom, akyɛ sak fi ngɔn di wobok ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />Ni izen fɛ́ bakak fɛ́ ba se ni nyeseng azɔng, fok anɔng, ba fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Anet yong, tsin yes aIliya!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" />Ni izen izining, azining ayɛt ba, ta itsi, a tsɛ a sok asoso, a te iwu ayɛt ashi fɛ́ a se jatang, a tubuk asoso me ni ishɛn, a nabak aYeso nɛ fok na a sɔ. <verse eid="MAT 27:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />Awɛt bakak ayɛt ba fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Ku won yin, in da di yit, ki aIliya me da bɛ́ a ku sheshek e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />AYeso tɛ ta kutɔ na agap, a tun nsong wu.<verse eid="MAT 27:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />Ni izen e yɔng, kutaà fi ku tsang tɛnɛsɛ karɔ ajɛrɛ nitu iya Adakunom ntong, wat ku sarak nate, nkum naton sak aben. Ni izen e yɔng, mben zuut, ata woso sarak. <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />Nrɛk woso tarasa, nkom bafɛ́ ajɛrɛ, doro ni kutset, <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />ba wuru ayɛt arɛk bá, ama fɛ́ aYeso dorok, ba tseng gung ni iwu sak ni kuwɔp ajɛrɛ, banet dot ka ba yɛrɛ.<verse eid="MAT 27:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />Ni izen fɛ́ agbat batsom e, nɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba se ni itot aYeso me, di fi mben zuut, ni ikyɛng fi ite, nnyim ka ba yit, ba fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Na tsak e, anet e yong kin yet Arim Adakunom!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />Banyining dot kin se azɔng, ba kin se ni iyere ikyɛng fi i kin te yik-yik. Ba kin nɛ gung nɛ aYeso na aGalili, nɔng ba bin ku sɛs mo. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Ayɛt banyining e, kin yet aMarya afɛ́ aMagadala nɛ aMarya nggɔ aYakubu nɛ aYusufu ni nggɔ nnon aZebedi.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kunɛt aYeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />Fɛ́ kahwyɛ nye, arum akak fɛ́ a ne na Arimatiya, fɛ́ ba ku yes aYusufu, fi iwu ice wu a yet afi ikuus aYeso. <verse eid="MAT 27:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />A tsɛ narɔ aBilatus, a ra awon na ba ku nɔk kukom aYeso na tsɛ a nɛt, aBilatus nɔɔk kanu na ba ku nɔk iko. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />AYusufu sok kukom e, a kunung iko nɛ alinɛn fɛ́ a se cɛ́l, <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />a tsɛ a nɛt iko ni kurɛk kufas ku fuu fɛ́ a ta iko nasɔs kuta. A bingiring kuta kuratek, a di fam katisi me, a ma tseng. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />AMarya afɛ́ aMagadala nɛ aMarya azining e, ba kin se azɔng ashon irɛk e.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="s">Banet itosok kurɛk e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />Akatson, fi ku di kuus Kunom Inye Nkyɔrɔk Gyam e, bagbat áware nɛ BaFarasi tsɛ narɔ aBilatus. <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" />Ba fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Akɔk-ashon, iyit yiring yit, ni izen fɛ́ anet nbɔs yong se ni kutset, a kin fɛ̀, &lt;Ama nkɔs ntaat Imi bi dorok.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Nek anɔng, nɔɔk agbat ifɛ̀ nɛ ba tsɛ ba yɛrɛ kurɛk e, ma nnom ntaat e shining, kɔn bafi imɛɛs wu bi bɛ́, nɛ ba yi kukom e, na ba bɛ́ ba tak banet fok kukom e mi ti kudorok. Wat ni mbɔs nfi igang e nang, nat nfi imɛsɛng e ni imaan e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />ABilatus ka ba bun ni ifɛ̀ yɛ, &lt;&lt;Sok yin kudyɛng batsom fi i da tsi i di tot yin kurɛk e yɛt-yɛt.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />Nek anɔng, ba tsɛ ba fam kanu irɛk e yɛɛt, ba di rus nagang naton e, ba di sak batsom na ba tot iko.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="s">Ba dorok kukom aYeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />Kunom aSabat bi ku got, wɛt atuk imɛsɛng inyim nnom, aMarya afɛ́ aMagadala nɛ aMarya azining e, ba wuruk bop sak ni irɛk e.<verse eid="MAT 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />Ni izen izining, mben dorok in zuut makiyi, nek atomaza Adakunom akak, ne azanɛn, a bingiring kuta fi ku se nanu irɛk e, a di sonong naton ko. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />Nse wu se ti mgbey iza, nkum fɛ́ ares wu tɛrɛk ti itarang. <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />Wɛt nnyim yit batsom e gyet awo, nkum fɛ́ ba tiim nrɔm, ba wat ba sot ti nkom e.<verse eid="MAT 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />Atomaza me, fɛ̀ na banyining e, &lt;&lt;I bi fok yin nnyim awo, nek imi rēn fok i tsin tsɛt yin aYeso, ayɔng fɛ́ ba kin ku tegak. <verse eid="MAT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />A se azeng awo, ba mi ku donong, kpaf tɛ fɛ́ a kin ki tak yin. Bɛ́ da di yin karɔ fɛ́ ba kin ku mes mo. <verse eid="MAT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />Ti bun yin ziri ziri, i da tsi i tak yin bafi imɛɛs wu: &lt;A mi dorok ni ifaben, a mi yit irèn ashon yin sak na aGalili. Azɔng fi i da tsi i ku di yin.&gt; Di yin, in mi ki tak yin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />Wat ba won kurɛk e ayɛt nnyim nɛ kafa kakan makiyi. Ba ta itsi, nɔng ba da tsɛ ba tak bafi imɛɛs wu ifɛ̀ me. <verse eid="MAT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />Ba se na anɔng, aYeso nyim ni iba, a fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Show yin!&gt;&gt; Ba serek bakat ni iwu, ba di kpa na atak wu, ba ku ya ntong. <verse eid="MAT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;I bi fok yin nnyim awo, tsi tak yin baruneng na ba tseng sak na aGalili, ba da tsɛ ba di di azɔng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikyɛng fɛ́ Batsom tak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />Ni izen fɛ́ banyining e se ni irèn, bakak ayɛt batsom e, bun sak ayɛt iwɔp, ba tsɛ ba tak bagbat áware me ngma ikyɛng fi ite. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12" />Fɛ́ ba fok anɔng, bagbat áware nɛ bashɔn iwɔp, wat ba yes kazumung, ba tɔ ikyɛng inye, ba nɔɔk batsom e itsɔm dot, <verse eid="MAT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13" />ba fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Ikyɛng de fi iyin da fɛ̀ yin, &lt;Bafi imɛɛs wu bɛ́ natuk, ba yi kukom wu, iyit ni nda.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />Ki ifɛ̀ me nɔ ni ito agwɔmna, iyit rēn yit ikyɛng fi in da ku tak yit, vit inɛn fi i da ki sɛ yin.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Wat batsom e shan itsɔm e, ba nye kpaf tɛ ba di fɛ̀ ni iba. Ba rēn shara ifɛ̀ me deng nate baYahuda sak atut.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kucɛɛt fɛ́ aYeso nye sak <optbreak /> nɛ bafi imɛɛs wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />Bafi imɛɛs kusɔk abe azining e, tseng sak na aGalili, sak ni ihwyanang fɛ̀ aYeso fɛ̀ ni iba ba di tse. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />Ni izen fɛ́ ba ku di, ba ku ya ntong; ngma na anɔng bakak ba bɛ̀ ayɛ gak. <verse eid="MAT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Wat aYeso bang serek bakat ni iba, a fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Ba mi di nɔk ngma ice azanɛn nɛ kazatse. <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" />Nek anɔng, tseng yin, tsi tsɛt yin bafi imɛɛs ayɛt ícɛ́n azatse ngma kusum, ka ba ras yin abatisma ayɛt iyerek Ada, nɛ Arim e, nɛ Kabik aJɛrɛ, <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" />ka ba tees yin na ba nye ngma ikyɛng fi in ki tak yin. Rēn yin fok, imi se gung ni iyin kaakyi izen, sak igang azatse.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>